#: src/quick-start.md:26
msgid "Install [kubebuilder](https://sigs.k8s.io/kubebuilder):"
msgstr "安装 [kubebuilder](https://sigs.k8s.io/kubebuilder)："

#: src/quick-start.md:29
msgid ""
"# download kubebuilder and install locally.\n"
msgstr ""
"# 下载 kubebuilder 并在本地安装。\n"

#: src/quick-start.md:30
msgid "\"https://go.kubebuilder.io/dl/latest/$(go env GOOS)/$(go env GOARCH)\""
msgstr "\"https://go.kubebuilder.io/dl/latest/$(go env GOOS)/$(go env GOARCH)\""

#: src/quick-start.md:37
msgid "You can work with the master branch by cloning the repository and running `make install` to generate the binary. Please follow the steps in the section **How to Build Kubebuilder Locally** from the [Contributing Guide](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#how-to-build-kubebuilder-locally)."
msgstr "您可以通过克隆仓库并运行 `make install` 来生成二进制文件，从而使用主分支。请按照 [贡献指南](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#how-to-build-kubebuilder-locally) 中的 **如何在本地构建 Kubebuilder** 部分中的步骤进行操作。"

#: src/quick-start.md:45
msgid "Kubebuilder provides autocompletion support via the command `kubebuilder completion <bash|fish|powershell|zsh>`, which can save you a lot of typing. For further information see the [completion](./reference/completion.md) document."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 提供了通过命令 `kubebuilder completion <bash|fish|powershell|zsh>` 的自动补全支持，这可以节省你很多输入时间。有关更多信息，请参阅 [completion](./reference/completion.md) 文档。"

#: src/quick-start.md:49 src/getting-started.md:29
msgid "Create a project"
msgstr "创建一个项目"

#: src/quick-start.md:51
msgid "Create a directory, and then run the init command inside of it to initialize a new project. Below is an example:"
msgstr "创建一个目录，然后在其中运行 init 命令以初始化新项目。示例如下："

#: src/quick-start.md:62
msgid "If you initialize your project within [`GOPATH`](https://go.dev/doc/code.html#GOPATH), the implicitly called `go mod init` will interpolate the module path for you. Otherwise `--repo=<module path>` must be set."
msgstr "如果在 [`GOPATH`](https://go.dev/doc/code.html#GOPATH) 内初始化项目，隐式调用的 `go mod init` 会为您推导模块路径。否则必须设置 `--repo=<module path>`。"

#: src/quick-start.md:65
msgid "Read the [Go modules blogpost](https://blog.go.dev/using-go-modules) if unfamiliar with the module system."
msgstr "如果不熟悉模块系统，请阅读 [Go 模块博客文章](https://blog.go.dev/using-go-modules)。"

#: src/quick-start.md:69
msgid "Create an API"
msgstr "创建一个API"

#: src/quick-start.md:71
msgid "Run the following command to create a new API (group/version) as `webapp/v1` and the new Kind(CRD) `Guestbook` on it:"
msgstr "运行以下命令以创建一个新的 API（组/版本）`webapp/v1`，并在其上创建新的 Kind（CRD）`Guestbook`："

#: src/quick-start.md:80
msgid "If you press `y` for Create Resource \\[y/n\\] and for Create Controller \\[y/n\\] then this creates the files `api/v1/guestbook_types.go` where you define the API and the `internal/controller/guestbook_controller.go` where you implement the reconciliation business logic for this Kind(CRD)."
msgstr "如果在 Create Resource \\[y/n\\] 和 Create Controller \\[y/n\\] 时都选择 `y`，则会创建 `api/v1/guestbook_types.go`（用于定义 API）以及 `internal/controller/guestbook_controller.go`（用于实现该 Kind/CRD 的协调业务逻辑）。"

#: src/quick-start.md:85
msgid "**OPTIONAL:** Edit the API definition and the reconciliation business logic. For more info see [Designing an API](/cronjob-tutorial/api-design.md) and [What's in a Controller](cronjob-tutorial/controller-overview.md)."
msgstr "**可选：** 编辑 API 定义和调整业务逻辑。有关更多信息，请参见 [设计 API](/cronjob-tutorial/api-design.md) 和 [控制器中的内容](cronjob-tutorial/controller-overview.md)。"

#: src/quick-start.md:89
msgid "If you are editing the API definitions, generate the manifests such as Custom Resources (CRs) or Custom Resource Definitions (CRDs) using"
msgstr "如果您正在编辑 API 定义，请使用生成清单，例如自定义资源（CRs）或自定义资源定义（CRDs）。"

#: src/quick-start.md:99
msgid ""
"// GuestbookSpec defines the desired state of Guestbook\n"
msgstr ""
"// GuestbookSpec 定义了 Guestbook 的期望状态\n"

