#: src/getting-started.md:92
msgid "The controller also needs to track the status of operations done to manage the Memcached CR(s). This allows verification of the Custom Resource's description of your API and determines if everything occurred successfully or if any errors were encountered, similar to how you would with any resource from the Kubernetes API."
msgstr "控制器还需要跟踪为管理 Memcached CR 所执行操作的状态。这样可以核验自定义资源对 API 的描述，并判断是否全部成功或是否遇到错误，方式与处理任何 Kubernetes API 资源相同。"

