#: src/getting-started.md:110
msgid "Kubernetes has established conventions, and because of this, use Status Conditions here. Your custom APIs and controllers should behave like Kubernetes resources and their controllers, following these standards to ensure a consistent and intuitive experience."
msgstr "Kubernetes 已有约定，因此这里使用 Status Conditions。自定义 API 与控制器应表现得像 Kubernetes 资源及其控制器一样，遵循这些标准以确保一致且直观的体验。"

#: src/getting-started.md:115
