#: src/getting-started.md:702
msgid ""
"// If the size is not defined in the Custom Resource then we will set the desired replicas to 0\n"
msgstr ""
"// 若 Custom Resource 未定义 size，则将期望副本数设为 0\n"

#: src/getting-started.md:708
msgid ""
"// The CRD API defines that the Memcached type have a MemcachedSpec.Size field\n"
"\t// to set the quantity of Deployment instances to the desired state on the cluster.\n"
"\t// Therefore, the following code will ensure the Deployment size is the same as defined\n"
"\t// via the Size spec of the Custom Resource which we are reconciling.\n"
msgstr ""
"// CRD API 定义了 Memcached 类型具有一个 MemcachedSpec.Size 字段\n"
"\t// 用于设置集群中部署实例的数量到所需状态。\n"
"\t// 因此，以下代码将确保部署的大小与我们正在对账的\n"
"\t// 自定义资源的 Size 规格中定义的相同。\n"

#: src/getting-started.md:718
msgid ""
"// Re-fetch the memcached Custom Resource before updating the status\n"
"\t\t\t// so that we have the latest state of the resource on the cluster and we will avoid\n"
"\t\t\t// raising the error \"the object has been modified, please apply\n"
"\t\t\t// your changes to the latest version and try again\" which would re-trigger the reconciliation\n"
msgstr ""
"// 在更新状态之前重新获取 memcached 自定义资源，\n"
"\t\t\t// 以便我们能够获得集群中资源的最新状态，并避免\n"
"\t\t\t// 引发错误\"对象已被修改，请将您的更改应用于\n"
"\t\t\t// 最新版本并重试\"，这将重新触发调整。\n"

#: src/getting-started.md:729
msgid "\"Resizing\""
msgstr "\"Resizing\""

#: src/getting-started.md:730
msgid "\"Failed to update the size for the custom resource (%s): (%s)\""
msgstr "\"Failed to update the size for the custom resource (%s): (%s)\""

#: src/getting-started.md:740
msgid ""
"// Now, that we update the size we want to requeue the reconciliation\n"
"\t\t// so that we can ensure that we have the latest state of the resource before\n"
"\t\t// update. Also, it will help ensure the desired state on the cluster\n"
msgstr ""
"// 现在我们更新了大小，我们想要重新排队对账\n"
"\t\t// 以便确保在更新之前我们拥有资源的最新状态。\n"
"\t\t// 此外，它还将有助于确保集群上的期望状态。\n"

