#: src/getting-started.md:1196
msgid "Use Kubebuilder plugins to scaffold additional options"
msgstr "使用 Kubebuilder 插件脚手架附加选项"

#: src/getting-started.md:1198
msgid "Now that you have a better understanding of how to create your own API and controller, let’s scaffold in this project the plugin [`autoupdate.kubebuilder.io/v1-alpha`](./plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md) so that your project can be kept up to date with the latest Kubebuilder releases scaffolding changes and consequently adopt improvements from the ecosystem."
msgstr "在更好理解如何创建自有 API 与控制器后，让我们在本项目中脚手架插件 [`autoupdate.kubebuilder.io/v1-alpha`](./plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md)，以便项目能跟进最新 Kubebuilder 发行版的脚手架变更，从而采用生态中的改进。"

#: src/getting-started.md:1203 src/plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md:30
msgid ""
"```shell\n"
"kubebuilder edit --plugins=\"autoupdate/v1-alpha\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```shell\n"
"kubebuilder edit --plugins=\"autoupdate/v1-alpha\"\n"
"```"

#: src/getting-started.md:1207
msgid "Inspect the file `.github/workflows/auto-update.yml` to see how it works."
msgstr "查看 `.github/workflows/auto-update.yml` 文件以了解其工作方式。"

#: src/getting-started.md:1209
msgid "Checking the project running in the cluster"
msgstr "检查集群中运行的项目"

#: src/getting-started.md:1211
msgid "At this point you can check the steps to validate the project on the cluster by looking the steps defined in the Quick Start, see: [Run It On the Cluster](./quick-start#run-it-on-the-cluster)"
msgstr "此时，您可以通过查看快速入门中定义的步骤来检查在集群上验证项目的步骤，请参见：[在集群上运行](./quick-start#run-it-on-the-cluster)。"

#: src/getting-started.md:1217
msgid "To delve deeper into developing your solution, consider going through the [CronJob Tutorial](./cronjob-tutorial/cronjob-tutorial.md)"
msgstr "若要更深入地开发解决方案，可继续阅读 [CronJob 教程](./cronjob-tutorial/cronjob-tutorial.md)"

#: src/getting-started.md:1218
msgid "For insights on optimizing your approach, refer to the [Best Practices](./reference/good-practices.md) documentation."
msgstr "有关优化您方法的见解，请参阅[最佳实践](./reference/good-practices.md)文档。"

#: src/getting-started.md:1223
msgid "Now that you have a better understanding, you might want to check out the [Deploy Image](./plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md) Plugin. This plugin allows users to scaffold APIs/Controllers to deploy and manage an Operand (image) on the cluster. It provides scaffolds similar to the ones in this guide, along with additional features such as tests implemented for your controller."
msgstr "在更好理解之后，可以了解 [Deploy Image](./plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md) 插件。该插件可脚手架用于在集群上部署并管理 Operand（镜像）的 API/控制器，提供与本指南类似的脚手架，并附带为控制器实现的测试等额外功能。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/cronjob-tutorial.md:3
msgid "Too many tutorials start out with some really contrived setup, or some toy application that gets the basics across, and then stalls out on the more complicated stuff.  Instead, this tutorial should take you through (almost) the full gamut of complexity with Kubebuilder, starting off simple and building up to something pretty full-featured."
msgstr "太多教程开始时使用一些非常生硬的设置，或者是一些简单应用来讲解基础知识，然后在更复杂的内容上停滞不前。相反，本教程将带您几乎体验 Kubebuilder 的全部复杂性，从简单开始，逐渐构建到一个功能齐全的应用。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/cronjob-tutorial.md:9
msgid "Pretend (and sure, this is a teensy bit contrived) that you have finally gotten tired of the maintenance burden of the non-Kubebuilder implementation of the CronJob controller in Kubernetes, and you'd like to rewrite it using Kubebuilder."
msgstr "假设（是的，这有点牵强）你终于厌倦了维护 Kubernetes 中非 Kubebuilder 实现的 CronJob 控制器的负担，并希望用 Kubebuilder 重写它。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/cronjob-tutorial.md:14
msgid "The job (no pun intended) of the _CronJob_ controller is to run one-off tasks on the Kubernetes cluster at regular intervals.  It does this by building on top of the _Job_ controller, whose task is to run one-off tasks once, seeing them to completion."
msgstr "_CronJob_ 控制器的工作（并不是双关）是在 Kubernetes 集群中定期运行一次性任务。它是通过在 _Job_ 控制器之上构建来实现这一目标的，_Job_ 控制器的任务是一次性运行任务，并确保其完成。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/cronjob-tutorial.md:19
msgid "Instead of trying to tackle rewriting the Job controller as well, use this as an opportunity to see how to interact with external types."
msgstr "不必同时重写 Job 控制器，把这当作学习如何与外部类型交互的机会。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/cronjob-tutorial.md:26
msgid "Note that most of this tutorial is generated from literate Go files that live in the book source directory: [docs/book/src/cronjob-tutorial/testdata](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/docs/book/src/cronjob-tutorial/testdata).  The full, runnable project lives in [project](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/docs/book/src/cronjob-tutorial/testdata/project), while intermediate files live directly under the [testdata](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/docs/book/src/cronjob-tutorial/testdata) directory."
msgstr "请注意，本教程的大部分内容来自于位于书籍源目录中的文档化 Go 文件：[docs/book/src/cronjob-tutorial/testdata](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/docs/book/src/cronjob-tutorial/testdata)。完整的可运行项目位于 [project](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/docs/book/src/cronjob-tutorial/testdata/project)，而中间文件则直接位于 [testdata](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/docs/book/src/cronjob-tutorial/testdata) 目录下。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/cronjob-tutorial.md:35
msgid "Scaffolding out our project"
msgstr "搭建我们的项目"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/cronjob-tutorial.md:37
msgid "As covered in the [quick start](../quick-start.md), scaffold out a new project.  Make sure you have [installed Kubebuilder](../quick-start.md#installation), then scaffold out a new project:"
msgstr "正如在[快速入门](../quick-start.md)中所述，我们需要搭建一个新的项目。请确保您已[安装 Kubebuilder](../quick-start.md#installation)，然后搭建一个新项目："

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/cronjob-tutorial.md:43
msgid ""
"# create a project directory, and then run the init command.\n"
msgstr ""
"# 创建一个项目目录，然后运行初始化命令。\n"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/cronjob-tutorial.md:45
msgid ""
"# This example uses a domain of tutorial.kubebuilder.io,\n"
msgstr ""
"# 本示例使用域名 tutorial.kubebuilder.io，\n"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/cronjob-tutorial.md:53
msgid "Your project's name defaults to that of your current working directory. You can pass `--project-name=<dns1123-label-string>` to set a different project name."
msgstr "您项目的名称默认为您当前工作目录的名称。您可以通过传递 `--project-name=<dns1123-label-string>` 来设置不同的项目名称。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/cronjob-tutorial.md:58
msgid "Now that you have a project in place, take a look at what Kubebuilder has scaffolded so far..."
msgstr "现在项目已经就绪，来看看 Kubebuilder 目前脚手架了哪些内容……"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/basic-project.md:3
msgid "When scaffolding out a new project, Kubebuilder provides us with a few basic pieces of boilerplate."
