msgstr "核心 [controller-runtime](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime?tab=doc) 库"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/empty-main.md:25
msgid "The default controller-runtime logging, [Zap](https://pkg.go.dev/go.uber.org/zap) (more on that a bit later)"
msgstr "controller-runtime 默认日志库 [Zap](https://pkg.go.dev/go.uber.org/zap)（稍后详述）"

