msgstr "\"k8s.io/client-go/plugin/pkg/client/auth/gcp\""

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/empty-main.md:45
msgid "\"sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/cache\""
msgstr "\"sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/cache\""

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/empty-main.md:55
msgid "Every set of controllers needs a [_Scheme_](https://book.kubebuilder.io/cronjob-tutorial/gvks.html#err-but-whats-that-scheme-thing), which provides mappings between Kinds and their corresponding Go types.  We'll talk a bit more about Kinds when we write our API definition, so just keep this in mind for later."
msgstr "每组控制器都需要一个 [_Scheme_](https://book.kubebuilder.io/cronjob-tutorial/gvks.html#err-but-whats-that-scheme-thing)，用于在 Kind 与对应 Go 类型之间提供映射。编写 API 定义时会再谈 Kind，此处先记住即可。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/empty-main.md:76
msgid "At this point, our main function is fairly simple:"
msgstr "此时 main 函数相当简单："

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/empty-main.md:78
msgid "We set up some basic flags for metrics."
msgstr "我们为 metrics 设置一些基本标志。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/empty-main.md:80
msgid "We instantiate a [_manager_](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/manager?tab=doc#Manager), which keeps track of running all of our controllers, as well as setting up shared caches and clients to the API server (notice we tell the manager about our Scheme)."
msgstr "我们实例化一个 [_manager_](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/manager?tab=doc#Manager)，它负责运行所有控制器，并设置共享缓存与到 API 服务器的客户端（注意我们把 Scheme 告诉了 manager）。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/empty-main.md:86
msgid "We run our manager, which in turn runs all of our controllers and webhooks. The manager is set up to run until it receives a graceful shutdown signal. This way, when we're running on Kubernetes, we behave nicely with graceful pod termination."
msgstr "我们运行 manager，进而运行所有控制器与 webhook。manager 会一直运行直到收到优雅关闭信号。这样在 Kubernetes 上运行时，能与 Pod 优雅终止良好配合。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/empty-main.md:91
msgid "While we don't have anything to run just yet, remember where that `+kubebuilder:scaffold:builder` comment is -- things'll get interesting there soon."
msgstr "虽然现在还没什么可运行，请记住 `+kubebuilder:scaffold:builder` 注释的位置——很快那里会变得有趣。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/empty-main.md:102
msgid "\":8080\""
msgstr "\":8080\""

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/empty-main.md:102
msgid "\"The address the metric endpoint binds to.\""
