#: src/cronjob-tutorial/api-design.md:84
msgid "Fundamentally a CronJob needs the following pieces:"
msgstr "从根本上说，CronJob 需要以下几部分："

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/api-design.md:86
msgid "A schedule (the _cron_ in CronJob)"
msgstr "一个调度表达式（CronJob 中的 _cron_）"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/api-design.md:87
msgid "A template for the Job to run (the _job_ in CronJob)"
msgstr "要运行的 Job 模板（CronJob 中的 _job_）"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/api-design.md:90
msgid "We'll also want a few extras, which will make our users' lives easier:"
msgstr "还需要一些额外项，让用户更省心："

