msgid "Finally, we add this reconciler to the manager, so that it gets started when the manager is started."
msgstr "最后把该 reconciler 加入 manager，以便 manager 启动时一并启动。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/controller-overview.md:131
msgid "For now, we just note that this reconciler operates on `CronJob`s.  Later, we'll use this to mark that we care about related objects as well."
msgstr "目前只标明该 reconciler 操作 `CronJob`。稍后会用此标记我们也关心相关对象。"

