msgstr "Kubernetes 使用乐观并发，意味着任何更新（包括 status 更新）都可能更改资源版本。若继续用过期副本协调，后续更新可能因冲突失败，例如：\"the object has been modified; please apply your changes to the latest version and try again\"。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/controller-implementation.md:202
msgid "By re-fetching here, we keep our reconciliation logic in sync with the actual cluster state and avoid unnecessary conflicts and requeues."
msgstr "在此重新获取可使协调逻辑与实际集群状态同步，避免不必要的冲突与重新入队。"

