#: src/cronjob-tutorial/controller-implementation.md:528
msgid "If this object is suspended, we don't want to run any jobs, so we'll stop now. This is useful if something's broken with the job we're running and we want to pause runs to investigate or putz with the cluster, without deleting the object."
msgstr "若此对象被挂起，我们不想运行任何 Job，因此到此停止。当正在运行的 Job 出了问题、想暂停运行以排查或调整集群而又不想删除对象时，这很有用。"

