msgstr "5：获取下次计划运行"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/controller-implementation.md:543
msgid "If we're not paused, we'll need to calculate the next scheduled run, and whether or not we've got a run that we haven't processed yet."
msgstr "若未暂停，需计算下次计划运行，以及是否还有未处理的运行。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/controller-implementation.md:547
msgid "We'll calculate the next scheduled time using our helpful cron library. We'll start calculating appropriate times from our last run, or the creation of the CronJob if we can't find a last run."
msgstr "我们将使用方便的 cron 库计算下次计划时间。从上次运行开始计算合适时间；若找不到上次运行，则从 CronJob 创建时开始。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/controller-implementation.md:551
msgid "If there are too many missed runs and we don't have any deadlines set, we'll bail so that we don't cause issues on controller restarts or wedges."
msgstr "如果错过的运行太多且未设置任何截止时间，我们将退出，以免在控制器重启或卡住时引发问题。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/controller-implementation.md:554
msgid "Otherwise, we'll just return the missed runs (of which we'll just use the latest), and the next run, so that we can know when it's time to reconcile again."
msgstr "否则返回错过的运行（只用最新一次）和下次运行，以便知道何时再次协调。"

