"\t\t// we could reconstitute this here, but there's not much point, since we've\n"
"\t\t// just updated it.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 为优化，略取巧地从上次观测到的运行时间开始\n"
"\t\t// we could reconstitute this here, but there's not much point, since we've\n"
