#: src/cronjob-tutorial/webhook-implementation.md:189
#: src/multiversion-tutorial/webhooks.md:158
msgid "The `ValidateCreate`, `ValidateUpdate` and `ValidateDelete` methods are expected to validate its receiver upon creation, update and deletion respectively. We separate out ValidateCreate from ValidateUpdate to allow behavior like making certain fields immutable, so that they can only be set on creation. ValidateDelete is also separated from ValidateUpdate to allow different validation behavior on deletion. Here, however, we just use the same shared validation for `ValidateCreate` and `ValidateUpdate`. And we do nothing in `ValidateDelete`, since we don't need to validate anything on deletion."
msgstr "`ValidateCreate`、`ValidateUpdate` 与 `ValidateDelete` 方法应分别在创建、更新与删除时校验其接收者。我们将 ValidateCreate 与 ValidateUpdate 分开，以允许诸如使某些字段不可变、仅能在创建时设置之类的行为。ValidateDelete 也与 ValidateUpdate 分开，以允许删除时不同的校验行为。但在这里，我们对 `ValidateCreate` 与 `ValidateUpdate` 使用相同的共享校验。而在 `ValidateDelete` 中什么也不做，因为删除时无需校验任何内容。"

