#: src/cronjob-tutorial/running.md:36
msgid "If you want to run the webhooks locally, you'll have to generate certificates for serving the webhooks, and place them in the right directory (`/tmp/k8s-webhook-server/serving-certs/tls.{crt,key}`, by default)."
