#: src/cronjob-tutorial/running-webhook.md:183
msgid "Wait a while till the webhook pod comes up and the certificates are provisioned. It usually completes within 1 minute."
msgstr "请稍等，直到 webhook pod 启动并且证书被配置。通常在 1 分钟内完成。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/running-webhook.md:186
msgid "Now you can create a valid CronJob to test your webhooks. The creation should successfully go through."
msgstr "现在您可以创建一个有效的 CronJob 来测试您的 webhooks。创建过程应该成功完成。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/running-webhook.md:193
msgid "You can also try to create an invalid CronJob (e.g. use an ill-formatted schedule field). You should see a creation failure with a validation error."
msgstr "您还可以尝试创建一个无效的 CronJob（例如，使用格式不正确的调度字段）。您应该会看到创建失败并出现验证错误。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/running-webhook.md:199
msgid "When you deploy a webhook into the same cluster that it will validate, you can run into a _bootstrapping issue_: the webhook may try to validate the creation of its own Pod before it’s actually running. This can block the webhook from ever starting."
msgstr "当你把 Webhook 部署到它将要校验的同一集群时，可能遇到*引导问题*：Webhook 可能在自身真正运行之前就尝试校验自己的 Pod 创建。这会阻止 Webhook 永远启动。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/running-webhook.md:203
msgid "To avoid this, make sure the webhook **ignores its own resources**. You can do this in one of two ways:"
msgstr "为避免此问题，请确保 Webhook **忽略自身资源**。可用以下两种方式之一："

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/running-webhook.md:206
msgid "**[namespaceSelector](https://github.com/kubernetes/api/blob/kubernetes-1.14.5/admissionregistration/v1beta1/types.go#L189-L233)** – label the namespace where the webhook runs and configure the webhook to skip it."
msgstr "**[namespaceSelector](https://github.com/kubernetes/api/blob/kubernetes-1.14.5/admissionregistration/v1beta1/types.go#L189-L233)** – 为 Webhook 运行所在命名空间打标签，并配置 Webhook 跳过它。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/running-webhook.md:207
msgid "**[objectSelector](https://github.com/kubernetes/api/blob/kubernetes-1.15.2/admissionregistration/v1beta1/types.go#L262-L274)** – label the webhook’s own Pods or Deployments and exclude those objects directly."
msgstr "**[objectSelector](https://github.com/kubernetes/api/blob/kubernetes-1.15.2/admissionregistration/v1beta1/types.go#L262-L274)** – 为 Webhook 自身的 Pod 或 Deployment 打标签，并直接排除这些对象。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/running-webhook.md:209
msgid "See the complete step-by-step guide: **[Webhook Bootstrap Problem](../reference/webhook-bootstrap-problem.md)**"
msgstr "完整分步指南见：**[Webhook 引导问题](../reference/webhook-bootstrap-problem.md)**"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:1
msgid "Writing controller tests"
msgstr "编写控制器测试"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:3
msgid "Testing Kubernetes controllers is a big subject, and the boilerplate testing files generated for you by kubebuilder are fairly minimal."
msgstr "测试 Kubernetes 控制器是一个大主题，而 kubebuilder 为您生成的样板测试文件相对较少。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:6
msgid "To walk you through integration testing patterns for Kubebuilder-generated controllers, this guide revisits the CronJob built in the first tutorial and writes a simple test for it."
msgstr "为了引导您了解用于 Kubebuilder 生成的控制器的集成测试模式，我们将重新审视在首个教程中构建的 CronJob，并为其编写一个简单的测试。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:8
msgid "The basic approach is that, in your generated `suite_test.go` file, you uses envtest to create a local Kubernetes API server, instantiate and run your controllers, and then write additional `*_test.go` files to test it using [Ginkgo](http://onsi.github.io/ginkgo)."
msgstr "基本的方法是，在您生成的 `suite_test.go` 文件中，您将使用 envtest 创建一个本地 Kubernetes API 服务器，实例化并运行您的控制器，然后编写额外的 `*_test.go` 文件，通过 [Ginkgo](http://onsi.github.io/ginkgo) 来进行测试。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:10
msgid "If you want to tinker with how your envtest cluster is configured, see section [Configuring envtest for integration tests](../reference/envtest.md) as well as the [`envtest docs`](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/envtest?tab=doc)."
msgstr "如果您想要调整您的 envtest 集群的配置，请参阅[为集成测试配置 envtest](../reference/envtest.md)一节，以及[`envtest 文档`](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/envtest?tab=doc)。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:15
msgid "If you would like to see additional examples of controller tests generated by Kubebuilder, take a look at the <a href=\"../plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md\">Deploy Image plugin (deploy-image/v1-alpha)</a>. This plugin scaffolds APIs and controllers for managing an Operand (container image) on a cluster, following recommended patterns."
msgstr "若想查看 Kubebuilder 生成的更多控制器测试示例，请参阅 <a href=\"../plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md\">Deploy Image 插件（deploy-image/v1-alpha）</a>。该插件按推荐模式为在集群上管理 Operand（容器镜像）脚手架生成 API 与控制器。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:18
msgid "The plugin abstracts much of the complexity of managing Deployments while still allowing you to customize the generated code. When you enable it, the plugin also generates a controller test that uses <a href=\"../reference/envtest.md\">ENV TEST</a> to verify that the controller creates the expected Deployment."
msgstr "该插件抽象了管理 Deployment 的大量复杂性，同时仍允许你自定义生成的代码。启用后，插件还会生成使用 <a href=\"../reference/envtest.md\">ENV TEST</a> 的控制器测试，以验证控制器创建了期望的 Deployment。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:21
msgid "An example of this test can be found under the `testdata` directory in the Kubebuilder repository: <a href=\"https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/testdata/project-v4-with-plugins/internal/controller/busybox_controller_test.go\">testdata/project-v4-with-plugins/internal/controller/busybox_controller_test.go</a>."
msgstr "此测试的示例可在 Kubebuilder 仓库的 `testdata` 目录下找到：<a href=\"https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/testdata/project-v4-with-plugins/internal/controller/busybox_controller_test.go\">testdata/project-v4-with-plugins/internal/controller/busybox_controller_test.go</a>。"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:25
msgid "Test environment setup"
msgstr "测试环境设置"

#: src/cronjob-tutorial/writing-tests.md:45
msgid "When we created the CronJob API with `kubebuilder create api` in a [previous chapter](/cronjob-tutorial/new-api.md), Kubebuilder already did some test work for you. Kubebuilder scaffolded a `internal/controller/suite_test.go` file that does the bare bones of setting up a test environment."
msgstr "当我们在[上一章](/cronjob-tutorial/new-api.md)用 `kubebuilder create api` 创建 CronJob API 时，Kubebuilder 已为你做了一些测试工作。Kubebuilder 脚手架生成了 `internal/controller/suite_test.go`，完成了测试环境的基础设置。"

