#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:110
msgid "\"*/1\""
msgstr "\"*/1\""

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:87
msgid "Then, create it on the cluster:"
msgstr "然后，我们可以在集群上创建它："

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:93
msgid "If you have done everything correctly, it should create successfully, and you should be able to fetch it using both the v2 resource"
msgstr "如果我们一切都做对了，它应该会成功创建，我们应该能够通过 v2 资源来获取它。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:139
msgid "and the v1 resource"
msgstr "和 v1 资源"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:182
msgid "Both should be filled out, and look equivalent to the v2 and v1 samples, respectively.  Notice that each has a different API version."
msgstr "两者都应该填写，并且看起来与我们的 v2 和 v1 示例各自相当。请注意，每个都有不同的 API 版本。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:185
msgid "Finally, if you wait a bit, you should notice that the CronJob continues to reconcile, even though the controller is written against the v1 API version."
msgstr "最后，如果我们等一会儿，我们应该注意到我们的 CronJob 继续进行调整，尽管我们的控制器是针对我们的 v1 API 版本编写的。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:192
msgid "When accessing API types from Go code, you ask for a specific version by using that version's Go type (e.g. `batchv2.CronJob`)."
msgstr "当我们从 Go 代码访问我们的 API 类型时，我们通过使用该版本的 Go 类型（例如 `batchv2.CronJob`）来请求特定版本。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:195
msgid "You might've noticed that the above invocations of kubectl looked a little different from the usual approach -- namely, they specify a _group-version-resource_, instead of just a resource."
msgstr "您可能注意到，上述的 kubectl 调用与我们通常的做法略有不同 — 具体来说，它们指定了一个_组-版本-资源_，而不仅仅是一个资源。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:199
msgid "When you write `kubectl get cronjob`, kubectl needs to figure out which group-version-resource that maps to.  To do this, it uses the _discovery API_ to figure out the preferred version of the `cronjob` resource.  For CRDs, this is more-or-less the latest stable version (see the [CRD docs](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/extend-kubernetes/custom-resources/custom-resource-definition-versioning/#version-priority \"Versions in CustomResourceDefinitions\") for specific details)."
msgstr "当我们输入 `kubectl get cronjob` 时，kubectl 需要确定哪个组-版本-资源与之对应。为此，它使用 _发现 API_ 来找出 `cronjob` 资源的首选版本。对于自定义资源定义（CRD），这基本上是最新的稳定版本（有关具体细节，请参见[CRD 文档](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/extend-kubernetes/custom-resources/custom-resource-definition-versioning/#version-priority \"Versions in CustomResourceDefinitions\")）。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:205
msgid "With the updates to CronJob, this means that `kubectl get cronjob` fetches the `batch/v2` group-version."
msgstr "通过我们对 CronJob 的更新，这意味着 `kubectl get cronjob` 将获取 `batch/v2` 组版本。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:208
msgid "To specify an exact version, use `kubectl get resource.version.group`, as shown above."
msgstr "要指定确切版本，请使用 `kubectl get resource.version.group`，如上所示。"

#: src/multiversion-tutorial/deployment.md:211
msgid "_**You should always use fully-qualified group-version-resource syntax in scripts**_.  `kubectl get resource` is for humans, self-aware robots, and other sentient beings that can figure out new versions.  `kubectl get resource.version.group` is for everything else."
msgstr "_**在脚本中始终使用完整的群组-版本-资源语法**_。 `kubectl get resource` 是为人类、自我意识的机器人以及其他能够识别新版本的有意识生物设计的。 `kubectl get resource.version.group` 则适用于所有其他情况。"

#: src/migrations.md:3
msgid "Upgrading your Kubebuilder project to the latest version ensures you benefit from new features, bug fixes, and ecosystem improvements. It is recommended to keep your project aligned with ecosystem changes."
msgstr "将 Kubebuilder 项目升级到最新版本，可获得新功能、缺陷修复与生态改进。建议让项目与生态变更保持同步。"

#: src/migrations.md:6
msgid "Migration may involve updating to a newer plugin version (e.g., from `go.kubebuilder.io/v3` in release 3.x to `go.kubebuilder.io/v4` in release 4.x) or updating the scaffold produced by the same plugin across CLI releases (e.g., from `v4.9.0` to `v4.10.1`)."
msgstr "迁移可能包括升级到更新的插件版本（例如从 3.x 发行版的 `go.kubebuilder.io/v3` 到 4.x 的 `go.kubebuilder.io/v4`），或在同一插件下跨 CLI 发行版更新脚手架（例如从 `v4.9.0` 到 `v4.10.1`）。"

#: src/migrations.md:8
msgid "Kubebuilder provides multiple migration paths to suit your workflow. Choose the approach that best fits your needs."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 提供多种迁移路径以适应不同工作流。请选择最适合您的方式。"

#: src/migrations.md:13
msgid "From Kubebuilder `v3.0.0` onwards, all inputs used by Kubebuilder are tracked in the [PROJECT](./reference/project-config.md) file. If you use the CLI to generate your scaffolds, this file will record the project's configuration and metadata, enabling all automation tools to work effectively."
msgstr "从 Kubebuilder `v3.0.0` 起，CLI 使用的全部输入都会记录在 [PROJECT](./reference/project-config.md) 文件中。若使用 CLI 生成脚手架，该文件会记录项目配置与元数据，从而使各类自动化工具有效工作。"

#: src/migrations.md:17
msgid "It is recommended to use the CLI to scaffold all resources (`kubebuilder create api`, `kubebuilder create webhook`, etc.) whenever possible, including controllers and webhooks for external types. The CLI has been continuously improved over time to address various options and needs. This ensures all resources are tracked in the PROJECT file, which automation tools (alpha update, alpha generate, autoupdate plugin) depend on."
msgstr "建议尽可能用 CLI 脚手架所有资源（`kubebuilder create api`、`kubebuilder create webhook` 等），包括针对外部类型的控制器与 Webhook。CLI 持续改进以覆盖更多选项与需求。这样所有资源都会记录在 PROJECT 文件中，而自动化工具（alpha update、alpha generate、autoupdate 插件）都依赖该文件。"

#: src/migrations.md:27
msgid "After using the CLI to create your project, you are free to customize the business logic and add features as you see fit. However, it is not recommended to deviate from the proposed project layout unless you know what you are doing."
msgstr "使用 CLI 创建项目后，可以按需自定义业务逻辑并添加功能。但除非清楚后果，否则不建议偏离推荐的项目布局。"

#: src/migrations.md:30
msgid "For example, you should refrain from moving the scaffolded files, as doing so may make it difficult to upgrade your project in the future. You may also lose the ability to use some of the CLI features and helpers."
msgstr "例如，应避免移动脚手架生成的文件，否则日后升级会更困难，也可能无法再使用部分 CLI 功能与辅助工具。"

#: src/migrations.md:33
msgid "Projects that do not use the CLI to generate scaffolds, or that deviate heavily from the proposed layout, may need to use the manual migration process, as automated migration tools might not work properly while the [alpha update](./reference/commands/alpha_update.md) and [AutoUpdate Plugin](./plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md) are designed to do a 3-way merge to keep your customizations intact."
msgstr "未使用 CLI 生成脚手架，或严重偏离推荐布局的项目，可能需要走手动迁移流程，因为自动化迁移工具可能无法正常工作；而 [alpha update](./reference/commands/alpha_update.md) 与 [AutoUpdate 插件](./plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md) 设计为通过三方合并保留您的自定义内容。"

#: src/migrations.md:38
msgid "For further information on the project layout, see [What's in a basic project?](./cronjob-tutorial/basic-project.md)"
msgstr "关于项目布局的更多信息，参见[一个基本项目都包含了什么？](./cronjob-tutorial/basic-project.md)"

#: src/migrations.md:42
msgid "Migration options"
msgstr "迁移选项"

#: src/migrations.md:45
msgid "\\[!TIP\\] **Recommended:** Enable the [AutoUpdate Plugin](./plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md) (GitHub Actions) to reduce effort. You can also run [alpha update](./reference/commands/alpha_update.md) locally—both use the same update logic. Use the other options mainly for older projects that do not have `cliVersion` in the `PROJECT` file as a one-time step to reach a supported version; after that, use these workflows for future updates (older versions cannot use these automation features)."
msgstr "\\[!TIP\\] **推荐：** 启用 [AutoUpdate 插件](./plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md)（GitHub Actions）以减少工作量。也可在本地运行 [alpha update](./reference/commands/alpha_update.md)——两者使用相同的更新逻辑。其他选项主要用于 `PROJECT` 文件中尚无 `cliVersion` 的旧项目，作为一次性步骤升级到受支持版本；之后再用上述工作流进行后续更新（更旧版本无法使用这些自动化功能）。"

#: src/migrations.md:48
msgid "**(Recommended)** AutoUpdate/GitHub Action: Get Notified of New Kubebuilder Releases via Issues with a PR Link to Review and Upgrade"
msgstr "**（推荐）** AutoUpdate/GitHub Action：通过带有 PR 链接的 Issue 获知新的 Kubebuilder 发行版，以便审阅与升级"

#: src/migrations.md:50
msgid "The [AutoUpdate Plugin](./plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md) scaffolds an action that automatically monitors for new Kubebuilder releases and opens a GitHub Issue with a Pull Request compare link when updates are available. This is ideal for keeping your project up to date with minimal manual work."
msgstr "[AutoUpdate 插件](./plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md) 会脚手架一个 Action：自动监控新的 Kubebuilder 发行版，并在有更新时打开带有 Pull Request 对比链接的 GitHub Issue。适合以最少人工工作保持项目最新。"

#: src/migrations.md:54
msgid "This plugin provides a mechanism similar to Dependabot for GitHub, offering continuous updates with AI assistance for projects that follow the standard scaffold."
msgstr "该插件提供类似 GitHub Dependabot 的机制，为遵循标准脚手架的项目提供带 AI 辅助的持续更新。"

#: src/migrations.md:64
msgid "Requires GitHub repository (GitHub Actions workflow)"
msgstr "需要 GitHub 仓库（GitHub Actions 工作流）"

#: src/migrations.md:65
msgid "Requires branch protection rules for safety (recommended)"
msgstr "为安全起见需要分支保护规则（推荐）"

#: src/migrations.md:66
msgid "Needs the same requirements as `alpha update` (see below)"
msgstr "需要与 `alpha update` 相同的前提条件（见下文）"

#: src/migrations.md:70
msgid "See the [AutoUpdate Plugin documentation](./plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md) for complete details."
msgstr "完整说明见 [AutoUpdate 插件文档](./plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md)。"

#: src/migrations.md:72
msgid "**(Recommended)** Use `alpha update` to Upgrade Without Losing Customisations (Logic Behind AutoUpdate/GitHub Action)"
msgstr "**（推荐）** 使用 `alpha update` 升级且不丢失自定义内容（即 AutoUpdate/GitHub Action 背后的逻辑）"

#: src/migrations.md:74
msgid "If you prefer to run updates locally instead of relying on GitHub Actions, you can use the same logic as the [AutoUpdate Plugin](./plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md) directly from your command line."
msgstr "若希望在本地运行更新而不依赖 GitHub Actions，可在命令行直接使用与 [AutoUpdate 插件](./plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md) 相同的逻辑。"

#: src/migrations.md:81
msgid "This command uses the same underlying mechanism as the AutoUpdate Plugin. You can migrate your project, resolve any conflicts if needed, and then push a Pull Request from your local environment."
msgstr "该命令与 AutoUpdate 插件使用相同底层机制。您可以迁移项目、按需解决冲突，然后从本地环境推送 Pull Request。"

#: src/migrations.md:87
msgid "Requires projects created with Kubebuilder **`v4.5.0`** or later"
msgstr "要求项目由 Kubebuilder **`v4.5.0`** 或更高版本创建"

#: src/migrations.md:88
msgid "For projects created before `v4.6.0`: the CLI version is not tracked in the `PROJECT` file, so you may need to use `alpha generate` first to establish a baseline"
msgstr "对于 `v4.6.0` 之前创建的项目：`PROJECT` 文件未记录 CLI 版本，可能需要先用 `alpha generate` 建立基线"

#: src/migrations.md:89
msgid "For projects created with `v4.6.0`+: includes `cliVersion` in the `PROJECT` file for automatic version detection"
msgstr "对于 `v4.6.0` 及之后创建的项目：`PROJECT` 文件包含 `cliVersion`，可自动检测版本"

#: src/migrations.md:93
msgid "See the [`alpha update` command reference](./reference/commands/alpha_update.md) for all options and flags."
msgstr "全部选项与标志见 [`alpha update` 命令参考](./reference/commands/alpha_update.md)。"

#: src/migrations.md:95
msgid "Regenerate with Help and Merge Manually"
msgstr "借助工具重新生成并手动合并"

#: src/migrations.md:97
msgid "The `kubebuilder alpha generate` command re-scaffolds your entire project based on your `PROJECT` file configuration. You can then manually compare and merge your custom code. For example, you can use it to regenerate your project after upgrading the Kubebuilder CLI version and then, manually use an IDE or `git diff` to compare and merge changes by hand into your existing codebase to ensure that all your changes apply in a new scaffold."
msgstr "`kubebuilder alpha generate` 会根据 `PROJECT` 文件配置重新脚手架整个项目，之后可手动对比并合并自定义代码。例如，可在升级 Kubebuilder CLI 后用它重新生成项目，再用 IDE 或 `git diff` 手动将变更合并回现有代码库，确保自定义内容落在新脚手架上。"

#: src/migrations.md:103
msgid "This approach is useful for projects that heavily customize the scaffold or when other migration methods are not available. You might need to use this method only once to establish a baseline for future automated updates."
msgstr "该方法适用于大量自定义脚手架、或其他迁移方式不可用的项目。通常只需用一次以建立基线，供后续自动化更新使用。"

#: src/migrations.md:114
msgid "Requires a `PROJECT` file (projects created with Kubebuilder **v3.0.0** or later)"
msgstr "需要 `PROJECT` 文件（Kubebuilder **v3.0.0** 及之后创建的项目）"

#: src/migrations.md:115
msgid "Only re-scaffolds resources that the CLI created and tracks in the `PROJECT` file"
msgstr "仅重新脚手架由 CLI 创建并记录在 `PROJECT` 文件中的资源"

#: src/migrations.md:116
msgid "Manually created APIs, controllers, or webhooks will not be regenerated"
msgstr "手动创建的 API、控制器或 Webhook 不会被重新生成"

#: src/migrations.md:117
msgid "This may result in a partial re-scaffold if you have manually created resources"
msgstr "若存在手动创建的资源，可能导致仅部分重新脚手架"

#: src/migrations.md:118
msgid "Requires manual comparison and merge of custom code after regeneration"
msgstr "重新生成后需要手动对比并合并自定义代码"

#: src/migrations.md:122
msgid "See the [`alpha generate` command reference](./reference/commands/alpha_generate.md) for details."
msgstr "详见 [`alpha generate` 命令参考](./reference/commands/alpha_generate.md)。"

#: src/migrations.md:124
msgid "Fully manual migration"
msgstr "完全手动迁移"

#: src/migrations.md:126
msgid "For complete control, you can manually migrate by creating a new project with the latest Kubebuilder version and porting your code over."
msgstr "若需要完全掌控，可手动迁移：用最新 Kubebuilder 创建新项目，再把代码移植过去。"

#: src/migrations.md:129
msgid "In this process, you run all commands from scratch to create a new project, APIs, controllers, webhooks, and other resources. Then, manually copy your business logic and customizations from your old project to the new one."
msgstr "该过程中，需从头运行全部命令创建新项目、API、控制器、Webhook 及其他资源，再把旧项目中的业务逻辑与自定义内容手动复制到新项目。"

#: src/migrations.md:132
msgid "To streamline this one-time migration, [AI Migration Helpers](./migration/ai-helpers.md) have been added to automate repetitive tasks."
msgstr "为简化这一次性迁移，已提供 [AI 迁移助手](./migration/ai-helpers.md) 以自动化重复任务。"

#: src/migrations.md:137
msgid "Use this approach when:"
msgstr "在以下情况使用此方法："

#: src/migrations.md:138
msgid "Your project was created with Kubebuilder versions **before `v3.0.0`** (no `PROJECT` file)"
msgstr "项目由 **`v3.0.0` 之前** 的 Kubebuilder 创建（无 `PROJECT` 文件）"

#: src/migrations.md:139
msgid "You have heavily customized the scaffold beyond standard patterns"
msgstr "脚手架被大幅自定义，已超出标准模式"

#: src/migrations.md:140
msgid "You have manually created APIs, controllers, or webhooks not tracked by the CLI"
msgstr "手动创建了未被 CLI 跟踪的 API、控制器或 Webhook"

#: src/migrations.md:141
msgid "You want complete control and visibility into every change"
msgstr "希望完全掌控并看清每一处变更"

#: src/migrations.md:142
msgid "Other automated methods are not available for your project version"
msgstr "当前项目版本无法使用其他自动化方法"

#: src/migrations.md:146
msgid "See the [Manual Migration Process Guide](./migration/manual-process.md) for a complete step-by-step walkthrough with AI helpers."
msgstr "完整分步说明（含 AI 助手）见[手动迁移流程指南](./migration/manual-process.md)。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:1
msgid "Manual migration process"
msgstr "手动迁移流程"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:3
msgid "Please ensure you have followed the [installation guide](../quick-start.md) to install the required components and have the desired version of the Kubebuilder CLI available in your `PATH`."
msgstr "请确保你已按照[安装指南](../quick-start.md)安装所需组件，并且所需版本的 Kubebuilder CLI 已位于你的 `PATH` 中。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:7
msgid "This guide outlines the manual steps to migrate your existing Kubebuilder project to a newer version of the Kubebuilder framework. This process involves re-scaffolding your project and manually porting over your custom code and configurations."
msgstr "本指南概述了将现有 Kubebuilder 项目迁移到较新版本 Kubebuilder 框架的手动步骤。此过程包括重新搭建项目脚手架，并手动移植你的自定义代码和配置。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:11
msgid "From Kubebuilder `v3.0.0` onwards, all inputs used by Kubebuilder are tracked in the [PROJECT](../reference/project-config.md) file. Ensure that you check this file in your current project to verify the recorded configuration and metadata. Review the [PROJECT file documentation](../reference/project-config.md) for a better understanding."
msgstr "从 Kubebuilder `v3.0.0` 起，Kubebuilder 使用的所有输入都会记录在 [PROJECT](../reference/project-config.md) 文件中。请检查当前项目中的该文件，以核对已记录的配置和元数据。请参阅 [PROJECT 文件文档](../reference/project-config.md) 以更好地理解。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:15
msgid "Also, before starting, it is recommended to check [What's in a basic project?](../cronjob-tutorial/basic-project.md) to better understand the project layouts and structure."
msgstr "另外，在开始之前，建议查阅[基础项目包含什么？](../cronjob-tutorial/basic-project.md)，以便更好地理解项目布局和结构。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:22
msgid "Manual migration is more complex than automated methods but gives you complete control. Use manual migration when:"
msgstr "手动迁移比自动化方法更复杂，但能让你拥有完全控制权。在以下情况下使用手动迁移："

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:23
msgid "Your project has significant customizations"
msgstr "你的项目有大量自定义内容"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:24
msgid "Automated tools are not available for your version yet"
msgstr "你的版本尚无可用的自动化工具"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:26
msgid "**Two-phase approach (recommended for legacy layouts):**"
msgstr "**两阶段方法（推荐用于旧布局）：**"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:27
msgid "**Reorganize layout** - Move files to new structure (controllers → internal/controller, webhooks → internal/webhook, main.go → cmd), update imports, test, commit"
msgstr "**重组布局** - 将文件移到新结构（controllers → internal/controller，webhooks → internal/webhook，main.go → cmd），更新导入，测试，提交"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:28
msgid "**Migrate to latest** - Re-scaffold with latest version, port code"
msgstr "**迁移到最新版本** - 用最新版本重新搭建脚手架，移植代码"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:30
msgid "This keeps your project working at each step and simplifies porting. AI migration helpers are provided to automate repetitive tasks. See [AI Migration Helpers](./ai-helpers.md) for AI instructions that automate both phases."
msgstr "这样可以让项目在每一步都保持可用，并简化移植。提供了 AI 迁移助手来自动化重复任务。参见[AI 迁移助手](./ai-helpers.md)，其中包含可自动化两个阶段的 AI 说明。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:34
msgid "**For future updates:** Once migrated, use the [AutoUpdate plugin](../plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md) or [alpha update](../reference/commands/alpha_update.md) command to automatically update scaffolds with 3-way merge while preserving customizations."
msgstr "**关于后续更新：** 迁移完成后，可使用 [AutoUpdate 插件](../plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md) 或 [alpha update](../reference/commands/alpha_update.md) 命令，通过三方合并自动更新脚手架，同时保留自定义内容。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:39
msgid "Phase 1: Reorganize to New Layout (Required only for Legacy Layouts)"
msgstr "阶段 1：Reorganize to New Layout (Required only for Legacy Layouts)"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:41
msgid "**Only needed if ANY of these are true:**"
msgstr "**仅在以下任一条件为真时需要：**"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:42 src/migration/reorganize-layout.md:8
msgid "Controllers are NOT in `internal/controller/`"
msgstr "控制器不在 `internal/controller/` 中"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:43 src/migration/reorganize-layout.md:9
msgid "Webhooks are NOT in `internal/webhook/`"
msgstr "Webhook 不在 `internal/webhook/` 中"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:44 src/migration/reorganize-layout.md:10
msgid "Main is NOT in `cmd/`"
msgstr "main 不在 `cmd/` 中"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:46
msgid "**Skip this phase if** your project already uses `internal/controller/`, `internal/webhook/`, and `cmd/main.go`."
msgstr "**如果**你的项目已使用 `internal/controller/`、`internal/webhook/` 和 `cmd/main.go`，**可跳过此阶段**。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:48
msgid "1.1 Create a reorganization branch"
msgstr "1.1 创建重组分支"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:54
msgid "1.2 Reorganize file locations"
msgstr "1.2 重组文件位置"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:60
msgid "If you used [Step 1: Reorganize to New Layout](./reorganize-layout.md) AI migration helper, your project is already reorganized. Skip to [Phase 2](#phase-2-migrate-to-latest-version)."
msgstr "如果你已使用 [步骤 1：重组到新布局](./reorganize-layout.md) AI 迁移助手，项目已完成重组。请跳到[阶段 2](#phase-2-migrate-to-latest-version)。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:64
msgid "Move files to new layout:"
msgstr "将文件移到新布局："

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:67
msgid ""
"# If you have controllers/ directory\n"
msgstr ""
"# If you have controllers/ directory\n"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:71
msgid ""
"# OR if you have pkg/controllers/ directory\n"
msgstr ""
"# OR if you have pkg/controllers/ directory\n"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:75
msgid ""
"# If you have webhooks in api/v1/ or apis/v1/\n"
msgstr ""
"# If you have webhooks in api/v1/ or apis/v1/\n"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:78
msgid "\"No webhook files found to move (this is expected if your project has no webhooks)\""
msgstr "\"未找到可移动的 webhook 文件（如果项目没有 webhook，这是预期行为）\""

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:79
msgid ""
"# If main.go is in root\n"
msgstr ""
"# If main.go is in root\n"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:85
msgid "1.3 Update package declarations"
msgstr "1.3 更新 package 声明"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:87
msgid "After moving files, update package declarations:"
msgstr "移动文件后，更新 package 声明："

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:89
msgid "**Controllers:** Change `package controllers` → `package controller` in all `*_controller.go` and `*_controller_test.go` files."
msgstr "**控制器：** 在所有 `*_controller.go` 和 `*_controller_test.go` 文件中，将 `package controllers` → `package controller`。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:91
msgid "**Webhooks:** Keep version as package name (e.g., `package v1` stays `package v1` in `internal/webhook/v1/`)."
msgstr "**Webhook：** 保持版本作为包名（例如，在 `internal/webhook/v1/` 中 `package v1` 仍为 `package v1`）。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:93
msgid "1.4 Update import paths"
msgstr "1.4 更新 import 路径"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:95
msgid "Find and update all imports:"
msgstr "查找并更新所有 import："

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:98
msgid "\"pkg/controllers\\|/controllers\\\"\""
msgstr "\"pkg/controllers\\|/controllers\\\"\""

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:98 src/migration/manual-process.md:640
msgid "\"*.go\""
msgstr "\"*.go\""

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:101
msgid "In each file found, update:"
msgstr "在找到的每个文件中更新："

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:102
msgid "Imports: `<module>/controllers` or `<module>/pkg/controllers` → `<module>/internal/controller`"
msgstr "导入：`<module>/controllers` 或 `<module>/pkg/controllers` → `<module>/internal/controller`"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:103
msgid "References: `controllers.TypeName` → `controller.TypeName`"
msgstr "引用：`controllers.TypeName` → `controller.TypeName`"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:105
msgid "1.5 Update Dockerfile (if needed)"
msgstr "1.5 更新 Dockerfile（如需要）"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:107
msgid "If your Dockerfile has explicit COPY statements for moved paths, update them to reflect the new structure, or simplify to `COPY . .` and use `.dockerignore` to exclude unnecessary files."
msgstr "如果你的 Dockerfile 对已移动路径有显式 COPY 语句，请更新它们以反映新结构，或简化为 `COPY . .` 并使用 `.dockerignore` 排除不需要的文件。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:109
msgid "1.6 Verify and commit"
msgstr "1.6 验证并提交"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:111
msgid "Build and test the reorganized project:"
msgstr "构建并测试重组后的项目："

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:118
msgid "If successful, commit the layout changes. Your project now uses the new layout. Proceed to Phase 2."
msgstr "如果成功，提交布局更改。你的项目现在使用新布局。继续进入阶段 2。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:120
msgid "Phase 2: Migrate to Latest Version"
msgstr "阶段 2：Migrate to Latest Version"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:122
msgid "Step 1: Prepare Your Current Project"
msgstr "步骤 1：Prepare Your Current Project"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:124
msgid "1.1 Create a migration branch"
msgstr "1.1 创建迁移分支"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:126
msgid "Create a branch from your current codebase:"
msgstr "从当前代码库创建分支："

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:132
msgid "1.2 Create a backup"
msgstr "1.2 创建备份"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:139
msgid "1.3 Clean your project directory"
msgstr "1.3 清理项目目录"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:141
msgid "Remove all files except `.git`:"
msgstr "删除除 `.git` 外的所有文件："

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:144
msgid "'./.git*'"
msgstr "'./.git*'"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:144
msgid "'..'"
msgstr "'..'"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:147
msgid "Step 2: Initialize the New Project"
msgstr "步骤 2：Initialize the New Project"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:149
msgid "**About the PROJECT file:** From v3.0.0+, the `PROJECT` file tracks all scaffolding metadata. If you have one and used CLI for all resources, try `kubebuilder alpha generate` first. Otherwise, follow the manual steps below to identify and re-scaffold all resources."
msgstr "**关于 PROJECT 文件：** 从 v3.0.0+ 起，`PROJECT` 文件跟踪所有脚手架元数据。如果你有该文件且所有资源都通过 CLI 创建，请先尝试 `kubebuilder alpha generate`。否则，按下面的手动步骤识别并重新搭建所有资源的脚手架。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:151
msgid "2.1 Identify your module and domain"
msgstr "2.1 识别你的 module 与 domain"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:153
msgid "Identify the information you'll need for initialization from your backup."
msgstr "从备份中识别初始化所需的信息。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:159
msgid "If you used [Step 2: Discovery CLI Commands](./discovery-commands.md) AI migration helper, you already have a complete script with all commands. Execute it and skip to [Step 4: Port Your Custom Code](#step-4-port-your-custom-code)."
msgstr "如果你已使用 [步骤 2：发现 CLI 命令](./discovery-commands.md) AI 迁移助手，你已有包含所有命令的完整脚本。执行它并跳到[步骤 4：移植自定义代码](#step-4-port-your-custom-code)。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:163
msgid "**Module path** - Check your backup's `go.mod` file:"
msgstr "**Module 路径** - 检查备份中的 `go.mod` 文件："

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:169
msgid "Look for the module line:"
msgstr "查找 module 行："

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:175
msgid "**Domain** - Check your backup's `PROJECT` file:"
msgstr "**Domain** - 检查备份的 `PROJECT` 文件："

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:181
msgid "Look for the domain line:"
msgstr "查找 domain 行："

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:187
msgid "If you do not have a `PROJECT` file (versions \\< `v3.0.0`), check your CRD files under `config/crd/bases/` or examine the API group names. The domain is the part after the group name in your API groups."
msgstr "如果你没有 `PROJECT` 文件（版本 \\< `v3.0.0`），请检查 `config/crd/bases/` 下的 CRD 文件，或查看 API group 名称。domain 是 API group 中 group 名称之后的部分。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:191
msgid "2.2 Initialize the Go module"
msgstr "2.2 初始化 Go module"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:193
msgid "Initialize a new Go module using the same module path from your original project:"
msgstr "使用原项目中相同的 module 路径初始化新的 Go module："

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:199
msgid "Replace `tutorial.kubebuilder.io/migration-project` with your actual module path."
msgstr "将 `tutorial.kubebuilder.io/migration-project` 替换为你的实际 module 路径。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:201
msgid "2.3 Initialize Kubebuilder project"
msgstr "2.3 初始化 Kubebuilder 项目"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:203
msgid "Initialize the project with Kubebuilder:"
msgstr "使用 Kubebuilder 初始化项目："

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:209
msgid "Replace with your actual domain and repository (module path)."
msgstr "替换为你的实际 domain 和 repository（module 路径）。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:214
msgid "`--domain`: The domain for your API groups (e.g., `tutorial.kubebuilder.io`). Your full API groups is `<group>.<domain>`."
msgstr "`--domain`：API group 的域名（例如 `tutorial.kubebuilder.io`）。完整 API group 为 `<group>.<domain>`。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:215
msgid "`--repo`: Your Go module path (same as in `go.mod`)"
msgstr "`--repo`：你的 Go module 路径（与 `go.mod` 中相同）"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:219
msgid "2.4 Enable multi-group support (if needed)"
msgstr "2.4 启用多 group 支持（如需要）"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:221
msgid "Multi-group projects organize APIs into different groups, with each group in its own directory. This is useful when you have APIs for different purposes or domains."
msgstr "多 group 项目将 API 组织到不同的 group 中，每个 group 位于自己的目录。当你有用于不同目的或领域的 API 时，这很有用。"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:224
msgid "**Check if your project uses multi-group layout** by examining your backup's directory structure:"
msgstr "**通过检查备份的目录结构，确认项目是否使用多 group 布局**："

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:226
msgid "**Single-group layout:** All APIs in one group"
msgstr "**单 group 布局：** 所有 API 在一个 group 中"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:227
msgid "`api/v1/cronjob_types.go`"
msgstr "`api/v1/cronjob_types.go`"

#: src/migration/manual-process.md:228
msgid "`api/v1/job_types.go`"
msgstr "`api/v1/job_types.go`"

