msgid "Using AI to migrate projects from any version to the latest"
msgstr "使用 AI 将项目从任意版本迁移到最新版本"

#: src/migration/ai-helpers.md:3
msgid "AI can assist manual migrations by reducing repetitive work and helping resolve breaking changes. It will not replace the [Manual Migration Process](./manual-process.md), but it can help reduce effort and accomplish the goal."
msgstr "AI 可以通过减少重复工作并帮助解决破坏性变更来协助手动迁移。它不会取代[手动迁移流程](./manual-process.md)，但可以帮助减少工作量并达成目标。"

