msgid "These AI instructions are provided as examples to help guide your migration. Always validate AI output carefully - you remain responsible for ensuring correctness."
msgstr "这些 AI 说明作为示例提供，以帮助指导你的迁移。请始终仔细验证 AI 输出——你仍需对确保正确性负责。"

