msgid "AI analyzes your project and generates all Kubebuilder CLI commands to fully re-scaffold with the latest release. Create a backup (`mkdir ../migration-backup && cp -r . ../migration-backup/`), then execute the generated commands to scaffold a fresh project."
msgstr "AI 分析你的项目并生成使用最新版本完全重新搭建脚手架所需的所有 Kubebuilder CLI 命令。创建备份（`mkdir ../migration-backup && cp -r . ../migration-backup/`），然后执行生成的命令以搭建全新项目。"

#: src/migration/ai-helpers.md:25
msgid "See [Step 2: Discovery CLI Commands](./discovery-commands.md)"
msgstr "参见[步骤 2：发现 CLI 命令](./discovery-commands.md)"

