#: src/migration/multi-group.md:3
msgid "Kubebuilder scaffolds single-group projects by default to keep things simple, as most projects do not require multiple API groups. However, you can convert an existing single-group project to use multi-group layout when needed. This reorganizes your APIs and controllers into group-specific directories."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 默认脚手架单 group 项目以保持简单，因为多数项目不需要多个 API groups。但需要时，可将现有单 group 项目转换为多 group 布局。这会将 API 与 controllers 重组到按 group 划分的目录中。"

#: src/migration/multi-group.md:5
msgid "See the [design doc](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/simplified-scaffolding.md) for the rationale behind this design decision."
