#: src/migration/namespace-scoped.md:504
msgid "Important notes"
msgstr "重要说明"

#: src/migration/namespace-scoped.md:506
msgid "**Only controllers need RBAC updates**: Only update `+kubebuilder:rbac` markers in controller files (files with `Reconcile` function). Webhook files do NOT use RBAC markers - webhooks use certificate-based authentication with the API server."
msgstr "**仅 controllers 需要更新 RBAC**：只更新 controller 文件（含 `Reconcile` 函数的文件）中的 `+kubebuilder:rbac` markers。Webhook 文件不使用 RBAC markers——webhooks 使用基于证书的认证与 API server 通信。"

#: src/migration/namespace-scoped.md:507
msgid "**RBAC markers control scope**: The `namespace=` parameter in controller RBAC markers determines whether controller-gen generates `Role` (namespace-scoped) or `ClusterRole` (cluster-scoped). Without the `namespace=` parameter, controller-gen always generates `ClusterRole`."
msgstr "**RBAC markers 控制作用域**：controller RBAC markers 中的 `namespace=` 参数决定 controller-gen 生成 `Role`（Namespace 作用域）还是 `ClusterRole`（集群作用域）。没有 `namespace=` 参数时，controller-gen 始终生成 `ClusterRole`。"

#: src/migration/namespace-scoped.md:508
msgid "**Controller-gen regenerates role.yaml**: After running `make manifests`, controller-gen will regenerate `config/rbac/role.yaml` based on your controller RBAC markers. The initial `Role` scaffold from `kubebuilder edit --namespaced=true` serves as a template, but controller-gen manages the actual content."
msgstr "**Controller-gen 会重新生成 role.yaml**：运行 `make manifests` 后，controller-gen 会根据 controller RBAC markers 重新生成 `config/rbac/role.yaml`。`kubebuilder edit --namespaced=true` 初始脚手架的 `Role` 作为模板，但实际内容由 controller-gen 管理。"

#: src/migration/namespace-scoped.md:509
msgid "**Namespace parameter format**: Use `namespace=<your-namespace>` in controller RBAC markers, typically `namespace=<project-name>-system` to match your deployment namespace."
msgstr "**Namespace 参数格式**：在 controller RBAC markers 中使用 `namespace=<your-namespace>`，通常为 `namespace=<project-name>-system` 以匹配部署 namespace。"

#: src/migration/namespace-scoped.md:510
msgid "**Metrics auth role stays cluster-scoped**: The `metrics-auth-role` uses cluster-scoped APIs (TokenReview, SubjectAccessReview) and correctly remains a ClusterRole without namespace parameter."
msgstr "**Metrics auth role 保持集群作用域**：`metrics-auth-role` 使用集群作用域 API（TokenReview、SubjectAccessReview），正确地保持为无 namespace 参数的 ClusterRole。"

#: src/migration/namespace-scoped.md:511
msgid "**Webhooks require manual configuration**: Currently, controller-gen does not support `namespaceSelector` or `objectSelector` markers for webhooks. See the webhook section above for details."
msgstr "**Webhooks 需要手动配置**：目前 controller-gen 不支持 webhooks 的 `namespaceSelector` 或 `objectSelector` markers。详见上文 webhook 部分。"

