#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:5
msgid "The `kubebuilder alpha generate` command re-scaffolds your project using the currently installed CLI and plugin versions."
msgstr "`kubebuilder alpha generate` 命令使用当前已安装的 CLI 和插件版本重新生成项目脚手架。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:8
msgid "It regenerates the full scaffold based on the configuration specified in your [PROJECT](../../reference/project-config.md) file. This allows you to apply the latest layout changes, plugin features, and code generation improvements introduced in newer Kubebuilder releases."
msgstr "它根据 [PROJECT](../../reference/project-config.md) 文件中的配置重新生成完整脚手架。这样你可以应用较新 Kubebuilder 版本引入的最新布局变更、插件特性以及代码生成改进。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:12
msgid "You may choose to re-scaffold the project in-place (overwriting existing files) or in a separate directory for diff-based inspection and manual integration."
msgstr "你可以选择就地重新生成项目（覆盖现有文件），或输出到单独目录以便基于 diff 检查并手动集成。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:20
msgid "Two things are carried across. Your [PROJECT](../../reference/project-config.md) file is read before the cleanup, so the project configuration is preserved and the new scaffold writes it again from that configuration. Expect it to change when the layout changes, for example when migrating from `go.kubebuilder.io/v3` to `go.kubebuilder.io/v4`. The license header in `hack/boilerplate.go.txt` is preserved the same way and reapplied to the regenerated files."
msgstr "有两项内容会保留下来。清理前会读取你的 [PROJECT](../../reference/project-config.md) 文件，因此项目配置得以保留，新脚手架会基于该配置重新写入。布局变更时预期它会变化，例如从 `go.kubebuilder.io/v3` 迁移到 `go.kubebuilder.io/v4`。`hack/boilerplate.go.txt` 中的许可证头同样会保留，并重新应用到重新生成的文件上。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:26
msgid "Always back up your project or use version control before running this command."
msgstr "运行此命令前请始终备份项目或使用版本控制。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:29
#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:46
#: src/plugins/available/grafana-v1-alpha.md:16
msgid "When to use it?"
msgstr "什么时候使用它？"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:31
msgid "You can use `kubebuilder alpha generate` to upgrade your project scaffold when new changes are introduced in Kubebuilder. This includes updates to plugins (for example, `go.kubebuilder.io/v3` → `go.kubebuilder.io/v4`) or the CLI releases (for example, 4.3.1 → latest) ."
msgstr "当 Kubebuilder 引入新变更时，你可以使用 `kubebuilder alpha generate` 升级项目脚手架。这包括插件更新（例如 `go.kubebuilder.io/v3` → `go.kubebuilder.io/v4`）或 CLI 版本更新（例如 4.3.1 → latest）。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:35
msgid "This command is helpful when you want to:"
msgstr "在以下情况此命令很有用："

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:37
msgid "Update your project to use the latest layout or plugin version"
msgstr "更新项目以使用最新布局或插件版本"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:38
msgid "Regenerate your project scaffold to include recent changes"
msgstr "重新生成项目脚手架以包含近期变更"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:39
msgid "Compare the current scaffold with the latest and apply updates manually"
msgstr "将当前脚手架与最新版本对比并手动应用更新"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:40
msgid "Create a clean scaffold for reviewing or testing changes"
msgstr "创建干净脚手架以审查或测试变更"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:42
msgid "Use this command when you want full control of the upgrade process. It is also useful if your project was created with an older CLI version and does not support `alpha update`."
msgstr "当你希望完全掌控升级过程时使用此命令。若项目由较旧 CLI 版本创建且不支持 `alpha update`，此命令也很有用。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:45
msgid "This approach allows you to compare changes between your current branch and upstream scaffold updates (e.g., from the main branch), and helps you overlay custom code atop the new scaffold."
msgstr "这种方法可以让你对比当前分支与上游脚手架更新（例如来自主分支）之间的差异，并帮助你将自定义代码叠加上新脚手架。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:51
msgid "If you want to upgrade your project scaffold with less manual work, try [`kubebuilder alpha update`](./alpha_update.md)."
msgstr "若希望以更少手动工作升级项目脚手架，可尝试 [`kubebuilder alpha update`](./alpha_update.md)。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:54
msgid "It uses a 3-way merge to keep your code and apply the latest scaffold changes automatically. Use `alpha generate` if `alpha update` is not available for your project yet or if you prefer to handle changes manually."
msgstr "它使用三方合并保留你的代码并自动应用最新脚手架变更。若项目尚不支持 `alpha update`，或你更希望手动处理变更，请使用 `alpha generate`。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:60
#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:52
#: src/plugins/available/grafana-v1-alpha.md:22
#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:78
