msgstr "将当前项目升级到已安装的 CLI 版本（即最新脚手架）"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:68
msgid "After running this command, your project is re-scaffolded in place. You can then compare the local changes with your main branch to see what was updated, and re-apply your custom code on top as needed."
msgstr "运行此命令后，项目会就地重新生成脚手架。然后你可以对比本地变更与主分支，查看更新内容，并按需重新叠加自定义代码。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:72
