msgstr "将脚手架生成到新目录"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:74
msgid "Use the `--input-dir` and `--output-dir` flags to specify input and output paths."
msgstr "使用 `--input-dir` 和 `--output-dir` 标志指定输入与输出路径。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_generate.md:82
msgid "After running the command, you can inspect the generated scaffold in the specified output directory."
msgstr "运行命令后，可在指定输出目录中检查生成的脚手架。"

