#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:1
msgid "Update Your Project with (`alpha update`)"
msgstr "使用（`alpha update`）更新你的项目"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:5
msgid "`kubebuilder alpha update` upgrades your project’s scaffold to a newer Kubebuilder release using a **3-way Git merge**. It rebuilds clean scaffolds for the old and new versions, merges your current code into the new scaffold, and gives you a reviewable output branch. It takes care of the heavy lifting so you can focus on reviewing and resolving conflicts, not re-applying your code."
msgstr "`kubebuilder alpha update` 使用**三方 Git 合并**将项目脚手架升级到更新的 Kubebuilder 发行版。它为旧版与新版重建干净脚手架，将当前代码合并到新脚手架，并给出可审查的输出分支。它处理繁重工作，让你专注于审查与解决冲突，而非重新应用代码。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:9
msgid "By default, the final result is **squashed into a single commit** on a dedicated output branch. If you prefer to keep the full history (no squash), use `--show-commits`."
msgstr "默认情况下，最终结果会在专用输出分支上**压缩为单个提交**。若希望保留完整历史（不 squash），请使用 `--show-commits`。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:15
msgid "You can reduce the burden of keeping your project up to date by using the [AutoUpdate Plugin](./../../plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md) which automates the process of running `kubebuilder alpha update` on a schedule workflow when new Kubebuilder releases are available."
msgstr "你可以使用 [AutoUpdate 插件](./../../plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md) 减轻保持项目最新的负担；当有新的 Kubebuilder 版本发布时，它会通过定时工作流自动运行 `kubebuilder alpha update`。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:22
#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:16
#: src/plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md:21
#: src/plugins/available/helm-v1-alpha.md:41
msgid "When to use it"
msgstr "何时使用它"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:24
msgid "Use this command when you:"
msgstr "在以下情况使用此命令："

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:26
msgid "Want to move to a newer Kubebuilder version or plugin layout"
msgstr "希望迁移到更新的 Kubebuilder 版本或插件布局"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:27
msgid "Want to review scaffold changes on a separate branch"
msgstr "希望在单独分支上审查脚手架变更"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:28
msgid "Want to focus on resolving merge conflicts (not re-applying your custom code)"
msgstr "希望专注于解决合并冲突（而非重新应用自定义代码）"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:30
#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:31 src/reference/markers/scaffold.md:18
#: src/plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md:34
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "它是如何工作的"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:32
msgid "You tell the tool the **new version**, and which branch has your project. It rebuilds both scaffolds, merges your code into the new one with a **3-way merge**, and gives you an output branch you can review and merge safely. You decide if you want one clean commit, the full history, or an auto-push to remote."
msgstr "你告知工具**新版本**以及项目所在分支。它会重建两套脚手架，用**三方合并**将你的代码合并到新脚手架中，并给出可安全审查与合并的输出分支。你可以选择单个干净提交、完整历史，或自动推送到远程。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:37
msgid "Step 1: Detect versions"
msgstr "步骤 1：Detect versions"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:38
msgid "It looks at your `PROJECT` file or the flags you pass."
msgstr "它会查看你的 `PROJECT` 文件或你传入的标志。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:39
msgid "Decides which **old version** you are coming from by reading the `cliVersion` field in the `PROJECT` file (if available)."
msgstr "通过读取 `PROJECT` 文件中的 `cliVersion` 字段（若可用）确定你来自哪个**旧版本**。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:40
msgid "Figures out which **new version** you want (defaults to the latest release)."
msgstr "确定你想要的**新版本**（默认为最新发行版）。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:41
msgid "Chooses which branch has your current code (defaults to `main`)."
msgstr "选择包含当前代码的分支（默认为 `main`）。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:43
msgid "Step 2: Create scaffolds"
msgstr "步骤 2：Create scaffolds"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:44
msgid "The command creates three temporary branches:"
msgstr "该命令会创建三个临时分支："

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:45
msgid "**Ancestor**: a clean project scaffold from the **old version**."
msgstr "**祖先**：来自**旧版本**的干净项目脚手架。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:46
msgid "**Original**: a snapshot of your **current code**."
msgstr "**原始**：你**当前代码**的快照。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:47
msgid "**Upgrade**: a clean scaffold from the **new version**."
msgstr "**升级**：来自**新版本**的干净脚手架。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:49
msgid "Step 3: Do a 3-way merge"
msgstr "步骤 3：Do a 3-way merge"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:50
msgid "Merges **Original** (your code) into **Upgrade** (the new scaffold) using Git’s **3-way merge**."
msgstr "使用 Git 的**三方合并**将**原始**（你的代码）合并到**升级**（新脚手架）中。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:51
msgid "This keeps your customizations while pulling in upstream changes."
msgstr "在引入上游变更的同时保留你的自定义内容。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:52
msgid "If conflicts happen:"
msgstr "如果发生冲突："

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:53
msgid "**Default** → stop and let you resolve them manually."
msgstr "**默认** → 停止并让你手动解决。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:54
msgid "**With `--force`** → continue and commit even with conflict markers. **(ideal for automation)**"
msgstr "**使用 `--force`** → 即使有冲突标记也继续并提交。**（适合自动化）**"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:55
msgid "Runs `make manifests generate fmt vet lint-fix` to tidy things up."
msgstr "运行 `make manifests generate fmt vet lint-fix` 进行整理。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:57
msgid "Step 4: Write the output branch"
msgstr "步骤 4：Write the output branch"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:58
msgid "By default, everything is **squashed into one commit** on a safe output branch: `kubebuilder-update-from-<from-version>-to-<to-version>`."
msgstr "默认情况下，所有内容会在安全输出分支上**压缩为单个提交**：`kubebuilder-update-from-<from-version>-to-<to-version>`。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:60
msgid "You can change the behavior:"
msgstr "你可以更改行为："

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:61
msgid "`--show-commits`: keep the full history."
msgstr "`--show-commits`：保留完整历史。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:62
msgid "`--restore-path`: in squash mode, restore specific files (like CI configs) from your base branch."
msgstr "`--restore-path`：在压缩模式下，从基线分支恢复特定文件（如 CI 配置）。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:63
msgid "`--output-branch`: pick a custom branch name."
msgstr "`--output-branch`：选择自定义分支名。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:64
msgid "`--merge-message`: customize the commit message for clean merges."
msgstr "`--merge-message`：自定义干净合并时的提交信息。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:65
msgid "`--conflict-message`: customize the commit message when conflicts occur."
msgstr "`--conflict-message`：自定义发生冲突时的提交信息。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:66
msgid "`--push`: push the result to `origin` automatically."
msgstr "`--push`：自动将结果推送到 `origin`。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:67
msgid "`--git-config`: sets git configurations."
msgstr "`--git-config`: sets git configurations."

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:68
msgid "`--open-gh-issue`: create a GitHub issue with a checklist and compare link (requires `gh`)."
msgstr "`--open-gh-issue`：创建带有清单与对比链接的 GitHub issue（需要 `gh`）。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:70
msgid "Step 5: Cleanup"
msgstr "步骤 5：Cleanup"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:71
msgid "Once the output branch is ready, all the temporary working branches are deleted."
msgstr "输出分支就绪后，所有临时工作分支将被删除。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:72
msgid "You are left with one clean branch you can test, review, and merge back into your main branch."
msgstr "最终得到一个干净分支，可测试、审查并合并回主分支。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:74
msgid "How to use it (commands)"
msgstr "如何使用（命令）"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:76
msgid "Run from your project root:"
msgstr "在项目根目录运行："

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:82
msgid "Pin versions and base branch:"
msgstr "固定版本与基线分支："

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:90
msgid "Automation-friendly (proceed even with conflicts):"
msgstr "适合自动化（即使有冲突也继续）："

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:96
msgid "Keep full history instead of squashing:"
msgstr "保留完整历史而非压缩："

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:101
msgid "Default squash but **preserve** CI/workflows from the base branch:"
msgstr "默认压缩，但**保留**基线分支的 CI/工作流："

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:109
msgid "Use a custom output branch name:"
msgstr "使用自定义输出分支名："

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:116
msgid "Run update and push the result to origin:"
msgstr "运行更新并将结果推送到 origin："

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:122
msgid "Customize commit messages:"
msgstr "自定义提交信息："

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:124
msgid ""
"```shell\n"
"kubebuilder alpha update --force \\\n"
"--merge-message \"chore: upgrade kubebuilder scaffold\" \\\n"
"--conflict-message \"chore: upgrade with conflicts - manual review needed\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```shell\n"
"kubebuilder alpha update --force \\\n"
"--merge-message \"chore: upgrade kubebuilder scaffold\" \\\n"
"--conflict-message \"chore: upgrade with conflicts - manual review needed\"\n"
"```"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:130
msgid "Handling conflicts (`--force` vs default)"
msgstr "处理冲突（`--force` 与默认）"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:132
msgid "When you use `--force`, Git finishes the merge even if there are conflicts. The commit will include markers like:"
msgstr "使用 `--force` 时，即使有冲突 Git 也会完成合并。提交将包含如下标记："

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:143
msgid "This allows you to run the command in CI or cron jobs without manual intervention."
msgstr "这允许你在 CI 或 cron 任务中运行该命令而无需人工干预。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:145
msgid "Without `--force`: the command stops on the merge branch and prints guidance; no commit is created."
msgstr "不使用 `--force`：命令停在 merge 分支并打印指引；不创建提交。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:146
msgid "With `--force`: the merge is committed (merge or output branch) and contains the markers."
msgstr "使用 `--force`：合并会被提交（merge 或 output 分支）并包含标记。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:148
msgid "After you fix conflicts, always run:"
msgstr "修复冲突后，始终运行："

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:156
msgid "Using with GitHub Issues (`--open-gh-issue`)"
msgstr "与 GitHub Issues 一起使用（`--open-gh-issue`）"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:158
msgid "Pass `--open-gh-issue` to have the command create a GitHub **Issue** in your repository to assist with the update."
msgstr "传入 `--open-gh-issue` 让命令在仓库中创建 GitHub **Issue** 以协助更新。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:161
#: src/reference/license-header.md:167
msgid "Examples"
msgstr "Examples"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:163
msgid "Create an Issue with a compare link:"
msgstr "创建带有对比链接的 Issue："

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:168
msgid "What you’ll see"
msgstr "你将看到"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:170
msgid "The command opens an Issue that links to the diff so you can create the PR and review it, for example:"
msgstr "该命令会打开一个链接到 diff 的 Issue，以便你创建 PR 并审查，例如："

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:174
msgid "Automation"
msgstr "Automation"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:176
msgid "This integrates cleanly with automation. The [`autoupdate.kubebuilder.io/v1-alpha`](./../../plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md) plugin can scaffold a GitHub Actions workflow that runs the command on a schedule (e.g., weekly). When a new Kubebuilder release is available, it opens an Issue with a compare link so you can create the PR and review it."
msgstr "这能与自动化良好集成。[`autoupdate.kubebuilder.io/v1-alpha`](./../../plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md) 插件可生成按计划（例如每周）运行该命令的 GitHub Actions 工作流。当有新的 Kubebuilder 版本可用时，它会打开带有对比链接的 Issue，便于你创建 PR 并审查。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:178
msgid "Changing extra Git configs only during the run (does not change your ~/.gitconfig)"
msgstr "仅在运行期间更改额外 Git 配置（不修改你的 ~/.gitconfig）"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:180
msgid "By default, `kubebuilder alpha update` applies safe Git configs: `merge.renameLimit=999999`, `diff.renameLimit=999999`, `merge.conflictStyle=merge` You can add more, or disable them."
msgstr "默认情况下，`kubebuilder alpha update` 会应用安全的 Git 配置：`merge.renameLimit=999999`、`diff.renameLimit=999999`、`merge.conflictStyle=merge`。你可以追加更多配置，或禁用它们。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:184
msgid "**Add more on top of defaults**"
msgstr "**在默认值之上追加更多**"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:190
msgid "**Disable defaults entirely**"
msgstr "**完全禁用默认值**"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:195
msgid "**Disable defaults and set your own**"
msgstr "**禁用默认值并设置你自己的**"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:206
msgid "This command uses `kubebuilder alpha generate` under the hood. We support projects created with <strong>v4.5.0+</strong>. If yours is older, first run `kubebuilder alpha generate` once to modernize the scaffold. After that, you can use `kubebuilder alpha update` for future upgrades."
msgstr "此命令底层使用 `kubebuilder alpha generate`。我们支持用 <strong>v4.5.0+</strong> 创建的项目。若项目更旧，请先运行一次 `kubebuilder alpha generate` 以现代化脚手架。之后即可用 `kubebuilder alpha update` 进行后续升级。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:211
msgid "Projects created with **Kubebuilder v4.6.0+** include `cliVersion` in the `PROJECT` file. The command uses that value to pick the correct CLI for re-scaffolding."
msgstr "使用 **Kubebuilder v4.6.0+** 创建的项目会在 `PROJECT` 文件中包含 `cliVersion`。该命令使用该值选择正确的 CLI 以重新生成脚手架。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:220
msgid "`--conflict-message`"
msgstr "`--conflict-message`"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:220
msgid "Custom commit message for merges with conflicts. Defaults to `:warning: chore(kubebuilder): update scaffold (manual conflict resolution) <from> -> <to>`."
msgstr "存在冲突时合并的自定义提交信息。默认为 `:warning: chore(kubebuilder): update scaffold (manual conflict resolution) <from> -> <to>`。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:221
msgid "`--force`"
msgstr "`--force`"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:221
msgid "Continue even if merge conflicts happen. Conflicted files are committed with conflict markers (CI/cron friendly)."
msgstr "即使发生合并冲突也继续。冲突文件会带着冲突标记被提交（适合 CI/cron）。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:222
msgid "`--from-branch`"
msgstr "`--from-branch`"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:222
msgid "Git branch that holds your current project code. Defaults to `main`."
msgstr "保存当前项目代码的 Git 分支。默认为 `main`。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:223
msgid "`--from-version`"
msgstr "`--from-version`"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:223
msgid "Kubebuilder release to update **from** (e.g., `v4.6.0`). If unset, read from the `PROJECT` file when possible."
msgstr "要更新**自**的 Kubebuilder 发行版（例如 `v4.6.0`）。未设置时尽可能从 `PROJECT` 文件读取。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:224
msgid "`--git-config`"
msgstr "`--git-config`"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:224
msgid "Repeatable. Pass per-invocation Git config as `-c key=value`. **Default** (if omitted): `-c merge.renameLimit=999999 -c diff.renameLimit=999999`. Your configs are applied on top. To disable defaults, include `--git-config disable`."
msgstr "可重复。以 `-c key=value` 传入每次调用的 Git 配置。**默认**（若省略）：`-c merge.renameLimit=999999 -c diff.renameLimit=999999`。你的配置会叠加应用。要禁用默认配置，请包含 `--git-config disable`。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:225
msgid "`--merge-message`"
msgstr "`--merge-message`"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:225
msgid "Custom commit message for successful merges (no conflicts). Defaults to `chore(kubebuilder): update scaffold <from> -> <to>`."
msgstr "成功合并（无冲突）的自定义提交信息。默认为 `chore(kubebuilder): update scaffold <from> -> <to>`。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:226
msgid "`--open-gh-issue`"
msgstr "`--open-gh-issue`"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:226
msgid "Create a GitHub issue with a pre-filled checklist and compare link after the update completes (requires `gh`)."
msgstr "更新完成后创建带有预填清单与对比链接的 GitHub issue（需要 `gh`）。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:227
msgid "`--output-branch`"
msgstr "`--output-branch`"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:227
msgid "Name of the output branch. Default: `kubebuilder-update-from-<from-version>-to-<to-version>`."
msgstr "输出分支名称。默认：`kubebuilder-update-from-<from-version>-to-<to-version>`。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:228
msgid "`--push`"
msgstr "`--push`"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:228
msgid "Push the output branch to the `origin` remote after the update completes."
msgstr "更新完成后将输出分支推送到 `origin` 远程。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:229
msgid "`--restore-path`"
msgstr "`--restore-path`"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:229
msgid "Repeatable. Paths to preserve from the base branch when squashing (e.g., `.github/workflows`). **Not supported** with `--show-commits`."
msgstr "可重复。压缩时要从基础分支保留的路径（例如 `.github/workflows`）。与 `--show-commits` **不兼容**。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:230
msgid "`--show-commits`"
msgstr "`--show-commits`"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:230
msgid "Keep full history (do not squash). **Not compatible** with `--restore-path`."
msgstr "保留完整历史（不压缩）。与 `--restore-path` **不兼容**。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:231
msgid "`--to-version`"
msgstr "`--to-version`"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:231
msgid "Kubebuilder release to update **to** (e.g., `v4.7.0`). If unset, defaults to the latest available release."
msgstr "要更新**到**的 Kubebuilder 发行版（例如 `v4.7.0`）。未设置时默认为最新可用发行版。"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:234
#: src/plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md:86
msgid "Demonstration"
msgstr "Demonstration"

#: src/reference/commands/alpha_update.md:241
msgid "This video was recorded with Kubebuilder release `v7.0.1`. Since then, the command has been improved, so the current behavior may differ slightly from what is shown in the demo."
msgstr "本视频使用 Kubebuilder 版本 `v7.0.1` 录制。此后命令已改进，当前行为可能与演示略有不同。"

