#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:3
msgid "Kubebuilder uses a tool called [`controller-gen`](https://sigs.k8s.io/controller-tools \"Controller Tools\") to generate utility code and Kubernetes object YAML, like CustomResourceDefinitions."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 使用一个名为 [`controller-gen`](https://sigs.k8s.io/controller-tools \"Controller Tools\") 的工具来生成实用代码和 Kubernetes 对象的 YAML，比如自定义资源定义（CustomResourceDefinitions）。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:7
msgid "To do this, it makes use of special \"marker comments\" (comments that start with `// +`) to indicate additional information about fields, types, and packages.  In the case of CRDs, these are generally pulled from your `_types.go` files.  For more information on markers, see the [marker reference docs](./markers.md \"Markers for Config/Code Generation\")."
msgstr "为此，它使用特殊的\"标记注释\"（以 `// +` 开头的注释）来指示有关字段、类型和包的附加信息。在自定义资源定义（CRD）的情况下，这些信息通常来自于你的 `_types.go` 文件。有关标记的更多信息，请参见 [标记参考文档](./markers.md \"配置/代码生成的标记\")。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:13
msgid "Kubebuilder provides a `make` target to run controller-gen and generate CRDs: `make manifests`."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 提供了一个 `make` 目标来运行 controller-gen 并生成 CRD：`make manifests`。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:16
msgid "When you run `make manifests`, you should see CRDs generated under the `config/crd/bases` directory.  `make manifests` can generate a number of other artifacts as well -- see the [marker reference docs](./markers.md \"Markers for Config/Code Generation\") for more details."
msgstr "当你运行 `make manifests` 时，应该可以在 `config/crd/bases` 目录下看到生成的 CRD。`make manifests` 还可以生成许多其他的构件—更多细节请查看 [标记参考文档](./markers.md \"配置/代码生成的标记\")。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:21
msgid "Validation"
msgstr "验证"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:23
msgid "CRDs support [declarative validation](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/access-kubernetes-api/custom-resources/custom-resource-definitions/#validation \"Custom Resource Definitions: Validation\") using an [OpenAPI v3 schema](https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification/blob/master/versions/3.0.0.md#schemaObject \"OpenAPI v3\") in the `validation` section."
msgstr "CRD 支持使用 `validation` 部分中的 [OpenAPI v3 架构](https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification/blob/master/versions/3.0.0.md#schemaObject \"OpenAPI v3\") 进行 [声明式验证](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/access-kubernetes-api/custom-resources/custom-resource-definitions/#validation \"自定义资源定义：验证\")."

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:26
msgid "In general, [validation markers](./markers/crd-validation.md) may be attached to fields or to types. If you are defining complex validation, if you need to re-use validation, or if you need to validate slice elements, it is often best to define a new type to describe your validation."
msgstr "一般来说，[验证标记](./markers/crd-validation.md)可以附加到字段或类型上。如果您在定义复杂的验证、需要重用验证或需要验证切片元素，通常最好定义一个新类型来描述您的验证。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:31 src/reference/generating-crd.md:107
#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:128 src/reference/metrics.md:437
msgid "For example:"
msgstr "例如："

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:35
msgid ""
"// +kubebuilder:validation:MaxLength=15\n"
"\t// +kubebuilder:validation:MinLength=1\n"
msgstr ""
"// +kubebuilder:validation:MaxLength=15\n"
"\t// +kubebuilder:validation:MinLength=1\n"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:37
msgid "`json:\"name,omitempty\"`"
msgstr "`json:\"name,omitempty\"`"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:39
msgid ""
"// +kubebuilder:validation:MaxItems=500\n"
"\t// +kubebuilder:validation:MinItems=1\n"
"\t// +kubebuilder:validation:UniqueItems=true\n"
msgstr ""
"// +kubebuilder:validation:MaxItems=500\n"
"\t// +kubebuilder:validation:MinItems=1\n"
"\t// +kubebuilder:validation:UniqueItems=true\n"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:42
msgid "`json:\"knights,omitempty\"`"
msgstr "`json:\"knights,omitempty\"`"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:44
msgid "`json:\"alias,omitempty\"`"
msgstr "`json:\"alias,omitempty\"`"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:45
msgid "`json:\"rank\"`"
msgstr "`json:\"rank\"`"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:47
msgid ""
"// +kubebuilder:validation:Enum=Lion;Wolf;Dragon\n"
msgstr ""
"// +kubebuilder:validation:Enum=狮子;狼;龙\n"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:50
msgid ""
"// +kubebuilder:validation:Minimum=1\n"
"// +kubebuilder:validation:Maximum=3\n"
"// +kubebuilder:validation:ExclusiveMaximum=false\n"
msgstr ""
"// +kubebuilder:validation:最小值=1\n"
"// +kubebuilder:validation:最大值=3\n"
"// +kubebuilder:validation:排除最大值=false\n"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:58
msgid "Additional printer columns"
msgstr "附加打印机列"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:60
msgid "Starting with Kubernetes 1.11, `kubectl get` can ask the server what columns to display.  For CRDs, this can be used to provide useful, type-specific information with `kubectl get`, similar to the information provided for built-in types."
msgstr "从 Kubernetes 1.11 开始，`kubectl get` 可以向服务器请求显示哪些列。对于自定义资源定义（CRD），这可以用于提供有用的特定类型信息，类似于内置类型所提供的信息。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:65
msgid "The information that gets displayed can be controlled with the [additionalPrinterColumns field](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/access-kubernetes-api/custom-resources/custom-resource-definitions/#additional-printer-columns \"Custom Resource Definitions: Additional Printer Columns\") on your CRD, which is controlled by the [`+kubebuilder:printcolumn`](./markers/crd.md \"CRD Generation\") marker on the Go type for your CRD."
msgstr "显示的信息可以通过您的 CRD 上的 [additionalPrinterColumns 字段](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/access-kubernetes-api/custom-resources/custom-resource-definitions/#additional-printer-columns \"自定义资源定义：附加打印列\") 进行控制，该字段由 CRD 的 Go 类型上的 [`+kubebuilder:printcolumn`](./markers/crd.md \"CRD 生成\") 标记控制。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:71
msgid "For instance, in the following example, add fields to display information about the knights, rank, and alias fields from the validation example:"
msgstr "例如，在以下示例中，我们添加字段以显示有关骑士的信息，以及来自验证示例的等级和别名字段："

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:76
msgid ""
"// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"Alias\",type=string,JSONPath=`.spec.alias`\n"
"// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"Rank\",type=integer,JSONPath=`.spec.rank`\n"
"// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"Bravely Run Away\",type=boolean,JSONPath=`.spec.knights[?(@ == \"Sir Robin\")]`,description=\"when danger rears its ugly head, he bravely turned his tail and fled\",priority=10\n"
"// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"Age\",type=\"date\",JSONPath=\".metadata.creationTimestamp\"\n"
msgstr ""
"// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"别名\",type=string,JSONPath=`.spec.alias`\n"
"// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"等级\",type=integer,JSONPath=`.spec.rank`\n"
"// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"勇敢逃跑\",type=boolean,JSONPath=`.spec.knights[?(@ == \"罗宾爵士\")]`,description=\"当危险抬起丑陋的头颅时，他勇敢地转身逃跑\",priority=10\n"
"// +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=\"年龄\",type=\"日期\",JSONPath=\".metadata.creationTimestamp\"\n"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:90
msgid "Subresources"
msgstr "子资源"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:92
msgid "CRDs can choose to implement the `/status` and `/scale` [subresources](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/access-kubernetes-api/custom-resources/custom-resource-definitions/#status-subresource \"Custom Resource Definitions: Status Subresource\") as of Kubernetes 1.13."
msgstr "从 Kubernetes 1.13 开始，CRDs 可以选择实现 `/status` 和 `/scale` [子资源](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/access-kubernetes-api/custom-resources/custom-resource-definitions/#status-subresource \"自定义资源定义：状态子资源\")。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:95
msgid "It's generally recommended that you make use of the `/status` subresource on all resources that have a status field."
msgstr "一般建议您在所有具有状态字段的资源中使用 `/status` 子资源。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:98
msgid "Both subresources have a corresponding [marker](./markers/crd.md \"CRD Generation\")."
msgstr "两个子资源都有相应的 [标记](./markers/crd.md \"CRD 生成\")."

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:100
msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:102
msgid "You enable the status subresource via `+kubebuilder:subresource:status`. When you enable it, updates at the main resource will not change status. Similarly, updates to the status subresource cannot change anything but the status field."
msgstr "通过 `+kubebuilder:subresource:status` 启用 status 子资源。启用后，对主资源的更新不会更改 status。同样，对 status 子资源的更新只能更改 status 字段。"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:110
msgid ""
"// +kubebuilder:subresource:status\n"
msgstr ""
"// +kubebuilder:subresource:status\n"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:120
msgid "Scale"
msgstr "规模"

#: src/reference/generating-crd.md:122
msgid "You enable the scale subresource via `+kubebuilder:subresource:scale`. When you enable it, users can use `kubectl scale` with your resource. If the `selectorpath` argument points to the string form of a label selector, the HorizontalPodAutoscaler can autoscale your resource."
msgstr "通过 `+kubebuilder:subresource:scale` 启用 scale 子资源。启用后，用户可以对你的资源使用 `kubectl scale`。若 `selectorpath` 参数指向标签选择器的字符串形式，HorizontalPodAutoscaler 即可自动扩缩你的资源。"

