#: src/reference/using-finalizers.md:1
msgid "Using finalizers"
msgstr "使用终结器"

#: src/reference/using-finalizers.md:3
msgid "`Finalizers` allow controllers to implement asynchronous pre-delete hooks. If you create an external resource (such as a storage bucket) for each object of your API type, and you want to delete the associated external resource on object's deletion from Kubernetes, use a finalizer to do that."
msgstr "`Finalizers` 允许控制器实现异步删除前钩子。若为 API 类型的每个对象创建外部资源（如存储桶），并希望在从 Kubernetes 删除对象时删除关联的外部资源，请使用 Finalizer。"

#: src/reference/using-finalizers.md:8
msgid "You can read more about the finalizers in the [Kubernetes reference docs](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/extend-kubernetes/custom-resources/custom-resource-definitions/#finalizers). The section below demonstrates how to register and trigger pre-delete hooks in the `Reconcile` method of a controller."
msgstr "您可以在[Kubernetes参考文档](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/extend-kubernetes/custom-resources/custom-resource-definitions/#finalizers)中阅读更多关于最终器的信息。下面的部分演示了如何在控制器的`Reconcile`方法中注册和触发预删除钩子。"

#: src/reference/using-finalizers.md:11
msgid "The key point to note is that a finalizer causes \"delete\" on the object to become an \"update\" to set deletion timestamp. Presence of deletion timestamp on the object indicates that it is being deleted. Otherwise, without finalizers, a delete shows up as a reconcile where the object is missing from the cache."
msgstr "需要注意的关键点是，最终处理器导致对象的\"删除\"变成\"更新\"，以设置删除时间戳。对象上存在删除时间戳表明该对象正在被删除。否则，如果没有最终处理器，删除会表现为一个调整过程，其中对象在缓存中丢失。"

#: src/reference/using-finalizers.md:16
msgid "Highlights:"
msgstr "亮点："

#: src/reference/using-finalizers.md:17
msgid "If the object is not being deleted and does not have the finalizer registered, then add the finalizer and update the object in Kubernetes."
msgstr "如果对象没有被删除且没有注册终结器，则在 Kubernetes 中添加终结器并更新该对象。"

#: src/reference/using-finalizers.md:19
msgid "If object is being deleted and the finalizer is still present in finalizers list, then execute the pre-delete logic and remove the finalizer and update the object."
msgstr "如果对象正在被删除，并且最终器仍然在最终器列表中，那么请执行预删除逻辑，移除最终器并更新对象。"

#: src/reference/using-finalizers.md:22
msgid "Ensure that the pre-delete logic is idempotent."
msgstr "确保预删除逻辑是幂等的。"

#: src/reference/using-finalizers.md:52
msgid "\"k8s.io/kubernetes/pkg/apis/batch\""
msgstr "\"k8s.io/kubernetes/pkg/apis/batch\""

