msgid "**However**, when developing Kubernetes-native solutions (controllers, operators, webhooks) that run on the cluster, you should follow the [Kubernetes Logging Conventions](https://github.com/kubernetes/community/blob/master/contributors/devel/sig-instrumentation/logging.md#message-style-guidelines) for better observability and consistency with the Kubernetes ecosystem."
msgstr "**但是**，在开发运行于集群上的 Kubernetes 原生方案（controller、operator、webhook）时，应遵循 [Kubernetes 日志约定](https://github.com/kubernetes/community/blob/master/contributors/devel/sig-instrumentation/logging.md#message-style-guidelines)，以获得更好的可观测性并与 Kubernetes 生态保持一致。"

