msgstr "不要以句号结束消息。"

#: src/reference/good-practices.md:90
msgid "Use active voice. Use complete sentences when there is an acting subject (\"A could not do B\") or omit the subject if the subject would be the program itself (\"Could not do B\")."
msgstr "使用主动语态。有动作主体时使用完整句子（「A could not do B」）；若主体就是程序本身则可省略主体（「Could not do B」）。"

#: src/reference/good-practices.md:91
