msgstr "**Go 约定**针对会被组合进更大上下文、并与其他文本内联显示的错误消息进行了优化"

#: src/reference/good-practices.md:110
msgid "**Kubernetes conventions** are optimized for structured logging in distributed systems where logs are:"
