#: src/reference/good-practices.md:114
msgid "Used for alerting and troubleshooting in production"
msgstr "用于生产环境中的告警与故障排查"

#: src/reference/good-practices.md:116
msgid "Following these conventions ensures your logs integrate seamlessly with Kubernetes observability tools and provide clear, actionable information for cluster operators and SREs."
msgstr "遵循这些约定可确保日志与 Kubernetes 可观测性工具无缝集成，并为集群运维人员和 SRE 提供清晰、可操作的信息。"

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:1
msgid "(Alpha) Server-Side Apply"
msgstr "（Alpha）Server-Side Apply"

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:3
msgid "The `--ssa` flag scaffolds APIs with [Server-Side Apply](https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/using-api/server-side-apply/) support, enabling safer field management when multiple actors modify the same resources."
msgstr "`--ssa` 标志会脚手架生成带 [Server-Side Apply](https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/using-api/server-side-apply/) 支持的 API，使多个参与者修改同一资源时字段管理更安全。"

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:8
msgid "The `--ssa` flag is an alpha feature and may change in future releases."
msgstr "`--ssa` 标志为 alpha 功能，未来版本可能变更。"

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:12
msgid "This adds:"
msgstr "这将添加："

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:13
msgid "API markers (`+genclient`, `+kubebuilder:ac:generate=true`) for ApplyConfiguration generation"
msgstr "用于生成 ApplyConfiguration 的 API 标记（`+genclient`、`+kubebuilder:ac:generate=true`）"

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:14
msgid "Makefile integration to generate type-safe ApplyConfiguration types alongside CRD and RBAC manifests"
msgstr "Makefile 集成，在生成 CRD 与 RBAC 清单的同时生成类型安全的 ApplyConfiguration 类型"

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:18
msgid "Use Server-Side Apply when:"
msgstr "在以下情况使用 Server-Side Apply："

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:19
msgid "Multiple controllers or users manage the same resource"
msgstr "多个控制器或用户管理同一资源"

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:20
msgid "Users customize CRs with labels, annotations, or spec fields your controller shouldn't overwrite"
msgstr "用户用标签、注解或你的控制器不应覆盖的 spec 字段自定义 CR"

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:21
msgid "You want declarative field ownership tracking"
msgstr "你需要声明式字段所有权跟踪"

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:22
msgid "Other operators will manage instances of your CRs (they can import your generated ApplyConfiguration types)"
msgstr "其他 Operator 将管理你的 CR 实例（它们可导入你生成的 ApplyConfiguration 类型）"

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:27
msgid "For controllers that are the sole owner of a resource and manage the entire object, traditional `Update()` is simpler and sufficient. Use Server-Side Apply when field ownership matters."
msgstr "对于作为资源唯一所有者并管理整个对象的 controller，传统的 `Update()` 更简单且足够。当字段所有权重要时再使用 Server-Side Apply。"

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:33
msgid "Traditional `Update()` overwrites the entire object. Server-Side Apply with the client's `Apply` method only manages the fields you specify."
msgstr "传统的 `Update()` 会覆盖整个对象。使用客户端 `Apply` 方法的 Server-Side Apply 只管理你指定的字段。"

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:35
msgid "After running `make manifests`, ApplyConfiguration types are created at:"
msgstr "运行 `make manifests` 后，ApplyConfiguration 类型创建于："

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:41
msgid "Import them as (multi-group projects use `example.com/myproject/api/<group>/v1/applyconfiguration/<group>/v1`):"
msgstr "导入方式如下（多 group 项目使用 `example.com/myproject/api/<group>/v1/applyconfiguration/<group>/v1`）："

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:44 src/reference/server-side-apply.md:82
msgid "\"example.com/myproject/api/v1/applyconfiguration/api/v1\""
msgstr "\"example.com/myproject/api/v1/applyconfiguration/api/v1\""

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:47
msgid "Mixing SSA and non-SSA APIs"
msgstr "混合使用 SSA 与非 SSA API"

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:49
msgid "The `+kubebuilder:ac:generate=true` marker in `groupversion_info.go` is package-level: it enables ApplyConfiguration generation for the group/version. Each kind then opts in or out with its own `+kubebuilder:ac:generate` marker: kinds scaffolded with `--ssa` get `=true`, and kinds scaffolded without it get `=false`. When you create an API with `--ssa`, kinds previously scaffolded without this marker in that group/version receive it automatically."
msgstr "`groupversion_info.go` 中的 `+kubebuilder:ac:generate=true` marker 是包级的：它为该 group/version 启用 ApplyConfiguration 生成。每个 kind 再用自己的 `+kubebuilder:ac:generate` marker 选择加入或排除：用 `--ssa` 脚手架的 kind 为 `=true`，未使用的为 `=false`。当你用 `--ssa` 创建 API 时，该 group/version 中此前脚手架且没有此 marker 的 kind 会自动获得它。"

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:51
msgid "To change which kinds are generated:"
msgstr "要更改生成哪些 kind："

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:52
msgid "Set `+kubebuilder:ac:generate=true` above a kind to include it"
msgstr "在 kind 上方设置 `+kubebuilder:ac:generate=true` 以包含它"

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:53
msgid "Set `+kubebuilder:ac:generate=false` above a kind to exclude it"
msgstr "在 kind 上方设置 `+kubebuilder:ac:generate=false` 以排除它"

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:58
msgid "If your project has customizations and kubebuilder cannot update the Makefile or a `*_types.go` file, it logs a warning with the manual change required. Scaffolding is not interrupted."
msgstr "若项目有自定义修改且 kubebuilder 无法更新 Makefile 或某个 `*_types.go` 文件，会记录警告并说明所需手动变更。脚手架过程不会中断。"

#: src/reference/server-side-apply.md:60
msgid "APIs added manually (not tracked in the PROJECT file) are not updated automatically. Review them and add `+kubebuilder:ac:generate=false` above any kind that should not use Server-Side Apply."
msgstr "手动添加的 API（未在 PROJECT 文件中跟踪）不会自动更新。请检查它们，并在不应使用 Server-Side Apply 的 kind 上方添加 `+kubebuilder:ac:generate=false`。"

