#: src/reference/raising-events.md:1
msgid "Creating events"
msgstr "创建活动"

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:3
msgid "It is often useful to publish _Event_ objects from the controller Reconcile function as they allow users or any automated processes to see what is going on with a particular object and respond to them."
msgstr "在控制器的 Reconcile 函数中发布 _Event_ 对象通常是非常有用的，因为它们允许用户或任何自动化过程了解特定对象的状态并做出相应的响应。"

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:5
msgid "Recent Events for an object can be viewed by running `$ kubectl describe <resource kind> <resource name>`. Also, they can be checked by running `$ kubectl get events`."
msgstr "可以通过运行 `$ kubectl describe <资源类型> <资源名称>` 来查看对象的最近事件。也可以通过运行 `$ kubectl get events` 来检查事件。"

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:10
msgid "Be aware that it is **not** recommended to emit Events for all operations. If authors raise too many events, it brings bad UX experiences for those consuming the solutions on the cluster, and they may find it difficult to filter an actionable event from the cluster. For more information, please take a look at the [Kubernetes APIs convention](https://github.com/kubernetes/community/blob/master/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventions.md#events)."
msgstr "请注意，不建议为所有操作发出事件。如果作者发出过多事件，将对集群中使用解决方案的用户带来不好的用户体验，他们可能会发现很难从集群中过滤出可操作的事件。有关更多信息，请查阅 [Kubernetes API 约定](https://github.com/kubernetes/community/blob/master/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventions.md#events)。"

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:14
msgid "Writing events"
msgstr "撰写事件"

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:16
msgid "Anatomy of an Event:"
msgstr "事件的构成："

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:22
msgid "`regarding` is the object this event is about."
msgstr "`regarding` 是此事件相关的对象。"

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:23
msgid "`related` is an optional secondary object related to this event (use `nil` if not applicable)."
msgstr "`related` 是与此事件相关的可选次要对象（不适用时使用 `nil`）。"

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:24
msgid "`eventtype` is this event type, and is either _Normal_ or _Warning_. ([More info](https://github.com/kubernetes/api/blob/6c11c9e4685cc62e4ddc8d4aaa824c46150c9148/core/v1/types.go#L6019-L6024))"
msgstr "`eventtype` 是事件类型，可以是 _Normal_ 或 _Warning_。 ([更多信息](https://github.com/kubernetes/api/blob/6c11c9e4685cc62e4ddc8d4aaa824c46150c9148/core/v1/types.go#L6019-L6024))"

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:25
msgid "`reason` is the reason the controller generates this event. It should be short and unique with `UpperCamelCase` format. The value could appear in _switch_ statements by automation. ([More info](https://github.com/kubernetes/api/blob/6c11c9e4685cc62e4ddc8d4aaa824c46150c9148/core/v1/types.go#L6048))"
msgstr "`reason` 是控制器生成此事件的原因。应为简短且唯一的 `UpperCamelCase` 格式。该值可能出现在自动化的 _switch_ 语句中。（[更多信息](https://github.com/kubernetes/api/blob/6c11c9e4685cc62e4ddc8d4aaa824c46150c9148/core/v1/types.go#L6048)）"

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:26
msgid "`action` is the action that was taken/failed regarding the object."
msgstr "`action` 是针对该对象已执行/失败的操作。"

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:27
msgid "`message` is a human-readable description with optional format arguments."
msgstr "`message` 是带有可选格式参数的人类可读描述。"

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:34
msgid "Following is an example of a code implementation that raises an Event."
msgstr "以下是引发事件的代码实现示例。"

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:37
msgid ""
"// The following implementation will raise an event\n"
msgstr ""
"// 以下实现将触发一个事件\n"

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:38
msgid "\"Deleting\""
msgstr "\"Deleting\""

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:38
msgid "\"DeleteCR\""
msgstr "\"DeleteCR\""

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:39
msgid "\"Custom Resource %s is being deleted from the namespace %s\""
msgstr "\"Custom Resource %s is being deleted from the namespace %s\""

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:45
msgid "How to be able to raise events"
msgstr "如何能够触发事件？"

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:47
msgid "Following are the steps with examples to help you raise events in your controller's reconciliations. Events are published from a Controller using an [EventRecorder](https://github.com/kubernetes/community/blob/master/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventions.md#events)`type CorrelatorOptions struct`, which can be created for a Controller by calling `GetEventRecorder(name string)` on a Manager. See that we change the implementation scaffolded in `cmd/main.go`:"
msgstr "以下是一些步骤和示例，帮助您在控制器的调整中触发事件。事件是通过使用[EventRecorder](https://github.com/kubernetes/community/blob/master/contributors/devel/sig-architecture/api-conventions.md#events)的`type CorrelatorOptions struct`从控制器发布的，可以通过在管理器上调用`GetRecorder(name string)`来为控制器创建。请注意，我们将更改在`cmd/main.go`中构建的实现。"

