msgstr "在控制器上允许使用 EventRecorder"

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:65
msgid "To raise an event, you must have access to `events.EventRecorder` in the Controller.  Therefore, first update the controller implementation:"
msgstr "要引发事件，您必须在控制器中访问 `record.EventRecorder`。因此，首先让我们更新控制器的实现："

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:69
msgid "\"k8s.io/client-go/tools/events\""
msgstr "\"k8s.io/client-go/tools/events\""

#: src/reference/raising-events.md:71
msgid ""
"// MyKindReconciler reconciles a MyKind object\n"
msgstr ""
"// MyKindReconciler 调整一个 MyKind 对象\n"

