#: src/reference/watching-resources/secondary-owned-resources.md:137
msgid "Watching secondary resources"
msgstr "观看辅助资源"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/secondary-owned-resources.md:139
msgid "To ensure that changes to the secondary resource (such as the `Deployment`) trigger a reconciliation of the primary resource (`Busybox`), configure the controller to watch both resources."
msgstr "为了确保对次要资源（例如 `Deployment`）的更改能够触发对主要资源（`Busybox`）的对账，我们配置控制器以监视这两个资源。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/secondary-owned-resources.md:143
msgid "The `Owns()` method allows you to specify secondary resources that the controller should monitor. This way, the controller automatically reconciles the primary resource whenever the secondary resource changes (e.g., is updated or deleted)."
msgstr "`Owns()` 方法允许您指定控制器应该监控的辅助资源。这样，控制器将在辅助资源发生变化（例如，被更新或删除）时自动调整主资源。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/secondary-owned-resources.md:148
msgid "Example: Configuring `SetupWithManager` to watch secondary resources"
msgstr "示例：配置 `SetupWithManager` 以监视辅助资源"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/secondary-owned-resources.md:151
msgid ""
"// SetupWithManager sets up the controller with the Manager.\n"
"// The controller watches both the Busybox primary resource and the Deployment secondary resource.\n"
msgstr ""
"// SetupWithManager 使用 Manager 设置控制器。\n"
"// 控制器将同时监视 Busybox 主资源和 Deployment 次资源。\n"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/secondary-owned-resources.md:155
