#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:1
msgid "Using predicates to refine watches"
msgstr "使用谓词来优化手表"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:3
msgid "When working with controllers, it is often beneficial to use **Predicates** to filter events and control when the reconciliation loop should be triggered."
msgstr "在使用控制器时，使用 **谓词** 来过滤事件和控制何时触发调整循环通常是有益的。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:6
msgid "[Predicates](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/source#WithPredicates) allow you to define conditions based on events (such as create, update, or delete) and resource fields (such as labels, annotations, or status fields). By using **[Predicates](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/source#WithPredicates)**, you can refine your controller’s behavior to respond only to specific changes in the resources it watches."
msgstr "[谓词](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/source#WithPredicates) 允许您基于事件（例如创建、更新或删除）和资源字段（例如标签、注释或状态字段）定义条件。通过使用 **[谓词](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/source#WithPredicates)**，您可以细化控制器的行为，使其仅对所观察资源的特定变化做出响应。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:11
msgid "This can be especially useful when you want to refine which changes in resources should trigger a reconciliation. By using predicates, you avoid unnecessary reconciliations and can ensure that the controller only reacts to relevant changes."
msgstr "这在你想要细化哪些资源的变化应该触发对账时尤其有用。通过使用谓词，你可以避免不必要的对账，并确保控制器仅对相关变化做出反应。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:16
msgid "When to use predicates"
msgstr "何时使用谓词"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:18
msgid "**Predicates are useful when:**"
msgstr "**谓词在以下情况下很有用：**"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:20
msgid "You want to ignore certain changes, such as updates that do not impact the fields your controller is concerned with."
msgstr "您想忽略某些更改，例如那些不影响控制器关注的字段的更新。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:21
msgid "You want to trigger reconciliation only for resources with specific labels or annotations."
msgstr "您只想对具有特定标签或注释的资源触发调整。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:22
msgid "You want to watch external resources and react only to specific changes."
msgstr "您希望监视外部资源，并仅对特定更改做出反应。"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:24
msgid "Example: Using predicates to filter update events"
msgstr "示例：使用谓词过滤更新事件"

#: src/reference/watching-resources/predicates-with-watch.md:26
msgid "Suppose the **`BackupBusybox`** controller should reconcile only when certain fields of the **`Busybox`** resource change, for example, when the `spec.size` field changes, but should ignore all other changes (such as status updates)."
msgstr "假设 **`BackupBusybox`** controller 仅应在 **`Busybox`** 资源的某些字段变更时对账，例如 `spec.size` 字段变更，而应忽略所有其他变更（如 status 更新）。"

