#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:1
msgid "Admission webhooks"
msgstr "入场webhook"

#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:3
msgid "[Admission webhooks](https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/access-authn-authz/extensible-admission-controllers/#what-are-admission-webhooks) are HTTP callbacks that receive admission requests, process them and return admission responses."
msgstr "[Admission Webhooks](https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/access-authn-authz/extensible-admission-controllers/#what-are-admission-webhooks) 是接收入场请求的 HTTP 回调，处理这些请求并返回入场响应。"

#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:6
msgid "Kubernetes provides the following types of admission webhooks:"
msgstr "Kubernetes 提供以下类型的准入 webhook："

#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:8
msgid "**Mutating Admission Webhook**: These can mutate the object while it is being created or updated, before it gets stored. It can be used to default fields in a resource requests, e.g. fields in Deployment that are not specified by the user. It can be used to inject sidecar containers."
msgstr "**变更Admission Webhook**：这些Webhook可以在对象创建或更新时对其进行变更，在对象被存储之前。它可以用于在资源请求中设置字段的默认值，例如，在用户未指定的Deployment字段中。还可以用于注入边车容器。"

#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:14
msgid "**Validating Admission Webhook**: These can validate the object while it is being created or updated, before it gets stored. It allows more complex validation than pure schema-based validation. e.g. cross-field validation and pod image whitelisting."
msgstr "**验证入场 Webhook**：这些可以在对象被创建或更新时进行验证，确保其在存储之前有效。它允许比纯基于模式的验证更复杂的验证，例如跨字段验证和容器镜像白名单。"

#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:19
msgid "The apiserver by default does not authenticate itself to the webhooks. However, if you want to authenticate the clients, you can configure the apiserver to use basic auth, bearer token, or a cert to authenticate itself to the webhooks. See the [Kubernetes authentication documentation](https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/access-authn-authz/extensible-admission-controllers/#authenticate-apiservers) for detailed steps."
msgstr "默认情况下，apiserver 并不会对 webhook 进行身份验证。然而，如果您想要对客户端进行身份验证，您可以配置 apiserver 使用基本身份验证、令牌或证书来对 webhook 进行身份验证。您可以在[这里](https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/access-authn-authz/extensible-admission-controllers/#authenticate-apiservers)找到详细步骤。"

#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:27
msgid "**Validating webhooks run after all mutating webhooks**, so you do not need to worry about another webhook changing an object after your validation has accepted it."
msgstr "**验证 webhook 在所有改变性 webhook 之后运行**，因此您无需担心在验证接受对象之后另一个 webhook 会更改该对象。"

#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:34
msgid "By default, Kubebuilder generates webhook paths based on the resource's group, version, and kind. For example:"
msgstr "默认情况下，Kubebuilder 根据资源的 group、version 和 kind 生成 Webhook 路径。例如："

#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:35
msgid "Mutating webhook for `batch/v1/CronJob`: `/mutate-batch-v1-cronjob`"
msgstr "`batch/v1/CronJob` 的变更 Webhook：`/mutate-batch-v1-cronjob`"

#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:36
msgid "Validating webhook for `batch/v1/CronJob`: `/validate-batch-v1-cronjob`"
msgstr "`batch/v1/CronJob` 的校验 Webhook：`/validate-batch-v1-cronjob`"

#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:38
msgid "You can specify custom paths for webhooks using dedicated flags:"
msgstr "你可以使用专用标志为 Webhook 指定自定义路径："

#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:58
msgid "Custom webhook paths require **controller-runtime v0.21+**. In earlier versions (\\< `v0.21`), the webhook path follows a fixed pattern based on the resource's group, version, and kind, and cannot be customized."
msgstr "自定义 webhook 路径需要 **controller-runtime v0.21+**。在更早版本（\\< `v0.21`）中，webhook 路径遵循基于资源 group、version 和 kind 的固定模式，且无法自定义。"

#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:63
msgid "Handling resource status in admission webhooks"
msgstr "在入场Webhook中处理资源状态"

#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:68
msgid "**You cannot modify or default the status of a resource using a mutating admission webhook**. Set initial status in your controller when you first see a new object."
msgstr "**您无法通过变更的 admission webhook 修改或设置资源的状态**。在您的控制器中，当您首次看到一个新对象时，请设置初始状态。"

#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:73
msgid "Understanding why"
msgstr "理解原因："

#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:75
msgid "Mutating admission webhooks"
msgstr "变异 admission Webhooks"

#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:77
msgid "Mutating Admission Webhooks are primarily designed to intercept and modify requests concerning the creation, modification, or deletion of objects. Though they possess the capability to modify an object's specification, directly altering its status is not deemed a standard practice, often leading to unintended results."
msgstr "变更的 Admission Webhooks 主要旨在拦截和修改与对象的创建、修改或删除相关的请求。尽管它们具备修改对象规格的能力，但直接更改对象的状态并不被视为标准做法，通常会导致意外结果。"

#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:83
msgid ""
"// MutatingWebhookConfiguration allows for modification of objects.\n"
"// However, direct modification of the status might result in unexpected behavior.\n"
msgstr ""
"// MutatingWebhookConfiguration 允许对对象进行修改。\n"
