#: src/reference/admission-webhook.md:92
msgid "For those diving into custom controllers for custom resources, it is imperative to grasp the concept of setting an initial status. This initialization typically takes place within the controller itself. The moment the controller identifies a new instance of its managed resource, primarily through a watch mechanism, it holds the authority to assign an initial status to that resource."
msgstr "对于那些深入研究自定义资源的自定义控制器的人来说，了解设置初始状态的概念是至关重要的。这个初始化通常在控制器内部进行。当控制器通过监视机制识别到其管理资源的新实例时，它有权为该资源分配一个初始状态。"

