"    }\n"
"    "

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:24
msgid "The status subresource allows you to update the status field separately from the rest of the resource spec, and prevents updates to the status subresource when updating the root object. This is useful for separating user-provided spec from system-provided status."
msgstr "status 子资源允许你独立于资源其余 spec 更新 status 字段，并在更新根对象时防止更新 status 子资源。这有助于将用户提供的 spec 与系统提供的 status 分开。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:30
msgid ""
"    // +kubebuilder:subresource:status\n"
"    type MyCRD struct {\n"
"        metav1.TypeMeta\n"
"        metav1.ObjectMeta\n"
"        Spec   MyCRDSpec\n"
"        Status MyCRDStatus\n"
"    }\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"    // +kubebuilder:subresource:status\n"
"    type MyCRD struct {\n"
"        metav1.TypeMeta\n"
"        metav1.ObjectMeta\n"
"        Spec   MyCRDSpec\n"
"        Status MyCRDStatus\n"
"    }\n"
"    "

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:40
msgid "The scale subresource allows you to use `kubectl scale` and the HorizontalPodAutoscaler with your CRD."
msgstr "scale 子资源允许你对 CRD 使用 `kubectl scale` 和 HorizontalPodAutoscaler。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:44
msgid ""
"    // +kubebuilder:subresource:scale:specpath=.spec.replicas,statuspath=.status.replicas,selectorpath=.status.selector\n"
"    type MyCRD struct {\n"
"        metav1.TypeMeta\n"
"        metav1.ObjectMeta\n"
"        Spec MyCRDSpec\n"
"        Status MyCRDStatus\n"
"    }\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"    // +kubebuilder:subresource:scale:specpath=.spec.replicas,statuspath=.status.replicas,selectorpath=.status.selector\n"
"    type MyCRD struct {\n"
"        metav1.TypeMeta\n"
"        metav1.ObjectMeta\n"
"        Spec MyCRDSpec\n"
"        Status MyCRDStatus\n"
"    }\n"
"    "

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:54
msgid "The selector field must be the _string_ form (serialized form) of a selector. Setting a pod label selector is necessary for your type to work with the HorizontalPodAutoscaler. This is typically .status.selector."
msgstr "selector 字段必须是选择器的_字符串_形式（序列化形式）。设置 pod 标签选择器是你的类型与 HorizontalPodAutoscaler 配合工作的必要条件。通常为 .status.selector。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:60
msgid "This is where the desired number of replicas is stored (typically .spec.replicas)."
msgstr "此处存储期望副本数（通常为 .spec.replicas）。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:64
msgid "This is where the actual number of replicas is stored (typically .status.replicas)."
msgstr "此处存储实际副本数（通常为 .status.replicas）。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:68
msgid "When conversion is enabled for a CRD (i.e. it's not a trivial-versions/single-version CRD), one version is set as the \"storage version\" to be stored in etcd.  Attempting to store any other version will result in conversion to the storage version via a conversion webhook."
msgstr "当为 CRD 启用 conversion（即不是 trivial-versions/单版本 CRD）时，会将一个版本设为存储在 etcd 中的 \"storage version\"。尝试存储任何其他版本都会通过 conversion webhook 转换为 storage version。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:74
msgid ""
"    // +kubebuilder:storageversion\n"
"    type MyCRDv2 struct {\n"
"        metav1.TypeMeta\n"
"        metav1.ObjectMeta\n"
"        Spec MyCRDSpec\n"
"    }\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"    // +kubebuilder:storageversion\n"
"    type MyCRDv2 struct {\n"
"        metav1.TypeMeta\n"
"        metav1.ObjectMeta\n"
"        Spec MyCRDSpec\n"
"    }\n"
"    "

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:83
msgid "This is useful if you need to skip generating and listing version entries for 'internal' resource versions, which typically exist if using the Kubernetes upstream conversion-gen tool."
msgstr "若需要跳过为「内部」资源版本生成和列出版本条目，这很有用；使用 Kubernetes 上游 conversion-gen 工具时通常会存在此类版本。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:89
msgid ""
"    // +kubebuilder:skipversion\n"
"    type MyCRDInternal struct {\n"
"        // internal version not served by API\n"
"    }\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"    // +kubebuilder:skipversion\n"
"    type MyCRDInternal struct {\n"
"        // internal version not served by API\n"
"    }\n"
"    "

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:96
msgid "Field selectors allow users to filter resources based on field values when listing. For example, `kubectl get mycrds --field-selector status.phase=Running`."
msgstr "字段选择器允许用户在列出时按字段值过滤资源。例如：`kubectl get mycrds --field-selector status.phase=Running`。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:101
msgid ""
"    // +kubebuilder:selectablefield:JSONPath=&#34;.status.phase&#34;\n"
"    type MyCRD struct {\n"
"        metav1.TypeMeta\n"
"        metav1.ObjectMeta\n"
"        Status MyCRDStatus\n"
"    }\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"    // +kubebuilder:selectablefield:JSONPath=&#34;.status.phase&#34;\n"
"    type MyCRD struct {\n"
"        metav1.TypeMeta\n"
"        metav1.ObjectMeta\n"
"        Status MyCRDStatus\n"
"    }\n"
"    "

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:110
msgid "The path is relative to the resource root. Example: `.status.phase`."
msgstr "路径相对于资源根。示例：`.status.phase`。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:116
msgid ""
"    // +kubebuilder:resource:path=mycrdplural,singular=mycrdsingular,shortName=mc;mcrd,categories=all,scope=Namespaced\n"
"    type MyCRD struct {\n"
"        metav1.TypeMeta\n"
"        metav1.ObjectMeta\n"
"    }\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"    // +kubebuilder:resource:path=mycrdplural,singular=mycrdsingular,shortName=mc;mcrd,categories=all,scope=Namespaced\n"
"    type MyCRD struct {\n"
"        metav1.TypeMeta\n"
"        metav1.ObjectMeta\n"
"    }\n"
"    "

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:124
msgid "Group aliases are used to work with groups of resources at once. The most common one is \"all\" which covers about a third of the base resources in Kubernetes, and is generally used for \"user-facing\" resources. This allows users to run commands like `kubectl get all` to include your CRD."
msgstr "Group alias 用于一次处理一组资源。最常见的是 \"all\"，覆盖约三分之一的 Kubernetes 基础资源，通常用于「面向用户」的资源。这允许用户运行 `kubectl get all` 这类命令时包含你的 CRD。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:131
msgid "It generally corresponds to a plural, lower-cased version of the Kind. For example, if the Kind is \"MyCRD\", the path might be \"mycrds\". See https://book.kubebuilder.io/cronjob-tutorial/gvks.html."
msgstr "它通常对应 Kind 的复数小写形式。例如，若 Kind 为 \"MyCRD\"，路径可能是 \"mycrds\"。参见 https://book.kubebuilder.io/cronjob-tutorial/gvks.html。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:137
msgid "Scope defaults to \"Namespaced\".  Cluster-scoped (\"Cluster\") resources don't exist in namespaces and are accessible from anywhere in the cluster."
msgstr "Scope 默认为 \"Namespaced\"。集群作用域（\"Cluster\"）资源不存在于命名空间中，可从集群任意位置访问。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:142
msgid "Short names are often used when people have work with your resource over and over again.  For instance, \"rs\" for \"replicaset\" or \"crd\" for customresourcedefinition. Multiple short names can be specified separated by semicolons."
msgstr "短名称常用于反复操作同一资源的场景。例如 \"rs\" 表示 \"replicaset\"，\"crd\" 表示 customresourcedefinition。可用分号分隔指定多个短名称。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:149
msgid "The singular form is otherwise defaulted off the plural (path). This is used in API responses and `kubectl` output."
msgstr "单数形式否则从复数（path）默认推导。用于 API 响应与 `kubectl` 输出。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:154
msgid "This allows you to customize which columns are shown when users run `kubectl get` on your CRD."
msgstr "这允许你自定义用户对 CRD 运行 `kubectl get` 时显示的列。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:158
msgid ""
"    // +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=&#34;Status&#34;,type=string,JSONPath=`.status.phase`\n"
"    // +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=&#34;Age&#34;,type=date,JSONPath=`.metadata.creationTimestamp`\n"
"    type MyCRD struct {\n"
"        metav1.TypeMeta\n"
"        metav1.ObjectMeta\n"
"    }\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"    // +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=&#34;Status&#34;,type=string,JSONPath=`.status.phase`\n"
"    // +kubebuilder:printcolumn:name=&#34;Age&#34;,type=date,JSONPath=`.metadata.creationTimestamp`\n"
"    type MyCRD struct {\n"
"        metav1.TypeMeta\n"
"        metav1.ObjectMeta\n"
"    }\n"
"    "

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:167
msgid "The path is relative to the resource root. Example: `.status.phase` or `.spec.replicas`."
msgstr "路径相对于资源根。示例：`.status.phase` 或 `.spec.replicas`。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:171
msgid "Display behavior is client-dependent; see CustomResourceColumnDefinition in the Kubernetes API docs."
msgstr "显示行为取决于客户端；参见 Kubernetes API 文档中的 CustomResourceColumnDefinition。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:175
msgid "It may be any OpenAPI data format corresponding to the type, listed at https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification/blob/master/versions/2.0.md#data-types."
msgstr "可以是与类型对应的任意 OpenAPI 数据格式，列表见 https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification/blob/master/versions/2.0.md#data-types。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:180
msgid "Lower priority (_higher_ numbered) columns will be hidden if the terminal width is too small. Priority 0 columns are always shown."
msgstr "优先级较低（数字_较大_）的列会在终端宽度过小时隐藏。优先级为 0 的列始终显示。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:185
msgid "It may be any OpenAPI data type listed at https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification/blob/master/versions/2.0.md#data-types. Common values: \"string\", \"integer\", \"number\", \"boolean\", \"date\"."
msgstr "可以是 https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification/blob/master/versions/2.0.md#data-types 中列出的任意 OpenAPI 数据类型。常见值：\"string\"、\"integer\"、\"number\"、\"boolean\"、\"date\"。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:191
msgid "For example adding annotation \"api-approved.kubernetes.io\" for a CRD with Kubernetes groups, or annotation \"cert-manager.io/inject-ca-from-secret\" for a CRD that needs CA injection."
msgstr "例如为带 Kubernetes groups 的 CRD 添加注解 \"api-approved.kubernetes.io\"，或为需要 CA 注入的 CRD 添加注解 \"cert-manager.io/inject-ca-from-secret\"。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:196
msgid ""
"    // +kubebuilder:metadata:annotations=&#34;api-approved.kubernetes.io/v1=https://github.com/myorg/myrepo/pull/123&#34;\n"
"    // +kubebuilder:metadata:labels=&#34;app=myapp&#34;\n"
"    type MyCRD struct {\n"
"        metav1.TypeMeta\n"
"        metav1.ObjectMeta\n"
"    }\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"    // +kubebuilder:metadata:annotations=&#34;api-approved.kubernetes.io/v1=https://github.com/myorg/myrepo/pull/123&#34;\n"
"    // +kubebuilder:metadata:labels=&#34;app=myapp&#34;\n"
"    type MyCRD struct {\n"
"        metav1.TypeMeta\n"
"        metav1.ObjectMeta\n"
"    }\n"
"    "

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:205
msgid "Format: \"key=value\". Multiple annotations can be specified by repeating the marker."
msgstr "格式：\"key=value\"。可通过重复标记指定多个注解。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:209
msgid "Format: \"key=value\". Multiple labels can be specified by repeating the marker."
msgstr "格式：\"key=value\"。可通过重复标记指定多个标签。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:213 src/reference/markers/crd.md:218
msgid "The url is required and must be a valid URL. The description is optional and provides a short description of the external documentation."
msgstr "url 为必填且必须是有效 URL。description 可选，用于简短描述外部文档。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:223
msgid "Deprecated versions show a warning message when used. This is useful for communicating to users that they should migrate to a newer version."
msgstr "已弃用版本在使用时会显示警告消息。这对于告知用户应迁移到更新版本很有用。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:228
msgid ""
"    // +kubebuilder:deprecatedversion:warning=&#34;v1alpha1 is deprecated; use v1 instead&#34;\n"
"    type MyCRDv1alpha1 struct {\n"
"        metav1.TypeMeta\n"
"        metav1.ObjectMeta\n"
"    }\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"    // +kubebuilder:deprecatedversion:warning=&#34;v1alpha1 is deprecated; use v1 instead&#34;\n"
"    type MyCRDv1alpha1 struct {\n"
"        metav1.TypeMeta\n"
"        metav1.ObjectMeta\n"
"    }\n"
"    "

#: src/reference/markers/crd.md:236
msgid "This message is displayed to users when they interact with the deprecated version."
msgstr "当用户与已弃用版本交互时显示此消息。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:3
msgid "These markers modify how the CRD validation schema is produced for the types and fields they modify.  Each corresponds roughly to an OpenAPI/JSON schema option."
msgstr "这些标记会修改 CRD 验证模式在其修改的类型和字段上的生成方式。每个标记大致对应于一个 OpenAPI/JSON 模式选项。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:7
#: src/reference/markers/crd-processing.md:6
msgid "See [Generating CRDs](/reference/generating-crd.md) for examples."
msgstr "请参阅 [生成 CRD](/reference/generating-crd.md) 以获取示例。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:12
msgid "Certain markers may seem duplicated. However, these markers are grouped based on their context of use — such as fields, types, or arrays. For instance, a marker like `+kubebuilder:validation:Enum` can be applied to individual fields or array items, and this flexibility is reflected in the documentation."
msgstr "某些标记可能看起来重复。然而，这些标记是根据它们的使用上下文进行分组的——例如字段、类型或数组。例如，一个像 `+kubebuilder:validation:Enum` 的标记可以应用于单个字段或数组项，这种灵活性在文档中有所体现。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:16
msgid "The grouping ensures clarity by showing how the same marker can be reused for different purposes."
msgstr "这种分组确保了清晰性，展示了同一个标记如何可以被用于不同的目的。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:23
msgid "Custom resources are validated using the generated OpenAPI v3 schema and must comply with Kubernetes structural schema rules. Only field types and constraints that can be represented in the CRD schema are enforced by the API server."
msgstr "自定义资源使用生成的 OpenAPI v3 schema 进行验证，且必须遵守 Kubernetes structural schema 规则。API 服务器仅强制执行可在 CRD schema 中表示的字段类型与约束。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:26
msgid "Numeric types are constrained by [Kubernetes CRD OpenAPI v3 schema compatibility](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/extend-kubernetes/custom-resources/custom-resource-definitions/#validation). In practice, prefer Go types that map cleanly to the supported OpenAPI formats (for example, `int32` and `int64` for integers). For values that require decimal-like representation, use `resource.Quantity`."
msgstr "数值类型受 [Kubernetes CRD OpenAPI v3 schema 兼容性](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/extend-kubernetes/custom-resources/custom-resource-definitions/#validation) 约束。实践中优先使用能干净映射到受支持 OpenAPI 格式的 Go 类型（例如整数用 `int32` 和 `int64`）。需要类小数表示的值请使用 `resource.Quantity`。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:30
msgid "Use Kubebuilder validation markers to declare additional constraints — such as minimum and maximum values, length limits, patterns, enums, and list or map rules — so they are reflected in the generated CRD and validated at runtime."
msgstr "使用 Kubebuilder 校验 markers 声明额外约束——例如最小值与最大值、长度限制、模式、枚举以及 list 或 map 规则——以便它们反映在生成的 CRD 中并在运行时校验。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:35
msgid "This is often not necessary, but may be helpful with custom serialization."
msgstr "通常不必如此，但对自定义序列化可能有帮助。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:39
msgid ""
"    // +nullable\n"
"    Description *string\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"    // +nullable\n"
"    Description *string\n"
"    "

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:44
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:105
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:464
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:525
msgid "expression evaluates to true."
msgstr "表达式求值为 true。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:46
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:107
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:466
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:527
msgid "This marker may be repeated to specify multiple expressions, all of which must evaluate to true."
msgstr "此标记可重复以指定多个表达式，所有这些表达式都必须求值为 true。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:49
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:110
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:469
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:530
msgid "CEL expressions can use: self (current value) and oldSelf (previous value; only on update, null on create). Rules are scoped to where they appear in the schema; self is that value."
msgstr "CEL 表达式可使用：self（当前值）和 oldSelf（先前值；仅在更新时，创建时为 null）。规则作用域为其在 schema 中出现的位置；self 即为该值。"

