#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:492
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:553
msgid "If unset, the default is \"failed rule: {Rule}\". Must not contain line breaks. The API server limits length (e.g. 256 characters). See ValidationRule in k8s.io/apiextensions-apiserver for full details. Example: Message=\"replicas must be between minReplicas and maxReplicas\""
msgstr "若未设置，默认为 \"failed rule: {Rule}\"。不得包含换行。API 服务器有长度限制（例如 256 个字符）。完整细节见 k8s.io/apiextensions-apiserver 中的 ValidationRule。示例：Message=\"replicas must be between minReplicas and maxReplicas\""

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:79
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:140
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:499
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:560
msgid "You can set Message or MessageExpression, not both. MessageExpression must return a string. If both are set, MessageExpression is used. If neither is set, a default message is used. The expression can use the same variables as the Rule (e.g. self, oldSelf). The result must not contain line breaks and is subject to the same message limits as Message. Example: MessageExpression=\"'replicas must be between ' + string(self.minReplicas) + ' and ' + string(self.maxReplicas)\""
msgstr "可以设置 Message 或 MessageExpression，不能同时设置。MessageExpression 必须返回字符串。若两者都设置，使用 MessageExpression。若都未设置，使用默认消息。表达式可使用与 Rule 相同的变量（例如 self、oldSelf）。结果不得包含换行，并受与 Message 相同的消息长度限制。示例：MessageExpression=\"'replicas must be between ' + string(self.minReplicas) + ' and ' + string(self.maxReplicas)\""

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:87
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:148
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:507
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:568
msgid "When true, oldSelf may be missing: use oldSelf.hasValue() to check and oldSelf.value() to use it. The rule always runs; you must check oldSelf.hasValue() in the rule before using oldSelf. May only be set if the rule uses oldSelf. See ValidationRule in k8s.io/apiextensions-apiserver. Example: OptionalOldSelf=true"
msgstr "为 true 时，oldSelf 可能缺失：使用 oldSelf.hasValue() 检查，并用 oldSelf.value() 取值。规则始终运行；使用 oldSelf 前必须在规则中检查 oldSelf.hasValue()。仅当规则使用 oldSelf 时可设置。参见 k8s.io/apiextensions-apiserver 中的 ValidationRule。示例：OptionalOldSelf=true"

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:94
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:155
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:514
#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:575
msgid "Supported values: \"FieldValueInvalid\", \"FieldValueForbidden\", \"FieldValueRequired\", \"FieldValueDuplicate\". If not set, defaults to \"FieldValueInvalid\". Example: Reason=\"FieldValueInvalid\""
msgstr "支持的值：\"FieldValueInvalid\"、\"FieldValueForbidden\"、\"FieldValueRequired\"、\"FieldValueDuplicate\"。未设置时默认为 \"FieldValueInvalid\"。示例：Reason=\"FieldValueInvalid\""

