#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:1007
msgid "For optional fields, a single transition from unset to set is allowed."
msgstr "对于可选字段，允许从 unset 到 set 的单次转换。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:1009
msgid "Note that immutable fields that are nested below optional fields can still be updated by unsetting the optional parent field and re-setting it again."
msgstr "注意：嵌套在可选字段下的不可变字段仍可通过取消设置可选父字段并重新设置来更新。"

#: src/reference/markers/crd-validation.md:1014
msgid ""
"    // +k8s:immutable\n"
