msgid "Here is how you use the `+kubebuilder:scaffold` marker in a typical `main.go` file. To illustrate how it works, consider the following command to create a new API:"
msgstr "以下是如何在典型的 `main.go` 文件中使用 `+kubebuilder:scaffold` 标记。为了说明它的工作原理，考虑下面的命令来创建一个新的 API："

