msgid "To register a new scheme"
msgstr "注册新方案"

#: src/reference/markers/scaffold.md:58
msgid "Kubebuilder uses the `+kubebuilder:scaffold:scheme` marker to register newly created API versions with the runtime scheme, ensuring the manager recognizes the API types."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 使用 `+kubebuilder:scaffold:scheme` marker 将新创建的 API 版本注册到 runtime scheme，确保 manager 识别这些 API 类型。"

