msgid "You'll need to use \"v1\" to get support for features like defaulting, along with an API server that supports it (Kubernetes 1.16+)."
msgstr "需要使用 \"v1\" 才能获得 defaulting 等特性支持，并需要支持它的 API 服务器（Kubernetes 1.16+）。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:65
