msgid "Specifies spec.preserveUnknownFields value that is false and omitted by default. This value can only be specified for CustomResourceDefinitions that were created with `apiextensions.k8s.io/v1beta1`."
msgstr "指定默认为 false 且省略的 spec.preserveUnknownFields 值。此值仅可为用 `apiextensions.k8s.io/v1beta1` 创建的 CustomResourceDefinition 指定。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:71
msgid "The field can be set for compatibility reasons, although strongly discouraged, resource authors should move to a structural OpenAPI schema instead."
msgstr "可为兼容性设置该字段，但强烈不建议；资源作者应改用结构化 OpenAPI schema。"

