msgid "0 indicates drop the description for all fields completely. n indicates limit the description to at most n characters and truncate the description to closest sentence boundary if it exceeds n characters."
msgstr "0 表示完全丢弃所有字段的描述。n 表示将描述限制为最多 n 个字符，若超过 n 个字符则截断到最近的句子边界。"

