msgid "DeepCopyObject method implementations."
msgstr "DeepCopyObject 方法实现。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:93
msgid "It will generate output for each \"CRD Version\" (API version of the CRD type itself) , e.g. apiextensions/v1) available."
msgstr "它会为每个可用的 \"CRD Version\"（CRD 类型本身的 API 版本，例如 apiextensions/v1）生成输出。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:104
msgid "Output rules"
msgstr "输出规则"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:106
msgid "Output rules configure how a given generator outputs its results. There is always one global \"fallback\" output rule (specified as `output:<rule>`), plus per-generator overrides (specified as `output:<generator>:<rule>`)."
msgstr "输出规则配置了给定生成器如何输出其结果。始终有一个全局的\"回退\"输出规则（指定为 `output:<rule>`），加上每个生成器的覆盖规则（指定为 `output:<generator>:<rule>`）。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:114
msgid "When you do not manually specify a fallback rule, controller-gen uses a set of default per-generator rules which result in YAML going to `config/<generator>`, and code staying where it belongs."
msgstr "若未手动指定回退规则，controller-gen 使用一组默认的按生成器规则：YAML 输出到 `config/<generator>`，代码则留在原处。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:118
msgid "The default rules are equivalent to `output:<generator>:artifacts:config=config/<generator>` for each generator."
msgstr "默认规则等价于 `output:<generator>:artifacts:config=config/<generator>` 对于每个生成器。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:122
msgid "When a \"fallback\" rule is specified, that will be used instead of the default rules."
msgstr "当指定\"后备\"规则时，将使用该规则代替默认规则。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:125
msgid "For example, if you specify `crd rbac:roleName=controller-perms output:crd:stdout`, you will get CRDs on standard out, and rbac in a file in `config/rbac`. If you were to add in a global rule instead, like `crd rbac:roleName=controller-perms output:crd:stdout output:none`, you would get CRDs to standard out, and everything else to /dev/null, because we have explicitly specified a fallback."
msgstr "例如，如果您指定 `crd rbac:roleName=controller-perms output:crd:stdout`，您将获得标准输出上的 CRD，以及在 `config/rbac` 中的 rbac 文件。如果您改为添加全局规则，例如 `crd rbac:roleName=controller-perms output:crd:stdout output:none`，您将获得标准输出上的 CRD，而其他一切将输出到 /dev/null，因为我们已明确指定了回退。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:134
msgid "For brevity, the per-generator output rules (`output:<generator>:<rule>`) are omitted below.  They are equivalent to the global fallback options listed here."
msgstr "为简洁起见，下面省略了每个生成器的输出规则（`output:<generator>:<rule>`）。它们等同于此处列出的全局后备选项。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:140
msgid "Generally useful for single-artifact outputs."
msgstr "通常适用于单产物输出。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:144
