msgstr "非包关联产物输出到 Config 目录，包关联产物输出到其包源文件目录，除非在 Code 中指定了备用路径。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:156
msgid "Other options"
msgstr "其他选项"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:160
msgid "for code generation."
msgstr "用于代码生成。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:162
msgid "Multiple paths can be specified using the brace-delimited form or a semicolon-separated list."
msgstr "可使用花括号形式或分号分隔列表指定多个路径。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:165
msgid "Each path is classified as either a filesystem path or a Go package/module name, following the same rules used by the \"go\" command. A path is treated as a filesystem path if it is absolute, or begins with \".\" or \"..\". All other paths are treated as Go package or module names. For more information on path classification, run \"go help packages\"."
msgstr "每个路径会被分类为文件系统路径或 Go 包/模块名，遵循与 \"go\" 命令相同的规则。若路径为绝对路径，或以 \".\" 或 \"..\" 开头，则视为文件系统路径。所有其他路径视为 Go 包或模块名。有关路径分类的更多信息，请运行 \"go help packages\"。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:173
msgid ""
"    // brace-delimited form (preferred when specifying multiple paths)\n"
"    paths=&#34;{./api/..., ./pkg/...}&#34;\n"
"    \n"
"    // semicolon-separated form\n"
"    paths=./api/...;./pkg/...\n"
"    \n"
"    // filesystem paths (absolute or beginning with . or ..)\n"
"    paths=./...\n"
"    paths=./api/v1\n"
"    paths=/home/user/project/api\n"
"    \n"
"    // Go package or module names\n"
"    paths=sigs.k8s.io/controller-tools/pkg/...\n"
"    paths=example.com/myproject/api/v1\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"    // brace-delimited form (preferred when specifying multiple paths)\n"
"    paths=&#34;{./api/..., ./pkg/...}&#34;\n"
"    \n"
"    // semicolon-separated form\n"
"    paths=./api/...;./pkg/...\n"
"    \n"
"    // filesystem paths (absolute or beginning with . or ..)\n"
"    paths=./...\n"
"    paths=./api/v1\n"
"    paths=/home/user/project/api\n"
"    \n"
"    // Go package or module names\n"
"    paths=sigs.k8s.io/controller-tools/pkg/...\n"
"    paths=example.com/myproject/api/v1\n"
"    "

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:188
msgid "When a filesystem path ends with \"...\", controller-gen crosses module boundaries and includes packages from any nested Go modules found in subdirectories (directories that contain their own go.mod file). This is useful when working in a repository with multiple Go modules and you want to run generation across all of them in a single invocation. This behavior does not apply to Go package or module names, which follow standard Go module rules and stay within a single module."
msgstr "当文件系统路径以 \"...\" 结尾时，controller-gen 会跨越模块边界，并包含子目录中发现的任何嵌套 Go 模块中的包（包含自己 go.mod 文件的目录）。这在多 Go 模块仓库中、希望单次调用跨所有模块运行生成时很有用。此行为不适用于 Go 包或模块名，后者遵循标准 Go 模块规则并停留在单个模块内。"

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:198
msgid ""
"    // given this layout:\n"
"    //   myrepo/go.mod\n"
"    //   myrepo/api/v1/\n"
"    //   myrepo/subproject/go.mod  (nested module)\n"
"    //   myrepo/subproject/api/\n"
"    \n"
"    // this includes packages from both modules:\n"
"    paths=./...\n"
"    \n"
"    // this includes only the root module:\n"
"    paths=sigs.k8s.io/myrepo/...\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"    // given this layout:\n"
"    //   myrepo/go.mod\n"
"    //   myrepo/api/v1/\n"
"    //   myrepo/subproject/go.mod  (nested module)\n"
"    //   myrepo/subproject/api/\n"
"    \n"
"    // this includes packages from both modules:\n"
"    paths=./...\n"
"    \n"
"    // this includes only the root module:\n"
"    paths=sigs.k8s.io/myrepo/...\n"
"    "

#: src/reference/controller-gen.md:210
msgid "To limit generation to a single module, use a Go package or module name rather than a filesystem path."
msgstr "要将生成限制到单个 module，请使用 Go package 或 module 名称而非文件系统路径。"

#: src/reference/completion.md:1
