#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:1
msgid "Monitoring performance with Pprof"
msgstr "使用 Pprof 监控性能"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:3
msgid "[Pprof](https://github.com/google/pprof), a Go profiling tool, helps identify performance bottlenecks in areas like CPU and memory usage. It's integrated with the controller-runtime library's HTTP server, enabling profiling via HTTP endpoints. You can visualize the data using go tool pprof. Since [Pprof](https://github.com/google/pprof) is built into controller-runtime, no separate installation is needed. [Manager options](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/manager) make it easy to enable pprof and gather runtime metrics to optimize controller performance."
msgstr "[Pprof](https://github.com/google/pprof) 是一个 Go 性能分析工具，帮助识别 CPU 和内存使用等方面的性能瓶颈。它与 controller-runtime 库的 HTTP 服务器集成，允许通过 HTTP 端点进行性能分析。您可以使用 `go tool pprof` 可视化数据。由于 [Pprof](https://github.com/google/pprof) 已内置于 controller-runtime 中，因此不需要单独安装。[管理器选项](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/manager) 使启用 pprof 和收集运行时指标变得简单，从而优化控制器性能。"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:8
msgid "While [Pprof](https://github.com/google/pprof) is an excellent tool for profiling and debugging, it is not recommended to leave it enabled in production environments. The primary reasons are:"
msgstr "虽然[Pprof](https://github.com/google/pprof)是一个优秀的性能分析和调试工具，但不建议在生产环境中启用它。主要原因如下："

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:10
msgid "**Security Risk**: The profiling endpoints expose detailed information about your application's performance and resource usage, which could be exploited if accessed by unauthorized users."
msgstr "**安全风险**：性能分析端点暴露了有关您应用程序的性能和资源使用的详细信息，如果被未经授权的用户访问，可能会被利用。"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:11
msgid "**Overhead**: Running profiling can introduce performance overhead, mainly CPU usage, especially under heavy load, potentially impacting production workloads."
msgstr "**开销**：运行性能分析可能会引入性能开销，主要是 CPU 使用率，尤其在高负载情况下，可能会影响生产工作负载。"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:15
msgid "How to use Pprof"
msgstr "如何使用 Pprof？"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:17
msgid "**Enabling Pprof**"
msgstr "**启用 Pprof**"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:19
msgid "In your `cmd/main.go` file, add the field:"
msgstr "在您的`cmd/main.go`文件中，添加字段："

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:21
msgid ""
"```golang\n"
"mgr, err := ctrl.NewManager(ctrl.GetConfigOrDie(), ctrl.Options{\n"
"  ...\n"
"  // PprofBindAddress is the TCP address that the controller should bind to\n"
"  // for serving pprof. Specify the manager address and the port that should be bind.\n"
"  PprofBindAddress:       \":8082\",\n"
"  ...\n"
"})\n"
"```"
msgstr "```golangmgr, err := ctrl.NewManager(ctrl.GetConfigOrDie(), ctrl.Options{  ...  // PprofBindAddress 是控制器应绑定以提供 pprof 的 TCP 地址  // 指定管理器的地址和应绑定的端口。  PprofBindAddress:       \":8082\",  ...})```\""

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:31
msgid "**Test it out**"
msgstr "**试一试**"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:33
msgid "After enabling [Pprof](https://github.com/google/pprof), you need to build and deploy your controller to test it out. Follow the steps in the [Quick Start guide](../quick-start.md#test-it-out) to run your project locally or on a cluster."
msgstr "在启用[Pprof](https://github.com/google/pprof)之后，您需要构建并部署您的控制器以进行测试。请按照[快速入门指南](../quick-start.md#test-it-out)中的步骤，在本地或集群上运行您的项目。"

#: src/reference/pprof-tutorial.md:35
msgid "Then, you can apply your CRs/samples in order to monitor the performance of its controllers."
msgstr "然后，您可以应用您的CRs/样本以监控其控制器的性能。"

