#: src/reference/scopes.md:1
msgid "Understanding scopes in Kubebuilder"
msgstr "理解 Kubebuilder 中的作用域"

#: src/reference/scopes.md:3
msgid "In Kubernetes, **scope** defines the boundaries within which a resource or controller operates."
msgstr "在 Kubernetes 中，**作用域**定义资源或控制器运行的边界。"

#: src/reference/scopes.md:5
msgid "When building with Kubebuilder, you work with two independent scoping concepts:"
msgstr "使用 Kubebuilder 构建时，你会处理两个独立的作用域概念："

#: src/reference/scopes.md:7
msgid "**[Manager Scope](./manager-scope.md)** - Determines which namespace(s) your manager watches and operates in"
msgstr "**[Manager 作用域](./manager-scope.md)** - 决定 manager 监视并操作哪些命名空间"

#: src/reference/scopes.md:8
msgid "**[CRD Scope](./crd-scope.md)** - Determines whether your custom resources are namespace-specific or cluster-wide"
msgstr "**[CRD 作用域](./crd-scope.md)** - 决定自定义资源是命名空间特定还是集群范围"

#: src/reference/scopes.md:10
msgid "What is scope?"
msgstr "什么是作用域？"

#: src/reference/scopes.md:12
msgid "Scope defines the visibility and access boundaries in a Kubernetes cluster:"
msgstr "作用域定义 Kubernetes 集群中的可见性与访问边界："

#: src/reference/scopes.md:14
msgid "**Cluster-scoped**: Operates across the entire cluster with access to all namespaces"
msgstr "**集群作用域**：跨整个集群运行并可访问所有命名空间"

#: src/reference/scopes.md:15
msgid "**Namespace-scoped**: Limited to specific namespace(s) for isolation and security"
msgstr "**命名空间作用域**：限制到特定命名空间以实现隔离与安全"

#: src/reference/scopes.md:17
msgid "Manager scope vs CRD scope"
msgstr "Manager 作用域与 CRD 作用域"

#: src/reference/scopes.md:19
msgid "These concepts are **independent** and configured separately:"
msgstr "这些概念**彼此独立**且分别配置："

#: src/reference/scopes.md:21
msgid "**Manager Scope**: Controls which namespace(s) the manager watches (configured via deployment RBAC and cache)"
msgstr "**Manager 作用域**：控制 manager 监视哪些命名空间（通过 deployment RBAC 与缓存配置）"

#: src/reference/scopes.md:22
msgid "**CRD Scope**: Controls whether custom resources are namespace-specific or cluster-wide (configured in CRD manifest)"
msgstr "**CRD 作用域**：控制自定义资源是命名空间特定还是集群范围（在 CRD 清单中配置）"

#: src/reference/scopes.md:24
msgid "You can combine them in different ways - for example, a cluster-scoped manager can manage namespace-scoped CRDs (the default pattern)."
msgstr "你可以按不同方式组合它们——例如，集群作用域的 manager 可以管理命名空间作用域的 CRD（默认模式）。"

#: src/reference/scopes.md:26
msgid "Learn more"
msgstr "了解更多"

#: src/reference/scopes.md:28
msgid "For detailed information, configuration steps, and code examples:"
msgstr "详细信息、配置步骤与代码示例："

#: src/reference/scopes.md:30
msgid "**[Manager Scope](./manager-scope.md)** - Manager scope configuration, RBAC, cache setup, and namespace watching"
msgstr "**[Manager 作用域](./manager-scope.md)** - Manager 作用域配置、RBAC、缓存设置与命名空间监视"

#: src/reference/scopes.md:31
msgid "**[CRD Scope](./crd-scope.md)** - CRD scope configuration, markers, and RBAC considerations"
