#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:5
msgid "Sub-Module Layouts (in a way you could call them a special form of [Monorepo's](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monorepo)) are a special use case and can help in scenarios that involve reuse of APIs without introducing indirect dependencies that should not be available in the project consuming the API externally."
msgstr "子模块布局（可以称之为 [Monorepo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monorepo) 的一种特殊形式）是一个特殊的用例，可以在涉及重用 API 的场景中提供帮助，而不会引入不应在外部调用 API 的项目中出现的间接依赖。"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:10
msgid "If you are looking to do operations and reconcile via a controller a Type(CRD) which are owned by another project or By Kubernetes API then, please see [Using an external Resources/API](/reference/using_an_external_resource.md) for more info."
msgstr "如果您希望通过控制器对属于另一个项目或由 Kubernetes API 拥有的 Type（CRD）进行操作和对账，请参阅 [使用外部资源/API](/reference/using_an_external_type.md) 以获取更多信息。"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:18
msgid "Separate `go.mod` modules for APIs and Controllers can help for the following cases:"
msgstr "为 APIs 和 Controllers 使用分开的 `go.mod` 模块可以帮助解决以下情况："

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:20
msgid "There is an enterprise version of an operator available that wants to reuse APIs from the Community Version"
msgstr "有一个企业版的 Operator 可用，它希望重用社区版的 API。"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:21
msgid "There are many (possibly external) modules depending on the API and you want to have a more strict separation of transitive dependencies"
msgstr "有许多（可能是外部的）模块依赖于该 API，您希望对传递依赖关系进行更严格的分离。"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:22
msgid "If you want to reduce impact of transitive dependencies on your API being included in other projects"
msgstr "如果您想减少传递依赖对您的 API 被其他项目包含的影响"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:23
msgid "If you are looking to separately manage the lifecycle of your API release process from your controller release process."
msgstr "如果您希望将 API 发布过程的生命周期与控制器发布过程分开管理。"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:24
msgid "If you are looking to modularize your codebase without splitting your code between multiple repositories."
msgstr "如果您希望在不将代码分割到多个代码库的情况下对代码库进行模块化。"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:26
msgid "They introduce however multiple caveats into typical projects which is one of the main factors that makes them hard to recommend in a generic use-case or plugin:"
msgstr "然而，他们在典型项目中引入了多个警告，这是使它们在通用用例或插件中难以推荐的主要因素之一："

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:28
msgid "Multiple `go.mod` modules are not recommended as a go best practice and [multiple modules are mostly discouraged](https://github.com/golang/go/wiki/Modules#faqs--multi-module-repositories)"
msgstr "多个 `go.mod` 模块并不被推荐作为 Go 的最佳实践，并且 [多个模块大多是不鼓励的](https://github.com/golang/go/wiki/Modules#faqs--multi-module-repositories)。"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:29
msgid "There is always the possibility to extract your APIs into a new repository and arguably also have more control over the release process in a project spanning multiple repos relying on the same API types."
msgstr "你总是可以将你的API提取到一个新的代码库中，并且在一个跨多个代码库、依赖于相同API类型的项目中，可能会对发布过程有更多的控制。"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:30
msgid "It requires at least one [replace directive](https://go.dev/ref/mod#go-mod-file-replace) either through `go.work` which is at least 2 more files plus an environment variable for build environments without GO_WORK or through `go.mod` replace, which has to be manually dropped and added for every release."
msgstr "它至少需要一个 [替换指令](https://go.dev/ref/mod#go-mod-file-replace)，要么通过 `go.work`（这至少需要两个以上的文件以及一个用于没有 GO_WORK 的构建环境的环境变量），要么通过 `go.mod` 替换，这需要在每次发布时手动添加和移除。"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:35
msgid "When deciding to deviate from the standard kubebuilder `PROJECT` setup or the extended layouts offered by its plugins, it can result in increased maintenance overhead as there can be breaking changes in upstream that could break with the custom module structure described here."
msgstr "当决定偏离标准的 kubebuilder `PROJECT` 设置或其插件所提供的扩展布局时，可能会导致维护成本增加，因为上游可能会出现破坏性变化，这可能会与此处描述的自定义模块结构不兼容。"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:37
msgid "Splitting your codebase to multiple repos and/or multiple modules incurs costs that grow over time. You need to define clear version dependencies between your own modules, do phased upgrades carefully, etc. Especially for small-to-medium projects, one repo and one module is the best way to go."
msgstr "将代码库拆分为多个仓库和/或多个模块会带来成本，并且这些成本会随着时间的推移而增加。你需要在自己的模块之间定义清晰的版本依赖关系，谨慎进行分阶段升级等。特别是对于小型到中型项目，一个仓库和一个模块是最佳选择。"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:39
msgid "Bear in mind, that it is not recommended to deviate from the proposed layout unless you know what you are doing. You may also lose the ability to use some of the CLI features and helpers. For further information on the project layout, see the doc [What's in a basic project?](./../cronjob-tutorial/basic-project.md)"
msgstr "请记住，除非您知道自己在做什么，否则不建议偏离建议的布局。否则，您可能会失去使用某些 CLI 功能和助手的能力。有关项目布局的更多信息，请参阅文档 [基础项目包含哪些内容？](./../cronjob-tutorial/basic-project.md)"

