#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:164
msgid "You are able to work with this locally without having to build your module."
msgstr "您可以在本地进行此操作，而无需构建您的模块。"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:166
msgid "When using `go.work` files, it is recommended to not commit them into the repository and add them to `.gitignore`."
msgstr "在使用 `go.work` 文件时，建议不要将它们提交到版本库，并将其添加到 `.gitignore` 中。"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:173
msgid "When releasing with a present `go.work` file, make sure to set the environment variable `GOWORK=off` (verifiable with `go env GOWORK`) to make sure the release process does not get impeded by a potentially committed `go.work` file."
msgstr "在发布时，请确保将环境变量 `GOWORK=off` 设置为关闭（可通过 `go env GOWORK` 验证），以确保发布过程不受可能已提交的 `go.work` 文件的影响。"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:175
msgid "Adjusting the Dockerfile"
msgstr "调整 Dockerfile"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:177
msgid "When building your controller image, kubebuilder by default is not able to work with multiple modules. You have to manually add the new API module into the download of dependencies:"
msgstr "在构建您的控制器镜像时，kubebuilder 默认无法处理多个模块。您需要手动将新的 API 模块添加到依赖项的下载中："

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:180
msgid ""
"```dockerfile\n"
"# Build the manager binary\n"
"FROM docker.io/golang:1.20 as builder\n"
"ARG TARGETOS\n"
"ARG TARGETARCH\n"
"\n"
"WORKDIR /workspace\n"
"# Copy the Go Modules manifests\n"
"COPY go.mod go.mod\n"
"COPY go.sum go.sum\n"
"# Copy the Go Sub-Module manifests\n"
"COPY api/v1alpha1/go.mod api/go.mod\n"
"COPY api/v1alpha1/go.sum api/go.sum\n"
"# cache deps before building and copying source so that we do not need to re-download as much\n"
"# and so that source changes do not invalidate our downloaded layer\n"
"RUN go mod download\n"
"\n"
"# Copy the go source\n"
"COPY cmd/main.go cmd/main.go\n"
"COPY api/ api/\n"
"COPY internal/controller/ internal/controller/\n"
"\n"
"# Build\n"
"# the GOARCH has not a default value to allow the binary be built according to the host where the command\n"
"# was called. For example, if you call make docker-build in a local env which has the Apple Silicon M1 SO\n"
"# the docker BUILDPLATFORM arg is linux/arm64 when for Apple x86 it is linux/amd64. Therefore,\n"
"# by leaving it empty you can ensure that the container and binary shipped on it has the same platform.\n"
"RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=${TARGETOS:-linux} GOARCH=${TARGETARCH} go build -a -o manager cmd/main.go\n"
"\n"
"# Use distroless as minimal base image to package the manager binary\n"
"# Refer to https://github.com/GoogleContainerTools/distroless for more details\n"
"FROM gcr.io/distroless/static:nonroot\n"
"WORKDIR /\n"
"COPY --from=builder /workspace/manager .\n"
"USER 65532:65532\n"
"\n"
"ENTRYPOINT [\"/manager\"]\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```dockerfile\n"
"# Build the manager binary\n"
"FROM docker.io/golang:1.20 as builder\n"
"ARG TARGETOS\n"
"ARG TARGETARCH\n"
"\n"
"WORKDIR /workspace\n"
"# Copy the Go Modules manifests\n"
"COPY go.mod go.mod\n"
"COPY go.sum go.sum\n"
"# Copy the Go Sub-Module manifests\n"
"COPY api/v1alpha1/go.mod api/go.mod\n"
"COPY api/v1alpha1/go.sum api/go.sum\n"
"# cache deps before building and copying source so that we do not need to re-download as much\n"
"# and so that source changes do not invalidate our downloaded layer\n"
"RUN go mod download\n"
"\n"
"# Copy the go source\n"
"COPY cmd/main.go cmd/main.go\n"
"COPY api/ api/\n"
"COPY internal/controller/ internal/controller/\n"
"\n"
"# Build\n"
"# the GOARCH has not a default value to allow the binary be built according to the host where the command\n"
"# was called. For example, if you call make docker-build in a local env which has the Apple Silicon M1 SO\n"
"# the docker BUILDPLATFORM arg is linux/arm64 when for Apple x86 it is linux/amd64. Therefore,\n"
"# by leaving it empty you can ensure that the container and binary shipped on it has the same platform.\n"
"RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 GOOS=${TARGETOS:-linux} GOARCH=${TARGETARCH} go build -a -o manager cmd/main.go\n"
"\n"
"# Use distroless as minimal base image to package the manager binary\n"
"# Refer to https://github.com/GoogleContainerTools/distroless for more details\n"
"FROM gcr.io/distroless/static:nonroot\n"
"WORKDIR /\n"
"COPY --from=builder /workspace/manager .\n"
"USER 65532:65532\n"
"\n"
"ENTRYPOINT [\"/manager\"]\n"
"```"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:219
msgid "Creating a new API and controller release"
msgstr "创建一个新的 API 和控制器版本"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:221
msgid "Because you adjusted the default layout, before releasing your first version of your operator, make sure to [familiarize yourself with mono-repo/multi-module releases](https://github.com/golang/go/wiki/Modules#faqs--multi-module-repositories) with multiple `go.mod` files in different subdirectories."
msgstr "因为你调整了默认布局，所以在发布你的操作员的第一个版本之前，请确保熟悉 [mono-repo/multi-module 发布](https://github.com/golang/go/wiki/Modules#faqs--multi-module-repositories)，涉及多个不同子目录中的 `go.mod` 文件。"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:223
msgid "Assuming a single API was created, the release process could look like this:"
msgstr "假设创建了一个单一的API，发布流程可能如下所示："

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:227
msgid ""
"# this is your main module release\n"
msgstr ""
"# 这是你的主要模块发布\n"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:228
msgid ""
"# this is your api release\n"
msgstr ""
"# 这是您的 API 发布版本\n"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:229
msgid ""
"# now we depend on the api module in the main module\n"
msgstr ""
"# 现在我们在主模块中依赖于 API 模块。\n"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:230
msgid ""
"# this will drop the replace directive for local development in case you use go modules, meaning the sources from the VCS is used instead of the ones in your monorepo checked out locally.\n"
msgstr ""
"# 这将移除本地开发中针对 Go 模块的替换指令，这意味着将使用来自版本控制系统的源代码，而不是您本地检出的单一代码库中的源代码。\n"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:234
msgid "After this, your modules is available in VCS and you do not need a local replacement anymore. However if you are making local changes, make sure to adopt your behavior with `replace` directives accordingly."
msgstr "在此之后，您的模块将在 VCS 中可用，您不再需要本地替换。然而，如果您进行本地更改，请确保根据 `replace` 指令调整您的行为。"

#: src/reference/submodule-layouts.md:237
msgid "Reusing your extracted API module"
