#: src/reference/using_an_external_resource.md:1
msgid "Using external resources"
msgstr "使用外部资源"

#: src/reference/using_an_external_resource.md:3
msgid "In some cases, your project may need to work with resources that are not defined by your own APIs. These external resources fall into two main categories:"
msgstr "在某些情况下，您的项目可能需要与未由您自己定义的API的资源进行协作。这些外部资源主要分为两个类别："

#: src/reference/using_an_external_resource.md:6
msgid "**Core Types**: API types defined by Kubernetes itself, such as `Pods`, `Services`, and `Deployments`."
msgstr "**核心类型**：由Kubernetes本身定义的API类型，例如`Pods`、`Services`和`Deployments`。"

#: src/reference/using_an_external_resource.md:7
msgid "**External Types**: API types defined in other projects, such as CRDs defined by another solution."
msgstr "**外部类型**：在其他项目中定义的API类型，例如由其他解决方案定义的CRD。"

#: src/reference/using_an_external_resource.md:9
msgid "Managing external types"
msgstr "管理外部类型"

#: src/reference/using_an_external_resource.md:11
msgid "Creating a controller for external types"
msgstr "为外部类型创建控制器"

#: src/reference/using_an_external_resource.md:13
msgid "To create a controller for an external type without scaffolding a resource, use the `create api` command with the `--resource=false` option and specify the path to the external API type using the `--external-api-path` and `--external-api-domain` flag options. This generates a controller for types defined outside your project, such as CRDs managed by other Operators."
msgstr "要为外部类型创建控制器而无需搭建资源，请使用 `create api` 命令并加上 `--resource=false` 选项，并使用 `--external-api-path` 和 `--external-api-domain` 标志选项指定外部 API 类型的路径。这将为项目外部定义的类型生成控制器，例如由其他 Operator 管理的 CRD（自定义资源定义）。"

#: src/reference/using_an_external_resource.md:19
msgid "The command looks like this:"
msgstr "该命令看起来像这样："

#: src/reference/using_an_external_resource.md:25
msgid "`--external-api-path`: Provide the Go import path where you define the external types."
msgstr "`--external-api-path`：提供定义外部类型的 Go import 路径。"

#: src/reference/using_an_external_resource.md:26
msgid "`--external-api-domain`: Provide the domain for the external types. Kubebuilder uses this value to generate RBAC permissions and create the QualifiedGroup, such as - `apiGroups: <group>.<domain>`"
msgstr "`--external-api-domain`：提供外部类型的域名。Kubebuilder 用此值生成 RBAC 权限并创建 QualifiedGroup，例如 - `apiGroups: <group>.<domain>`"

#: src/reference/using_an_external_resource.md:28
msgid "For example, if you are managing Certificates from Cert Manager:"
msgstr "例如，如果您正在管理来自 Cert Manager 的证书："

#: src/reference/using_an_external_resource.md:37
msgid "You can pin a specific version of the external API dependency using the `--external-api-module` flag:"
msgstr "你可以使用 `--external-api-module` 标志固定外部 API 依赖的特定版本："

#: src/reference/using_an_external_resource.md:47
msgid "The flag accepts the module path with optional version (e.g., `github.com/cert-manager/cert-manager@v1.18.2`). The module is stored in the PROJECT file and added to `go.mod` using `go get`, which cleanly adds it as a direct dependency without polluting go.mod with unnecessary indirect dependencies."
msgstr "该标志接受可选带版本的模块路径（例如 `github.com/cert-manager/cert-manager@v1.18.2`）。模块会存入 PROJECT 文件，并通过 `go get` 添加到 `go.mod`，干净地作为直接依赖添加，而不会用无用不必要的间接依赖污染 go.mod。"

