msgid ""
"//specify testEnv configuration\n"
msgstr ""
"//指定 testEnv 配置\n"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:82
msgid ""
"//start testEnv\n"
msgstr ""
"//开始测试环境\n"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:85
msgid ""
"//write test logic\n"
msgstr ""
"//编写测试逻辑\n"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:87
msgid ""
"//stop testEnv\n"
msgstr ""
"//停止测试环境\n"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:92
msgid "`kubebuilder` does the boilerplate setup and teardown of testEnv for you, in the ginkgo test suite that it generates under the `/controllers` directory."
msgstr "`kubebuilder` 在它生成的 `/controllers` 目录下的 ginkgo 测试套件中，为您处理测试环境的样板代码的设置和拆卸。"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:94
msgid "Logs from the test runs are prefixed with `test-env`."
msgstr "测试运行的日志以 `test-env` 为前缀。"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:99
msgid "You can use the plugin [DeployImage](../plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md) to check examples. This plugin allows users to scaffold API/Controllers to deploy and manage an Operand (image) on the cluster following the guidelines and best practices. It abstracts the complexities of achieving this goal while allowing users to customize the generated code."
msgstr "您可以使用插件 [DeployImage](../plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md) 来查看示例。该插件允许用户搭建 API/控制器，以便在集群上根据指南和最佳实践部署和管理一个 Operand（镜像）。它抽象了实现这一目标的复杂性，同时允许用户自定义生成的代码。"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:101
msgid "Therefore, you can check that the plugin generates a test using ENV TEST for the controller which ensures that the controller creates the Deployment successfully. You can see an example of its code implementation under the `testdata` directory with the [DeployImage](../plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md) [samples here](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/v4.6.0/testdata/project-v4-with-plugins/internal/controller/busybox_controller_test.go)."
msgstr "因此，您可以检查使用 ENV TEST 生成的测试，该测试的目的是确保成功创建 Deployment。您可以在 `testdata` 目录下看到其代码实现的示例，具体在 [DeployImage](../plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md) 的示例可在 [此处](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/v3.7.0/testdata/project-v4-with-plugins/controllers/busybox_controller_test.go) 查看。"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:105
msgid "Configuring your test control plane"
msgstr "配置您的测试控制平面"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:107
msgid "Controller-runtime’s [envtest](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/envtest) framework requires `kubectl`, `kube-apiserver`, and `etcd` binaries be present locally to simulate the API portions of a real cluster."
msgstr "Controller-runtime 的 [envtest](https://pkg.go.dev/sigs.k8s.io/controller-runtime/pkg/envtest) 框架需要本地有 `kubectl`、`kube-apiserver` 和 `etcd` 可执行文件，以模拟真实集群的 API 部分。"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:109
msgid "The `make test` command installs these binaries to the `bin/` directory and uses them when running tests that use `envtest`. Ie,"
msgstr "`make test` 命令将把这些二进制文件安装到 `bin/` 目录，并在运行使用 `envtest` 的测试时使用它们。即，"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:119
msgid "You can use environment variables and/or flags to specify the `kubectl`,`api-server` and `etcd` setup within your integration tests."
msgstr "您可以使用环境变量和/或标志来指定在集成测试中 `kubectl`、`api-server` 和 `etcd` 的设置。"

