msgstr "分别指向 api-server、etcd 和 kubectl 二进制文件的路径"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:127
msgid "Similar to `KUBEBUILDER_ASSETS`, but more granular. Point integration tests to use binaries other than the default ones. These environment variables can also be used to ensure specific tests run with expected versions of these binaries."
msgstr "类似于 `KUBEBUILDER_ASSETS`，但更为细化。指向集成测试使用除了默认二进制文件以外的其他二进制文件。这些环境变量还可以用来确保特定测试使用期望版本的这些二进制文件运行。"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:128
msgid "`KUBEBUILDER_CONTROLPLANE_START_TIMEOUT` and `KUBEBUILDER_CONTROLPLANE_STOP_TIMEOUT`"
msgstr "`KUBEBUILDER_CONTROLPLANE_START_TIMEOUT` 和 `KUBEBUILDER_CONTROLPLANE_STOP_TIMEOUT`"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:128
msgid "durations in format supported by [`time.ParseDuration`](https://golang.org/pkg/time/#ParseDuration)"
msgstr "支持 [`time.ParseDuration`](https://golang.org/pkg/time/#ParseDuration) 的格式的持续时间。"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:128
msgid "Specify timeouts different from the default for the test control plane to (respectively) start and stop; any test run that exceeds them fails."
msgstr "为测试控制平面指定不同于默认值的超时时间，以便（分别）启动和停止；任何超出这些时间的测试运行将失败。"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:129
msgid "`KUBEBUILDER_ATTACH_CONTROL_PLANE_OUTPUT`"
msgstr "`KUBEBUILDER_ATTACH_CONTROL_PLANE_OUTPUT`"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:129
msgid "Set to `true` to attach the control plane's stdout and stderr to os.Stdout and os.Stderr. This can be useful when debugging test failures, as output will include output from the control plane."
msgstr "将其设置为 `true` 以将控制平面的 stdout 和 stderr 附加到 os.Stdout 和 os.Stderr。当调试测试失败时，这可能很有用，因为输出将包括来自控制平面的输出。"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:131
