#: src/reference/envtest.md:168
msgid "Here's an example of modifying the flags with which to start the API server in your integration tests, compared to the default values in `envtest.DefaultKubeAPIServerFlags`:"
msgstr "这是一个示例，展示了在你的集成测试中修改启动 API 服务器的标志，与 `envtest.DefaultKubeAPIServerFlags` 中的默认值进行对比。"

