#: src/reference/envtest.md:185
msgid "Testing considerations"
msgstr "测试考虑事项"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:187
msgid "Unless you are using an existing cluster, keep in mind that no built-in controllers run in the test context. In some ways, the test control plane behaves differently from \"real\" clusters, and that might impact how you write tests. One common example is garbage collection; because no controllers monitor built-in resources, Kubernetes does not delete objects, even if you set up an `OwnerReference`."
msgstr "除非您正在使用现有的集群，否则请记住，在测试上下文中没有运行内置控制器。在某些方面，测试控制平面将与\"真实\"集群表现不同，这可能会影响您编写测试的方式。一个常见的例子是垃圾收集；因为没有控制器监视内置资源，尽管设置了 `OwnerReference`，对象也不会被删除。"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:189
msgid "To test that the deletion lifecycle works, test the ownership instead of asserting on existence. For example:"
msgstr "为了测试删除生命周期是否正常工作，请测试所有权，而不是仅仅断言存在性。例如："

#: src/reference/envtest.md:193
msgid "\"MyCoolCustomResource\""
msgstr "\"MyCoolCustomResource\""

#: src/reference/envtest.md:194
msgid "\"my.api.example.com/v1beta1\""
msgstr "\"my.api.example.com/v1beta1\""

#: src/reference/envtest.md:195
msgid "\"d9607e19-f88f-11e6-a518-42010a800195\""
msgstr "\"d9607e19-f88f-11e6-a518-42010a800195\""

#: src/reference/envtest.md:196
msgid "\"userSpecifiedResourceName\""
msgstr "\"userSpecifiedResourceName\""

#: src/reference/envtest.md:205
msgid "EnvTest does not support namespace deletion. Deleting a namespace seems to succeed, but Kubernetes just puts the namespace in a Terminating state, and never actually reclaims it. Trying to recreate the namespace fails. This causes your reconciler to continue reconciling any objects left behind, unless you delete them."
msgstr "EnvTest不支持命名空间的删除。删除命名空间看似成功，但实际情况是该命名空间会处于终止状态，并且永远不会被回收。尝试重新创建该命名空间将会失败。这将导致您的调整器继续调整任何遗留的对象，除非它们被删除。"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:207
msgid "To overcome this limitation you can create a new namespace for each test. Even so, when one test completes (e.g. in \"namespace-1\") and another test starts (e.g. in \"namespace-2\"), the controller will still be reconciling any active objects from \"namespace-1\". This can be avoided by ensuring that all tests clean up after themselves as part of the test teardown.  If teardown of a namespace is difficult, it may be possible to wire the reconciler in such a way that it ignores reconcile requests that come from namespaces other than the one being tested:"
msgstr "为了克服这一限制，您可以为每个测试创建一个新的命名空间。即便如此，当一个测试完成（例如在\"namespace-1\"中）而另一个测试开始（例如在\"namespace-2\"中）时，控制器仍会对\"namespace-1\"中的任何活动对象进行对账。通过确保所有测试在测试清理过程中进行自我清理，可以避免这种情况。如果命名空间的清理比较困难，可以考虑以某种方式配置对账器，使其忽略来自非测试命名空间的对账请求。"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:213
msgid ""
"// restrict namespaces to reconcile\n"
msgstr ""
"// 限制命名空间以进行调整\n"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:216
msgid "\"myreconciler\""
msgstr "\"myreconciler\""

#: src/reference/envtest.md:217
msgid ""
"// Ignore requests for other namespaces, if specified\n"
msgstr ""
"// 忽略其他命名空间的请求，如果有指定的话\n"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:222
msgid "Whenever your tests create a new namespace, it can modify the value of reconciler.Namespace. The reconciler will effectively ignore the previous namespace. For further information see the issue raised in the controller-runtime [controller-runtime/issues/880](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime/issues/880) to add this support."
msgstr "每当你的测试创建一个新的命名空间时，它会修改 reconciler.Namespace 的值。reconciler 将有效地忽略之前的命名空间。有关更多信息，请参阅在 controller-runtime 中提出的问题 [controller-runtime/issues/880](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime/issues/880)，以添加此支持。"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:226
msgid "Cert-manager and Prometheus options"
msgstr "Cert-Manager 和 Prometheus 选项"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:228
msgid "Projects scaffolded with Kubebuilder can enable the [`metrics`](./metrics.md) and the [`cert-manager`](../cronjob-tutorial/cert-manager.md) options. Note that when using ENV TEST, you are looking to test the controllers and their reconciliation. It is considered an integrated test because the ENV TEST API will do the test against a cluster and because of this the binaries are downloaded and used to configure its pre-requirements, however, its purpose is mainly to `unit` test the controllers."
msgstr "使用 Kubebuilder 创建的项目可以启用 [`metrics`](https://book.kubebuilder.io/reference/metrics.html) 和 [`cert-manager`](https://book.kubebuilder.io/cronjob-tutorial/cert-manager.html) 选项。请注意，当我们使用 ENV TEST 时，我们旨在测试控制器及其调整过程。这被视为集成测试，因为 ENV TEST API 会在集群中进行测试，因此会下载并使用二进制文件来配置其前置要求。然而，其主要目的是对控制器进行 `单元` 测试。"

#: src/reference/envtest.md:230
msgid "Therefore, to test a reconciliation in common cases you do not need to care about these options. However, if you would like to do tests with the Prometheus and the Cert-manager installed you can add the required steps to install them before running the tests. Following an example."
msgstr "因此，在常见情况下，测试对账时您不需要关注这些选项。但是，如果您希望在安装了 Prometheus 和 Cert-manager 的情况下进行测试，可以在运行测试之前添加安装它们所需的步骤。以下是一个示例。"

