#: src/reference/metrics.md:245
msgid "This option is not enabled by default because it introduces a dependency on CertManager. To keep the project as lightweight and beginner-friendly as possible, Kubebuilder disables it by default."
msgstr "此选项默认未启用，因为它引入了对 CertManager 的依赖。为了使项目尽可能轻量且适合初学者，它默认是禁用的。"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:253
msgid "The default scaffold in `cmd/main.go` uses a **controller-runtime feature** to automatically generate a self-signed certificate to secure the metrics server. While this is convenient for development and testing, it is **not** recommended for production."
msgstr "`cmd/main.go` 中的默认脚手架使用 **controller-runtime 功能** 自动生成自签名证书以保护指标服务器。虽然这在开发和测试中很方便，但**不**建议在生产环境中使用。"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:258
msgid "You use those certificates to secure the transport layer (TLS). The token authentication using `authn/authz`, which Kubebuilder enables by default, serves as the application-level credential. However, for example, when you enable the integration of your metrics with Prometheus, you can use those certificates to secure the communication."
msgstr "你使用这些证书保护传输层（TLS）。Kubebuilder 默认启用的基于 `authn/authz` 的令牌认证作为应用层凭证。不过，例如在启用 metrics 与 Prometheus 集成时，你也可以用这些证书保护通信。"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:266
msgid "Projects built with Kubebuilder releases `4.4.0` and above have the logic scaffolded to enable the usage of certificates managed by [CertManager](https://cert-manager.io/) for securing the metrics server. Following the steps below, you can configure your project to use certificates managed by CertManager."
msgstr "使用 Kubebuilder 版本 `4.4.0` 及以上构建的项目已经具备了启用使用由 [CertManager](https://cert-manager.io/) 管理的证书以保护指标服务器的逻辑。按照以下步骤，您可以配置您的项目以使用由 CertManager 管理的证书。"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:271
msgid "**Enable Cert-Manager in `config/default/kustomization.yaml`:**"
msgstr "**在 `config/default/kustomization.yaml` 中启用 Cert-Manager：**"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:272
