msgstr "取消注释 cert-manager 资源以将其包含在您的项目中："

#: src/reference/metrics.md:278
msgid "**Enable the Patch to configure the usage of the certs in the Controller Deployment in `config/default/kustomization.yaml`:**"
msgstr "**启用补丁以配置 `config/default/kustomization.yaml` 中控制器部署中证书的使用：**"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:279
msgid "Uncomment the `cert_metrics_manager_patch.yaml` to mount the `serving-cert` secret in the Manager Deployment."
msgstr "取消对 `cert_metrics_manager_patch.yaml` 的注释，以在管理器部署中挂载 `serving-cert` 密钥。"

