#: src/reference/metrics.md:375
msgid "The webhook NetworkPolicy allows ingress from all sources to the manager pod's webhook port. The Kubernetes API server reaches this port through the webhook Service for admission and CRD conversion webhooks. To restrict admission requests by namespace, set `namespaceSelector` on the `MutatingWebhookConfiguration` or `ValidatingWebhookConfiguration`. This setting controls which requests invoke an admission webhook; it does not restrict NetworkPolicy traffic."
msgstr "webhook NetworkPolicy 允许来自所有来源到 manager pod webhook 端口的入站流量。Kubernetes API 服务器通过 webhook Service 到达此端口，用于 admission 与 CRD conversion webhook。若要按命名空间限制 admission 请求，请在 `MutatingWebhookConfiguration` 或 `ValidatingWebhookConfiguration` 上设置 `namespaceSelector`。该设置控制哪些请求会调用 admission webhook；它不限制 NetworkPolicy 流量。"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:381
msgid "Exporting metrics for Prometheus"
msgstr "为 Prometheus 导出指标"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:383
msgid "Follow the steps below to export the metrics using the Prometheus Operator:"
msgstr "请按照以下步骤使用 Prometheus Operator 导出指标："

#: src/reference/metrics.md:385
msgid "Install Prometheus and Prometheus Operator. We recommend using [kube-prometheus](https://github.com/coreos/kube-prometheus#installing) in production if you do not have your own monitoring system. If you are just experimenting, you can only install Prometheus and Prometheus Operator."
msgstr "安装 Prometheus 和 Prometheus Operator。如果您没有自己的监控系统，我们建议在生产环境中使用 [kube-prometheus](https://github.com/coreos/kube-prometheus#installing)。如果您只是进行试验，可以仅安装 Prometheus 和 Prometheus Operator。"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:390
msgid "Uncomment the line `- ../prometheus` in the `config/default/kustomization.yaml`. It creates the `ServiceMonitor` resource which enables exporting the metrics."
msgstr "取消注释 `config/default/kustomization.yaml` 中的 `- ../prometheus` 这一行。它会创建 `ServiceMonitor` 资源，从而启用指标的导出。"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:394
msgid ""
"# [PROMETHEUS] To enable prometheus monitor, uncomment all sections with 'PROMETHEUS'.\n"
msgstr ""
"# [PROMETHEUS] 要启用 Prometheus 监控，请取消注释所有包含 'PROMETHEUS' 的部分。\n"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:395
msgid "../prometheus"
msgstr "../prometheus"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:398
msgid "Note that, when you install your project in the cluster, it creates the `ServiceMonitor` to export the metrics. To check the ServiceMonitor, run `kubectl get ServiceMonitor -n <project>-system`. See an example:"
msgstr "请注意，当您在集群中安装项目时，它会创建 `ServiceMonitor` 以导出指标。要检查 ServiceMonitor，请运行 `kubectl get ServiceMonitor -n <project>-system`。以下是一个示例："

#: src/reference/metrics.md:412
msgid "If you are using Prometheus Operator, be aware that, by default, its RBAC rules are only enabled for the `default` and `kube-system namespaces`. See its guide to know [how to configure kube-prometheus to monitor other namespaces using the `.jsonnet` file](https://github.com/prometheus-operator/kube-prometheus/blob/main/docs/monitoring-other-namespaces.md)."
msgstr "如果您正在使用 Prometheus Operator，请注意，其 RBAC 规则默认仅在 `default` 和 `kube-system` 命名空间中启用。请参阅其指南了解 [如何配置 kube-prometheus 以使用 `.jsonnet` 文件监控其他命名空间](https://github.com/prometheus-operator/kube-prometheus/blob/main/docs/monitoring-other-namespaces.md)。"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:416
msgid "Alternatively, you can give the Prometheus Operator permissions to monitor other namespaces using RBAC. See the Prometheus Operator [Enable RBAC rules for Prometheus pods](https://github.com/prometheus-operator/prometheus-operator/blob/main/Documentation/user-guides/getting-started.md#enable-rbac-rules-for-prometheus-pods) documentation to know how to enable the permissions on the namespace where the `ServiceMonitor` and manager exist."
msgstr "另外，您可以使用 RBAC 为 Prometheus Operator 授权以监控其他命名空间。有关如何在 `ServiceMonitor` 和管理者所在命名空间启用权限，请参阅 Prometheus Operator 的 [为 Prometheus pods 启用 RBAC 规则](https://github.com/prometheus-operator/prometheus-operator/blob/main/Documentation/user-guides/getting-started.md#enable-rbac-rules-for-prometheus-pods) 文档。"

#: src/reference/metrics.md:422
msgid "Also, notice that the metrics are exported by default through port `8443`. In this way, you are able to check the Prometheus metrics in its dashboard. To verify it, search for the metrics exported from the namespace where the project is running `{namespace=\"<project>-system\"}`. See an example:"
msgstr "另外，请注意，指标默认通过端口 `8443` 导出。这样，您就可以在 Prometheus 仪表板中检查指标。要验证此操作，请搜索来自项目运行所在命名空间的指标 `{namespace=\"<project>-system\"}`。请看以下示例："

