#: src/reference/project-config.md:72
msgid "Why store the plugins and data used?"
msgstr "为何存储所用插件与数据？"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:74
msgid "Following some examples of motivations to track the input used:"
msgstr "以下是一些追踪使用输入的动机示例："

#: src/reference/project-config.md:75
msgid "check if a plugin can or cannot be scaffolded on top of an existing plugin (i.e.) plugin compatibility while chaining multiple of them together."
msgstr "检查一个插件是否可以在现有插件的基础上创建（即）插件兼容性，同时将多个插件连接在一起。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:76
msgid "what operations can or cannot be done such as verify if the layout allows API(s) for different groups to be scaffolded for the current configuration or not."
msgstr "可以进行或不能进行的操作，例如验证当前配置是否允许为不同组搭建API的布局。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:77
msgid "verify what data can or cannot be used in the CLI operations such as to ensure that WebHooks can only be created for pre-existent API(s)"
msgstr "验证在CLI操作中可以或不能使用哪些数据，例如确保WebHooks只能为已存在的API创建。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:79
msgid "Note that KubeBuilder is not only a CLI tool but can also be used as a library to allow users to create their plugins/tools, provide helpers and customizations on top of their existing projects - an example of which is [Operator-SDK](https://sdk.operatorframework.io/). SDK leverages KubeBuilder to create plugins to allow users to work with other languages and provide helpers for their users to integrate their projects with, for example, the [Operator Framework solutions/OLM](https://olm.operatorframework.io/). You can check the [plugin's documentation](../plugins/creating-plugins.html#why-use-the-kubebuilder-style) to know more about creating custom plugins."
msgstr "请注意，KubeBuilder 不仅是一个 CLI 工具，还可以用作库，让用户创建他们的插件/工具，提供帮助程序和定制，以支持他们现有的项目 - 其中一个例子是 [Operator-SDK](https://sdk.operatorframework.io/)。SDK 利用 KubeBuilder 创建插件，允许用户使用其他语言，并为用户提供帮助，以便他们将项目与例如 [Operator Framework 解决方案/OLM](https://olm.operatorframework.io/) 集成。您可以查看 [插件文档](../plugins/creating-plugins.html#why-use-the-kubebuilder-style) 以了解更多关于创建自定义插件的信息。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:81
msgid "Additionally, another motivation for the PROJECT file is to help us to create a feature that allows users to easily upgrade their projects by providing helpers that automatically re-scaffold the project. By having all the required metadata regarding the APIs, their configurations and versions in the PROJECT file. For example, it can be used to automate the process of re-scaffolding while migrating between plugin versions. ([More info](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/helper_to_upgrade_projects_by_rescaffolding.md))."
msgstr "此外，PROJECT 文件的另一个目的，是帮助我们创建一个功能，使用户能够通过提供自动重新搭建项目的辅助工具，轻松升级他们的项目。PROJECT 文件中包含了有关 API、其配置和版本的所有必要元数据。例如，它可以用于自动化在插件版本之间迁移时重新搭建的过程。 ([更多信息](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/designs/helper_to_upgrade_projects_by_rescaffolding.md))。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:83
msgid "Versioning"
msgstr "版本控制"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:85
msgid "The Project config is versioned according to its layout. For further information see [Versioning](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/VERSIONING.md#Versioning)."
msgstr "项目配置是根据其布局进行版本控制的。欲了解更多信息，请参见 [版本控制](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/VERSIONING.md#Versioning)。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:87
msgid "Layout definition"
msgstr "布局定义"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:89
msgid "The `PROJECT` version `3` layout looks like:"
msgstr "`PROJECT` 版本 `3` 的布局如下："

#: src/reference/project-config.md:105
#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:429
msgid "memcached:memcached:1.6.26-alpine3.19"
msgstr "memcached:memcached:1.6.26-alpine3.19"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:112
#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:436
msgid "busybox:1.36.1"
msgstr "busybox:1.36.1"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:149
msgid "Now let us check its layout fields definition:"
msgstr "现在让我们检查一下它的布局字段定义："

#: src/reference/project-config.md:151
msgid "Field"
msgstr "领域"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:153
msgid "`cliVersion`"
msgstr "`cliVersion`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:153
msgid "Used to record the specific CLI version used during project scaffolding with `init`. Helps identifying the version of the tooling employed, aiding in troubleshooting and ensuring compatibility with updates."
msgstr "用于记录使用 `init` 脚手架项目时所用的具体 CLI 版本。有助于识别所用工具链版本，便于排查问题并确保与更新兼容。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:154
msgid "`layout`"
msgstr "`布局`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:154
msgid "Defines the global plugins, e.g. a project `init` with `--plugins=\"go/v4,deploy-image/v1-alpha\"` means that any sub-command used will always call its implementation for both plugins in a chain."
msgstr "定义全局插件，例如，一个项目 `init` 使用 `--plugins=\"go/v4,deploy-image/v1-alpha\"` 意味着所使用的任何子命令将始终按顺序调用这两个插件的实现。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:155
msgid "`domain`"
msgstr "`域`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:155
msgid "Store the domain of the project. This information can be provided by the user when the project is generate with the `init` sub-command and the `domain` flag."
msgstr "存储项目的域名。用户可以在使用 `init` 子命令和 `domain` 标志生成项目时提供此信息。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:156
msgid "`plugins`"
msgstr "`插件`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:156
msgid "Defines the plugins used to do custom scaffolding, e.g. to use the optional `deploy-image/v1-alpha` plugin to do scaffolding for just a specific api via the command `kubebuider create api [options] --plugins=deploy-image/v1-alpha`."
msgstr "定义用于自定义脚手架的插件，例如通过命令 `kubebuilder create api [options] --plugins=deploy-image/v1-alpha` 使用可选的 `deploy-image/v1-alpha` 插件仅为特定 API 创建脚手架。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:157
msgid "`projectName`"
msgstr "`项目名称`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:157
msgid "The name of the project. This is used to scaffold the manager data. By default it is the name of the project directory, however, it can be provided by the user in the `init` sub-command via the `--project-name` flag."
msgstr "项目名称。这将用于构建管理器数据。默认情况下，它是项目目录的名称，但用户可以通过 `init` 子命令中的 `--project-name` 标志提供该名称。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:158
msgid "`repo`"
msgstr "`代码库`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:158
msgid "The project repository which is the Golang module, e.g `github.com/example/myproject-operator`."
msgstr "该项目的代码库是Golang模块，例如 `github.com/example/myproject-operator`。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:159
msgid "`multigroup`"
msgstr "`multigroup`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:159
msgid "**(Optional)** When set to `true`, enables multi-group project layout. APIs are organized into group-specific directories (`api/<group>/<version>/`). Can be set during initialization via `kubebuilder init --multigroup` or enabled/disabled later via `kubebuilder edit --multigroup`. Default is `false` (omitted from PROJECT file)."
msgstr "**（可选）** 设为 `true` 时启用多 group 项目布局。API 组织到特定于 group 的目录（`api/<group>/<version>/`）。可在初始化时通过 `kubebuilder init --multigroup` 设置，或稍后通过 `kubebuilder edit --multigroup` 启用/禁用。默认为 `false`（从 PROJECT 文件中省略）。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:160
msgid "`namespaced`"
msgstr "`namespaced`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:160
msgid "**(Optional)** When set to `true`, configures the project for namespace-scoped deployment. The operator will only watch and manage resources within its deployment namespace, using namespace-scoped RBAC (`Role`/`RoleBinding` instead of `ClusterRole`/`ClusterRoleBinding`). Can be enabled/disabled via `kubebuilder edit --namespaced`. Default is `false` (cluster-scoped, omitted from PROJECT file)."
msgstr "**（可选）** 设为 `true` 时将项目配置为命名空间作用域部署。operator 将仅监视并管理其部署命名空间内的资源，使用命名空间作用域 RBAC（`Role`/`RoleBinding` 而非 `ClusterRole`/`ClusterRoleBinding`）。可通过 `kubebuilder edit --namespaced` 启用/禁用。默认为 `false`（集群作用域，从 PROJECT 文件中省略）。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:161
msgid "`resources`"
msgstr "资源"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:161
msgid "An array of all resources that you scaffolded in the project."
msgstr "项目中所有搭建的资源数组。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:162
msgid "`resources.api`"
msgstr "`resources.api`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:162
msgid "The API scaffolded in the project via the sub-command `create api`."
msgstr "通过子命令 `create api` 在项目中搭建的 API。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:163
msgid "`resources.api.crdVersion`"
msgstr "`resources.api.crdVersion`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:163
msgid "The Kubernetes API version (`apiVersion`) used to do the scaffolding for the CRD resource."
msgstr "用于为 CRD 资源搭建的 Kubernetes API 版本 (`apiVersion`)。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:164
msgid "`resources.api.namespaced`"
msgstr "`resources.api.namespaced`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:164
msgid "The API RBAC permissions which can be namespaced or cluster scoped."
msgstr "API RBAC 权限可以是命名空间级别或集群级别。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:165
msgid "`resources.api.ssa`"
msgstr "`resources.api.ssa`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:165
msgid "**(Optional, Alpha)** When set to `true`, the API was scaffolded with Server-Side Apply support via `create api --ssa`. The scaffold adds the `+genclient` marker and generates apply configurations for the type. Alpha feature: it may change in future releases. Default is `false` (omitted from the PROJECT file)."
msgstr "**（可选，Alpha）** 设为 `true` 时，表示 API 通过 `create api --ssa` 脚手架了 Server-Side Apply 支持。脚手架会添加 `+genclient` marker 并为该类型生成 apply configurations。Alpha 特性：未来版本可能变更。默认为 `false`（从 PROJECT 文件中省略）。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:166
msgid "`resources.controller`"
msgstr "`resources.controller`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:166
msgid "Indicates whether you scaffolded a controller for the API."
msgstr "指示是否为该 API 脚手架生成了控制器。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:167
msgid "`resources.domain`"
msgstr "`resources.domain`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:167
msgid "The domain of the resource that you provided by the `--domain` flag when you initialized the project or via the flag `--external-api-domain` when you used it to scaffold controllers for an [External Type](./using_an_external_resource.md)."
msgstr "在项目初始化时通过 `--domain` 选项提供的资源域名，或者在为 [外部类型](./using_an_external_resource.md) 构建控制器时通过 `--external-api-domain` 选项提供的域名。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:168
msgid "`resources.group`"
msgstr "`resources.group`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:168
msgid "The GKV group of the resource that you provide by the `--group` flag when you use the sub-command `create api`."
msgstr "当使用子命令 `create api` 时，通过 `--group` 标志提供的资源的 GKV 组。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:169
msgid "`resources.version`"
msgstr "`resources.version`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:169
msgid "The GKV version of the resource that you provide by the `--version` flag when you use the sub-command `create api`."
msgstr "当使用子命令 `create api` 时，通过 `--version` 标志提供的资源的 GKV 版本。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:170
msgid "`resources.kind`"
msgstr "`资源.种类`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:170
msgid "Stores the GKV Kind of the resource that you provide by the `--kind` flag when you use the sub-command `create api`."
msgstr "存储 GKV 资源类型，该类型通过执行子命令 `create api` 时提供的 `--kind` 标志来指定。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:171
msgid "`resources.path`"
msgstr "`resources.path`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:171
msgid "The import path for the API resource. It is `<repo>/api/<kind>` unless the API added to the project is an external or core-type. For the core-types scenarios, the paths used are mapped [here](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/pkg/plugins/golang/options.go). Or either the path informed by the flag `--external-api-path`"
msgstr "API资源的导入路径。它将是`<repo>/api/<kind>`，除非添加到项目中的API是外部API或核心类型的API。对于核心类型的场景，使用的路径在[这里](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/pkg/plugins/golang/options.go)进行了映射。或者，可以使用通过标志`--external-api-path`提供的路径。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:172
msgid "`resources.core`"
msgstr "`resources.core`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:172
msgid "It is `true` when  the group used is from Kubernetes API and the API resource is not defined on the project."
msgstr "当使用的组来自Kubernetes API并且项目中未定义API资源时，它为\"真\"。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:173
msgid "`resources.external`"
msgstr "`resources.external`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:173
msgid "It is `true` when you use the flag `--external-api-path` to generate the scaffold for an [External Type](./using_an_external_resource.md)."
msgstr "当使用标志 `--external-api-path` 生成 [外部类型](./using_an_external_resource.md) 的脚手架时，它为 `true`。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:174
msgid "`resources.module`"
msgstr "`resources.module`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:174
msgid "**(Optional)** The Go module path for external API dependencies, optionally including a version (e.g., `github.com/cert-manager/cert-manager@v1.18.2` or just `github.com/cert-manager/cert-manager`). Only used when `external` is `true`. Provided via the `--external-api-module` flag to explicitly pin a specific version in `go.mod` or to specify the module when it cannot be automatically determined from `--external-api-path`. If not provided, `go mod tidy` will resolve the dependency automatically."
msgstr "**（可选）** 外部 API 依赖的 Go 模块路径，可选包含版本（例如 `github.com/cert-manager/cert-manager@v1.18.2` 或仅 `github.com/cert-manager/cert-manager`）。仅当 `external` 为 `true` 时使用。通过 `--external-api-module` 标志提供，以在 `go.mod` 中显式固定特定版本，或在无法从 `--external-api-path` 自动确定模块时指定模块。若未提供，`go mod tidy` 会自动解析依赖。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:175
msgid "`resources.webhooks`"
msgstr "`resources.webhooks`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:175
msgid "Stores the webhooks data when you use the sub-command `create webhook`."
msgstr "当使用子命令 `create webhook` 时，请存储网络钩子数据。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:176
msgid "`resources.webhooks.spoke`"
msgstr "`resources.webhooks.spoke`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:176
msgid "Store the API version that acts as the Spoke with the designated Hub version for conversion webhooks."
msgstr "存储将作为 Spoke 的 API 版本以及用于转换 webhook 的指定 Hub 版本。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:177
msgid "`resources.webhooks.webhookVersion`"
msgstr "`resources.webhooks.webhookVersion`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:177
msgid "The Kubernetes API version (`apiVersion`) used to scaffold the webhook resource."
msgstr "用于搭建 webhook 资源的 Kubernetes API 版本（`apiVersion`）。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:178
msgid "`resources.webhooks.conversion`"
msgstr "`resources.webhooks.conversion`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:178
msgid "It is `true` when the webhook was scaffold with the `--conversion` flag which means that is a conversion webhook."
msgstr "当 webhook 是使用 `--conversion` 标志搭建时，它为 `true`，这意味着这是一个转换 webhook。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:179
msgid "`resources.webhooks.defaulting`"
msgstr "`resources.webhooks.defaulting`"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:179
msgid "It is `true` when the webhook was scaffold with the `--defaulting` flag which means that is a defaulting webhook."
msgstr "当 webhook 使用 `--defaulting` 标志创建时，它是 `true`，这意味着这是一个默认值 webhook。"

#: src/reference/project-config.md:180
msgid "`resources.webhooks.validation`"
msgstr "`resources.webhooks.validation` "

#: src/reference/project-config.md:180
msgid "It is `true` when the webhook was scaffold with the `--programmatic-validation` flag which means that is a validation webhook."
msgstr "当使用 `--programmatic-validation` 标志搭建的 webhook 时，它是 `true`，这意味着它是一个验证 webhook。"

#: src/versions_compatibility_supportability.md:1
msgid "Versions compatibility and supportability"
msgstr "版本兼容性与可支持性"

#: src/versions_compatibility_supportability.md:3
msgid "Projects created by Kubebuilder contain a `Makefile` that installs tools at versions defined during project creation. The main tools included are:"
msgstr "由 Kubebuilder 创建的项目包含一个 `Makefile`，该文件在项目创建时安装定义的版本工具。主要包含的工具有："

#: src/versions_compatibility_supportability.md:6
msgid "[kustomize](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kustomize)"
msgstr "[kustomize](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kustomize)"

#: src/versions_compatibility_supportability.md:7
msgid "[controller-gen](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools)"
msgstr "[controller-gen](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-tools)"

#: src/versions_compatibility_supportability.md:8
msgid "[setup-envtest](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime/tree/main/tools/setup-envtest)"
msgstr "[setup-envtest](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime/tree/main/tools/setup-envtest)"

#: src/versions_compatibility_supportability.md:10
msgid "Additionally, these projects include a `go.mod` file specifying dependency versions. Kubebuilder relies on [controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime) and its Go and Kubernetes dependencies. Therefore, the versions defined in the `Makefile` and `go.mod` files are the ones that have been tested, supported, and recommended."
msgstr "此外，这些项目包含一个 `go.mod` 文件，用于指定依赖项的版本。Kubebuilder 依赖于 [controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime) 及其 Go 和 Kubernetes 依赖项。因此，`Makefile` 和 `go.mod` 文件中定义的版本是经过测试、支持和推荐的版本。"

#: src/versions_compatibility_supportability.md:14
msgid "Each minor version of Kubebuilder is tested with a specific minor version of client-go. While a Kubebuilder minor version _may_ be compatible with other client-go minor versions, or other tools, this compatibility is not guaranteed, supported, or tested."
msgstr "每个 Kubebuilder 次要版本都会与特定的 client-go 次要版本一起测试。某个 Kubebuilder 次要版本_可能_兼容其他 client-go 次要版本或其他工具，但此类兼容性不受保证、不受支持，也未经测试。"

#: src/versions_compatibility_supportability.md:18
msgid "The minimum Go version required by Kubebuilder is determined by the highest minimum Go version required by its dependencies. This is usually aligned with the minimum Go version required by the corresponding `k8s.io/*` dependencies."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 所需的最小 Go 版本是由其依赖项所需的最高最小 Go 版本决定的。通常，这与相应的 `k8s.io/*` 依赖项所需的最小 Go 版本保持一致。"

#: src/versions_compatibility_supportability.md:22
msgid "Compatible `k8s.io/*` versions, client-go versions, and minimum Go versions can be found in the `go.mod` file scaffolded for each project for each [tag release](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tags)."
msgstr "兼容的 `k8s.io/*` 版本、client-go 版本和最低 Go 版本可以在每个项目的 `go.mod` 文件中找到，该文件是为每个 [标签发布](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tags) 划定的。"

#: src/versions_compatibility_supportability.md:25
msgid "**Example:** For the `4.1.1` release, the minimum Go version compatibility is `1.22`. You can refer to the samples in the testdata directory of the tag released [v4.1.1](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/v4.1.1/testdata), such as the [go.mod](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/v4.1.1/testdata/project-v4/go.mod#L3) file for `project-v4`. You can also check the tools versions supported and tested for this release by examining the [Makefile](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/v4.1.1/testdata/project-v4/Makefile#L160-L165)."
msgstr "**示例：** 对于 `4.1.1` 版本，最低的 Go 版本兼容性是 `1.22`。您可以参考在发布标签 [v4.1.1](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/v4.1.1/testdata) 的 testdata 目录中的示例，例如 `project-v4` 的 [go.mod](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/v4.1.1/testdata/project-v4/go.mod#L3) 文件。您还可以通过检查 [Makefile](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/v4.1.1/testdata/project-v4/Makefile#L160-L165) 来查看此版本支持和测试的工具版本。"

#: src/versions_compatibility_supportability.md:30
msgid "Operating systems supported"
msgstr "支持的操作系统"

#: src/versions_compatibility_supportability.md:32
msgid "Kubebuilder officially supports macOS and Linux platforms. If you are using Windows, see the [Windows instructions](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/docs/windows.md)."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 官方支持 macOS 与 Linux。若使用 Windows，请参见 [Windows 说明](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/blob/master/docs/windows.md)。"

#: src/versions_compatibility_supportability.md:34
msgid "Contributions towards supporting Windows are not planned."
msgstr "目前没有计划接受用于支持 Windows 的贡献。"

#: src/versions_compatibility_supportability.md:39
msgid "After using the CLI to create your project, you are free to customize it as you see fit. Bear in mind, that it is not recommended to deviate from the proposed layout unless you know what you are doing."
msgstr "使用 CLI 创建项目后，可按需自定义。请注意：除非清楚后果，否则不建议偏离推荐布局。"

#: src/versions_compatibility_supportability.md:43
msgid "For example, you should refrain from moving the scaffolded files; doing so makes it difficult to upgrade your project in the future. You may also lose the ability to use some of the CLI features and helpers. For further information on the project layout, see the doc [What's in a basic project?](./cronjob-tutorial/basic-project.md)"
msgstr "例如，应避免移动脚手架文件；否则日后升级会更困难，也可能无法使用部分 CLI 功能与辅助工具。关于项目布局，参见文档[一个基本项目都包含了什么？](./cronjob-tutorial/basic-project.md)"

#: src/plugins/plugins.md:3
msgid "Kubebuilder's architecture is fundamentally plugin-based. This design enables the Kubebuilder CLI to evolve while maintaining backward compatibility with older versions, allowing users to opt-in or opt-out of specific features, and enabling seamless integration with external tools."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 的架构本质上是基于插件的。这种设计使得 Kubebuilder CLI 能够不断发展，同时与旧版本保持向后兼容，允许用户选择是否使用特定功能，并实现与外部工具的无缝集成。"

#: src/plugins/plugins.md:9
msgid "By leveraging plugins, projects can extend Kubebuilder and use it as a library to support new functionalities or implement custom scaffolding tailored to their users' needs. This flexibility allows maintainers to build on top of Kubebuilder’s foundation, adapting it to specific use cases while benefiting from its powerful scaffolding engine."
msgstr "通过利用插件，项目可以扩展 Kubebuilder，并将其作为库来支持新功能或实现针对用户需求的自定义脚手架。这种灵活性使维护者能够在 Kubebuilder 的基础上进行构建，适应特定的用例，同时受益于其强大的脚手架引擎。"

#: src/plugins/plugins.md:15
msgid "Plugins offer several key advantages:"
msgstr "插件提供了几个关键优势："

#: src/plugins/plugins.md:17
msgid "**Backward compatibility**: Ensures older layouts and project structures remain functional with newer versions."
msgstr "**向后兼容性**：确保旧的布局和项目结构在新版本中仍然可用。"

#: src/plugins/plugins.md:18
msgid "**Customization**: Allows users to opt-in or opt-out for specific features (i.e. [Grafana](./available/grafana-v1-alpha.md) and [Deploy Image](./available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md) plugins)"
msgstr "**定制化**：允许用户选择启用或禁用特定功能（即 [Grafana](./available/grafana-v1-alpha.md) 和 [Deploy Image](./available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md) 插件）"

#: src/plugins/plugins.md:19
msgid "**Extensibility**: Facilitates integration with third-party tools and projects that wish to provide their own [External Plugins](./extending/external-plugins.md), which can be used alongside Kubebuilder to modify and enhance project scaffolding or introduce new features."
msgstr "**可扩展性**：促进与希望提供自己 [外部插件](./extending/external-plugins.md) 的第三方工具和项目的集成，这些插件可以与 Kubebuilder 一起使用，以修改和增强项目的脚手架或引入新功能。"

#: src/plugins/plugins.md:21
msgid "**For example, to initialize a project with multiple global plugins:**"
msgstr "**例如，要初始化一个包含多个全局插件的项目：**"

#: src/plugins/plugins.md:27
msgid "**For example, to apply custom scaffolding using specific plugins:**"
msgstr "**例如，要使用特定插件应用自定义脚手架：**"

#: src/plugins/plugins.md:37
msgid "This section details the available plugins, how to extend Kubebuilder, and how to create your own plugins while following the same layout structures."
msgstr "本节详细介绍可用的插件、如何扩展 Kubebuilder，以及如何在遵循相同布局结构的情况下创建自己的插件。"

