#: src/plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md:1
msgid "AutoUpdate (`autoupdate/v1-alpha`)"
msgstr "自动更新（`autoupdate/v1-alpha`）"

#: src/plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md:3
msgid "Keeping your Kubebuilder project up to date with the latest improvements shouldn't be a chore. With a small amount of setup, you can receive **automatic Pull Request** suggestions whenever a new Kubebuilder release is available — keeping your project **maintained, secure, and aligned with ecosystem changes**."
msgstr "让你的 Kubebuilder 项目跟上最新改进不应成为负担。只需少量配置，即可在有新的 Kubebuilder 发布时收到**自动 Pull Request**建议——使项目保持**可维护、安全，并与生态变化对齐**。"

#: src/plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md:7
msgid "This automation uses the [`kubebuilder alpha update`](./../../reference/commands/alpha_update.md) command with a **3-way merge strategy** to refresh your project scaffold, and wraps it in a GitHub Actions workflow that opens an **Issue** with a **Pull Request compare link** so you can create the PR and review it."
msgstr "该自动化使用 [`kubebuilder alpha update`](./../../reference/commands/alpha_update.md) 命令，采用**三方合并策略**刷新项目脚手架，并将其封装在 GitHub Actions workflow 中：会打开一个带有 **Pull Request 比较链接**的 **Issue**，便于你创建 PR 并审查。"

#: src/plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md:13
msgid "This workflow by default **only** creates and pushes the merged files to a branch called `kubebuilder-update-from-<from-version>-to-<to-version>`."
msgstr "默认情况下，此 workflow **仅**将合并后的文件创建并推送到名为 `kubebuilder-update-from-<from-version>-to-<to-version>` 的分支。"

#: src/plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md:16
msgid "To keep your codebase safe, use branch protection rules to ensure that changes are not pushed or merged without proper review."
msgstr "为保障代码库安全，请使用分支保护规则，确保变更未经适当审查不得推送或合并。"

#: src/plugins/available/autoupdate-v1-alpha.md:24
msgid "When you want to reduce the burden of keeping the project updated and well-maintained."
msgstr "当你希望减轻保持项目更新与良好维护的负担时。"

