#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:1
msgid "Deploy Image Plugin (deploy-image/v1-alpha)"
msgstr "部署图像插件 (deploy-image/v1-alpha)"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:3
msgid "The `deploy-image` plugin allows users to create [controllers](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime) and custom resources that deploy and manage container images on the cluster, following Kubernetes best practices. It simplifies the complexities of deploying images while allowing users to customize their projects as needed."
msgstr "`deploy-image` 插件允许用户创建 [控制器](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime) 和自定义资源，以在集群上部署和管理容器镜像，遵循 Kubernetes 的最佳实践。它简化了镜像部署的复杂性，同时允许用户根据需要自定义他们的项目。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:5
msgid "By using this plugin, you will get:"
msgstr "通过使用此插件，您将获得："

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:7
msgid "A controller implementation to deploy and manage an Operand (image) on the cluster."
msgstr "一个控制器实现，用于在集群上部署和管理操作数（镜像）。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:8
msgid "Tests to verify the reconciliation logic, using [ENVTEST](./../../reference/envtest.md)."
msgstr "测试以验证对账逻辑，使用 [ENVTEST](./../../reference/envtest.md)。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:9
msgid "Custom resource samples updated with the necessary specifications."
msgstr "自定义资源样本已更新至所需规格。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:10
msgid "Environment variable support for managing the Operand (image) within the manager."
msgstr "环境变量支持用于管理管理器中的操作数（镜像）。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:15
msgid "See the `project-v4-with-plugins` directory under the [testdata](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/testdata/project-v4-with-plugins) directory in the Kubebuilder project to check an example of scaffolding created using this plugin."
msgstr "请查看 Kubebuilder 项目中的 [testdata](./.././../../../../testdata/project-v4-with-plugins) 目录下的 `project-v4-with-plugins` 目录，以查看使用此插件创建的脚手架示例。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:19
msgid "The following command scaffolded the `Memcached` API and its controller:"
msgstr "以下命令脚手架生成了 `Memcached` API 及其控制器："

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:21
msgid ""
"```shell\n"
"kubebuilder create api \\\n"
"  --group example.com \\\n"
"  --version v1alpha1 \\\n"
"  --kind Memcached \\\n"
"  --image=memcached:memcached:1.6.26-alpine3.19 \\\n"
"  --image-container-command=\"memcached,--memory-limit=64,-o,modern,-v\" \\\n"
"  --image-container-port=\"11211\" \\\n"
"  --run-as-user=\"1001\" \\\n"
"  --plugins=\"deploy-image/v1-alpha\"\n"
"```"
msgstr "```shellkubebuilder create api   --group example.com   --version v1alpha1   --kind Memcached   --image=memcached:memcached:1.6.26-alpine3.19   --image-container-command=\"memcached,--memory-limit=64,-o,modern,-v\"   --image-container-port=\"11211\"   --run-as-user=\"1001\"   --plugins=\"deploy-image/v1-alpha\"```\""

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:33
msgid "The following command created the `Busybox` API:"
msgstr "以下命令创建了 `Busybox` API："

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:35
msgid ""
"```shell\n"
"kubebuilder create api \\\n"
"  --group example.com \\\n"
"  --version v1alpha1 \\\n"
"  --kind Busybox \\\n"
"  --image=busybox:1.36.1 \\\n"
"  --plugins=\"deploy-image/v1-alpha\"\n"
"```"
msgstr "```shellkubebuilder create api \\  --group example.com \\  --version v1alpha1 \\  --kind Busybox \\  --image=busybox:1.36.1 \\  --plugins=\"deploy-image/v1-alpha\"```\""

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:48
msgid "This plugin is ideal for users who are just getting started with Kubernetes operators."
msgstr "这个插件非常适合刚开始使用 Kubernetes operator 的用户。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:49
msgid "It helps users deploy and manage an image (Operand) using the [Operator pattern](https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/extend-kubernetes/operator/)."
msgstr "它帮助用户使用[Operator模式](https://kubernetes.io/docs/concepts/extend-kubernetes/operator/)部署和管理镜像（操作数）。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:50
msgid "If you are looking for a quick and efficient way to set up a custom controller and manage a container image, this plugin is a great choice."
msgstr "如果您正在寻找一种快速有效的方法来设置自定义控制器并管理容器镜像，这个插件是一个很好的选择。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:54
msgid "**Initialize your project**: After creating a new project with `kubebuilder init`, you can use this plugin to create APIs. Ensure that you have completed the [quick start](./../../quick-start.md) guide before proceeding."
msgstr "**初始化您的项目**：在使用 `kubebuilder init` 创建新项目后，您可以使用此插件来创建 API。在继续之前，请确保您已完成 [快速入门](./../../quick-start.md) 指南。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:59
msgid "**Create APIs**: With this plugin, you can [create APIs](../../cronjob-tutorial/new-api.md) to specify the image (Operand) you want to deploy on the cluster. You can also optionally specify the command, port, and security context using various flags:"
msgstr "**创建 API**：使用此插件，您可以[创建 API](../../cronjob-tutorial/new-api.md)，以指定您想要在集群上部署的图像（操作数）。您还可以使用各种标志可选地指定命令、端口和安全上下文："

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:62
msgid "Example command:"
msgstr "示例命令："

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:64
msgid "\"memcached,--memory-limit=64,modern,-v\""
msgstr "\"memcached,--memory-limit=64,modern,-v\""

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:70
msgid "When running the project locally with `make run`, the Operand image provided is stored as an environment variable in the `config/manager/manager.yaml` file."
msgstr "在本地运行项目时使用 `make run`，提供的 Operand 镜像将作为环境变量存储在 `config/manager/manager.yaml` 文件中。"

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:74
msgid "Ensure you export the environment variable before running the project locally, such as:"
msgstr "确保在本地运行项目之前导出环境变量，例如："

#: src/plugins/available/deploy-image-plugin-v1-alpha.md:76
msgid ""
"```shell\n"
"export MEMCACHED_IMAGE=\"memcached:1.4.36-alpine\"\n"
"```"
msgstr "```shellexport MEMCACHED_IMAGE=\"memcached:1.4.36-alpine\"```\""

