#: src/plugins/available/go-v4-plugin.md:5
msgid "Kubebuilder scaffolds using the `go/v4` plugin only if specified when initializing the project. This plugin is a composition of the `kustomize.common.kubebuilder.io/v2` and `base.go.kubebuilder.io/v4` plugins using the [Bundle Plugin](./../../../../../pkg/plugin/bundle.go). It scaffolds a project template that helps in constructing sets of [controllers](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime)."
msgstr "Kubebuilder 仅在初始化项目时指定时，使用 `go/v4` 插件进行脚手架搭建。该插件是 `kustomize.common.kubebuilder.io/v2` 和 `base.go.kubebuilder.io/v4` 插件的组合，使用了 [Bundle Plugin](./../../../../../pkg/plugin/bundle.go)。它搭建了一个项目模板，帮助构建一组 [控制器](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime)。"

#: src/plugins/available/go-v4-plugin.md:10
msgid "By following the [quickstart](./../../quick-start.md) and creating any project, you is using this plugin by default."
msgstr "通过按照 [快速入门](./../../quick-start.md) 并创建任何项目，您将默认使用该插件。"

#: src/plugins/available/go-v4-plugin.md:16
msgid "You can check samples using this plugin by looking at the `project-v4-<options>` projects under the [testdata](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/testdata) directory on the root directory of the Kubebuilder project."
msgstr "您可以通过查看 Kubebuilder 项目根目录下 [testdata](./../../../../../testdata) 目录中的 `project-v4-<options>` 项目来使用此插件检查示例。"

