#: src/plugins/available/grafana-v1-alpha.md:1
msgid "Grafana Plugin (`grafana/v1-alpha`)"
msgstr "Grafana 插件 (`grafana/v1-alpha`)"

#: src/plugins/available/grafana-v1-alpha.md:3
msgid "The Grafana plugin is an optional plugin that can be used to scaffold Grafana Dashboards to allow you to check out the default metrics which are exported by projects using [controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime)."
msgstr "Grafana 插件是一个可选的插件，可以用于搭建 Grafana 仪表板，以便您检查由使用 [controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime) 的项目导出的默认指标。"

#: src/plugins/available/grafana-v1-alpha.md:11
msgid "You can check its default scaffold by looking at the `project-v4-with-plugins` projects under the [testdata](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/testdata/project-v4-with-plugins) directory on the root directory of the Kubebuilder project."
msgstr "您可以通过查看Kubebuilder项目根目录下的[testdata](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/tree/master/testdata/project-v4-with-plugins)目录中的`project-v4-with-plugins`项目来检查其默认骨架。"

#: src/plugins/available/grafana-v1-alpha.md:18
msgid "If you are looking to observe the metrics exported by [controller metrics](./../../reference/metrics-reference.md) and collected by Prometheus via [Grafana](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/next/)."
msgstr "如果您想查看由[控制器指标](./../../reference/metrics-reference.md)导出并通过[Grafana](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/next/)由Prometheus收集的指标。"

#: src/plugins/available/grafana-v1-alpha.md:24
msgid "Prerequisites:"
msgstr "先决条件："

#: src/plugins/available/grafana-v1-alpha.md:26
msgid "Your project must be using [controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime) to expose the metrics via the [controller default metrics](./../../reference/metrics-reference.md) and they need to be collected by Prometheus."
msgstr "您的项目必须使用 [controller-runtime](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/controller-runtime) 通过 [控制器默认指标](./../../reference/metrics-reference.md) 来暴露指标，并且这些指标需要被 Prometheus 收集。"

#: src/plugins/available/grafana-v1-alpha.md:27
msgid "Access to [Prometheus](https://prometheus.io/docs/introduction/overview/)."
msgstr "访问 [Prometheus](https://prometheus.io/docs/introduction/overview/)。"

