msgstr "手动安装并启用全部功能："

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:389
msgid "For charts without conversion webhooks, disable the manager and all optional components by setting all of these values to `false`:"
msgstr "对于没有转换 Webhook 的 Chart，可通过将以下所有 values 设为 `false` 来禁用 Manager 及所有可选组件："

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:402
msgid "For charts without conversion webhooks, install without webhooks:"
msgstr "对于没有转换 Webhook 的 Chart，可在不启用 Webhook 的情况下安装："

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:408
msgid "`webhook.enabled=false` skips the webhook Service, the webhook configurations, the webhook NetworkPolicy, and the `webhook-server` container port. It also sets `--webhook-port=-1` to disable the webhook server. This works like `metrics.enabled=false`, which passes `--metrics-bind-address=0`."
msgstr "`webhook.enabled=false` 会跳过 webhook Service、webhook 配置、webhook NetworkPolicy 以及 `webhook-server` 容器端口。还会设置 `--webhook-port=-1` 以禁用 Webhook 服务器。这与 `metrics.enabled=false`（传入 `--metrics-bind-address=0`）类似。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:413
msgid "Older controller-runtime releases treat `--webhook-port=-1` as the default `9443`. The manager then tries to start the webhook server without a certificate and fails. See [Disabling the webhook server](../../reference/webhook-overview.md#disabling-the-webhook-server)."
msgstr "较旧的 controller-runtime 发行版会将 `--webhook-port=-1` 视为默认值 `9443`。随后 Manager 会在没有证书的情况下尝试启动 Webhook 服务器并失败。参见[禁用 Webhook 服务器](../../reference/webhook-overview.md#disabling-the-webhook-server)。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:417
msgid "Charts with CR version conversion reject `webhook.enabled=false`. The API server needs the webhook Service to convert custom resources."
msgstr "带有 CR 版本转换的 Chart 会拒绝 `webhook.enabled=false`。API 服务器需要 Webhook Service 来转换自定义资源。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:419
msgid "Install with NetworkPolicy resources:"
msgstr "安装并包含 NetworkPolicy 资源："

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:425
msgid "Extra volumes"
msgstr "额外卷"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:427
msgid "Add volumes and volume mounts to the manager deployment beyond webhook and metrics certificates."
msgstr "向 Manager 部署添加 Webhook 与 metrics 证书之外的卷和卷挂载。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:429
msgid "Volumes in your kustomize configuration (`config/manager/manager.yaml` or patches) are written to the chart template. When the manager has extra volumes, `values.yaml` includes `manager.extraVolumes` and `manager.extraVolumeMounts` fields. Use these to add more volumes at install time."
msgstr "kustomize 配置（`config/manager/manager.yaml` 或补丁）中的卷会写入 Chart 模板。当 Manager 有额外卷时，`values.yaml` 会包含 `manager.extraVolumes` 和 `manager.extraVolumeMounts` 字段。可用它们在安装时添加更多卷。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:431
msgid "Webhook and metrics certificates (`webhook-certs`, `metrics-certs`) are managed separately and controlled by `certManager.enabled` and (for metrics TLS) `metrics.enabled` + `metrics.secure`."
msgstr "Webhook 与 metrics 证书（`webhook-certs`、`metrics-certs`）单独管理，由 `certManager.enabled` 以及（针对 metrics TLS）`metrics.enabled` + `metrics.secure` 控制。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:435
msgid "`metrics.port`"
msgstr "`metrics.port`"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:437
msgid "Set `metrics.port` to change the port used by the metrics endpoint. The chart applies the same value to the manager `--metrics-bind-address` argument, the metrics Service port and targetPort, and the metrics NetworkPolicy."
msgstr "设置 `metrics.port` 可更改 metrics 端点使用的端口。Chart 会将该值同时应用于 Manager 的 `--metrics-bind-address` 参数、metrics Service 的 port 与 targetPort，以及 metrics NetworkPolicy。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:439
msgid "For example, install the chart with the metrics endpoint on port `8444`:"
msgstr "例如，将 Chart 安装为在端口 `8444` 上提供 metrics 端点："

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:445
msgid "The default is `8443`, detected from your project configuration."
msgstr "默认值为 `8443`，从项目配置中检测得出。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:447
msgid "`metrics.secure`"
msgstr "`metrics.secure`"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:449
msgid "Control transport security and authentication for the metrics endpoint (default: `true`)."
msgstr "控制 metrics 端点的传输安全与身份认证（默认：`true`）。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:451
msgid "When `true`:"
msgstr "当为 `true` 时："

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:452
msgid "Uses HTTPS with TLS certificates (when `certManager.enabled=true`)"
msgstr "使用带 TLS 证书的 HTTPS（当 `certManager.enabled=true` 时）"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:453
msgid "Creates `metrics-auth-role` ClusterRole for authentication"
msgstr "创建用于身份认证的 `metrics-auth-role` ClusterRole"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:454
msgid "ServiceMonitor uses HTTPS"
msgstr "ServiceMonitor 使用 HTTPS"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:456
msgid "When `false`:"
msgstr "当为 `false` 时："

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:457
msgid "Uses HTTP without authentication"
msgstr "使用无认证的 HTTP"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:458
msgid "No TLS certificates"
msgstr "无 TLS 证书"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:459
msgid "ServiceMonitor uses HTTP"
msgstr "ServiceMonitor 使用 HTTP"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:464
msgid "The `metrics-auth-role` and `metrics-reader` are always ClusterRoles, even when `rbac.namespaced=true`. Metrics authentication uses cluster-scoped APIs for authenticating scrapers like Prometheus."
msgstr "即使 `rbac.namespaced=true`，`metrics-auth-role` 和 `metrics-reader` 也始终是 ClusterRole。Metrics 身份认证使用集群作用域 API 来认证像 Prometheus 这样的抓取器。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:468
msgid "Webhook port configuration"
msgstr "Webhook 端口配置"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:470
msgid "Set `webhook.port` to change the manager argument, container port, Service target port, and NetworkPolicy. The Service's exposed port remains unchanged (`443` in the default manifests)."
msgstr "设置 `webhook.port` 可更改 Manager 参数、容器端口、Service target port 和 NetworkPolicy。Service 对外暴露的端口保持不变（默认清单中为 `443`）。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:472
msgid "For example, install the chart with the webhook server on port `9444`:"
msgstr "例如，将 Chart 安装为在端口 `9444` 上运行 Webhook 服务器："

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:478
msgid "The default is `9443`, detected from your project configuration. To disable the webhook server, set `webhook.enabled=false` instead of changing the port."
msgstr "默认值为 `9443`，从项目配置中检测得出。要禁用 Webhook 服务器，请设置 `webhook.enabled=false`，而不是更改端口。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:480
msgid "Health probe port configuration"
msgstr "健康探针端口配置"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:482
msgid "Set `manager.healthProbe.port` to change the port where the manager serves its health probes. The liveness (`/healthz`) and readiness (`/readyz`) endpoints bind to this port. The chart applies the same value to the `--health-probe-bind-address` argument, the `health` container port, and the `httpGet` port of both probes."
msgstr "设置 `manager.healthProbe.port` 可更改 Manager 提供健康探针的端口。存活（`/healthz`）与就绪（`/readyz`）端点绑定到该端口。Chart 会将该值同时应用于 `--health-probe-bind-address` 参数、`health` 容器端口，以及两个探针的 `httpGet` 端口。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:484
msgid "For example, install the chart with the health probes on port `8082`:"
msgstr "例如，将 Chart 安装为在端口 `8082` 上提供健康探针："

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:490
msgid "The default is `8081`, detected from your project configuration."
msgstr "默认值为 `8081`，从项目配置中检测得出。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:492
msgid "Passing args for the manager"
msgstr "为 manager 传递参数"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:494
msgid "Use `manager.args` in `values.yaml` to pass extra flags to the manager container that the chart does not expose as dedicated values. The chart renders each entry through Helm's `tpl` function, evaluated against the chart's root context, so an arg can reference other values, release information, or chart template functions instead of only a static string."
msgstr "在 `values.yaml` 中使用 `manager.args`，向 Chart 未作为独立 values 暴露的 Manager 容器传递额外标志。Chart 通过 Helm 的 `tpl` 函数渲染每个条目，并对照 Chart 的根上下文求值，因此参数可以引用其他 values、release 信息或 Chart 模板函数，而不仅是静态字符串。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:496
msgid "For example, set the leader election namespace from the release namespace and add a plain flag:"
msgstr "例如，从 release 命名空间设置 leader election 命名空间，并添加一个普通标志："

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:501
msgid "--leader-election-namespace={{ .Release.Namespace }}"
msgstr "--leader-election-namespace={{ .Release.Namespace }}"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:505
msgid "Helm evaluates `{{ .Release.Namespace }}` at render time, so the manager container receives `--leader-election-namespace=<release-namespace>`. The `--leader-elect` flag has no template syntax, so it renders unchanged."
msgstr "Helm 在渲染时求值 `{{ .Release.Namespace }}`，因此 Manager 容器会收到 `--leader-election-namespace=<release-namespace>`。`--leader-elect` 标志没有模板语法，因此会原样渲染。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:510
msgid "The chart already exposes `--metrics-bind-address`, `--webhook-port`, and `--health-probe-bind-address` as `metrics.port`, `webhook.port`, and `manager.healthProbe.port`. Set those values instead of adding the flags to `manager.args`. The plugin removes these flags from the extracted args when it generates the chart, so adding one back through `manager.args`, templated or not, creates a duplicate flag alongside the value-driven one. The Service, NetworkPolicy, and probes keep using the configured port, so traffic and probes then target the wrong port."
msgstr "Chart 已将 `--metrics-bind-address`、`--webhook-port` 和 `--health-probe-bind-address` 分别暴露为 `metrics.port`、`webhook.port` 和 `manager.healthProbe.port`。请设置这些 values，而不是把标志加入 `manager.args`。插件在生成 Chart 时会从提取的参数中移除这些标志，因此无论是否模板化，通过 `manager.args` 再加回去都会与由 values 驱动的标志重复。Service、NetworkPolicy 和探针仍使用已配置的端口，导致流量与探针指向错误端口。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:514
msgid "NetworkPolicy configuration"
msgstr "NetworkPolicy 配置"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:516
msgid "Set `networkPolicy.enabled: true` to install NetworkPolicy resources for the manager pod."
msgstr "设置 `networkPolicy.enabled: true` 可为 Manager Pod 安装 NetworkPolicy 资源。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:518
msgid "When the kustomize output includes `NetworkPolicy` resources, the plugin converts and enables them. Otherwise, it generates a default metrics policy and, when it detects an admission or CRD conversion webhook, a default webhook policy."
msgstr "当 kustomize 输出包含 `NetworkPolicy` 资源时，插件会转换并启用它们。否则，它会生成默认的 metrics 策略，并在检测到 admission 或 CRD 转换 Webhook 时生成默认的 webhook 策略。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:520
msgid "The plugin preserves default NetworkPolicy templates unless you pass `--force`. Policies from the kustomize output always regenerate, so edit them in `config/network-policy/`."
msgstr "除非传入 `--force`，否则插件会保留默认 NetworkPolicy 模板。来自 kustomize 输出的策略总会重新生成，因此请在 `config/network-policy/` 中编辑它们。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:522
msgid "The generated metrics policy is rendered only when both `networkPolicy.enabled` and `metrics.enabled` are `true`. The generated webhook policy is rendered only when both `networkPolicy.enabled` and `webhook.enabled` are `true`."
msgstr "仅当 `networkPolicy.enabled` 与 `metrics.enabled` 均为 `true` 时，才会渲染生成的 metrics 策略。仅当 `networkPolicy.enabled` 与 `webhook.enabled` 均为 `true` 时，才会渲染生成的 webhook 策略。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:524
msgid "The metrics policy allows ingress only from pods in namespaces labeled `metrics: enabled`. Label each namespace whose pods should scrape metrics:"
msgstr "metrics 策略仅允许来自带有 `metrics: enabled` 标签的命名空间中的 Pod 的入站流量。请为应抓取 metrics 的每个命名空间打标签："

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:530
msgid "The default webhook policy allows ingress from all sources to the manager pod's webhook port. The API server reaches this port through the webhook Service for admission and CRD conversion webhooks. To restrict admission requests by namespace, set `namespaceSelector` on the `MutatingWebhookConfiguration` or `ValidatingWebhookConfiguration`. This setting controls which requests invoke an admission webhook; it does not restrict NetworkPolicy traffic."
msgstr "默认 webhook 策略允许所有来源访问 Manager Pod 的 webhook 端口。API 服务器通过 webhook Service 到达该端口，用于 admission 与 CRD 转换 Webhook。若要按命名空间限制 admission 请求，请在 `MutatingWebhookConfiguration` 或 `ValidatingWebhookConfiguration` 上设置 `namespaceSelector`。该设置控制哪些请求会调用 admission Webhook；它不会限制 NetworkPolicy 流量。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:532
msgid "Custom labels and annotations"
msgstr "自定义标签与注解"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:534
msgid "Add custom labels and annotations using `manager.labels`, `manager.annotations`, `manager.pod.labels`, and `manager.pod.annotations`. Duplicate keys from kustomize are filtered automatically."
msgstr "使用 `manager.labels`、`manager.annotations`、`manager.pod.labels` 和 `manager.pod.annotations` 添加自定义标签与注解。来自 kustomize 的重复键会自动过滤。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:536
msgid "The ServiceAccount and ServiceMonitor resources support the same pattern through `serviceAccount.labels`, `serviceAccount.annotations`, `prometheus.labels`, and `prometheus.annotations`."
msgstr "ServiceAccount 与 ServiceMonitor 资源通过 `serviceAccount.labels`、`serviceAccount.annotations`、`prometheus.labels` 和 `prometheus.annotations` 支持相同模式。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:540
msgid "Set `serviceAccount.enabled: true` (default) to create a ServiceAccount. Set `serviceAccount.enabled: false` to use an existing one:"
msgstr "设置 `serviceAccount.enabled: true`（默认）以创建 ServiceAccount。设置 `serviceAccount.enabled: false` 以使用已有账户："

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:545
msgid "my-existing-sa"
msgstr "my-existing-sa"

