msgid "Helm merges this default into any values file that omits the section, so omitting it keeps creating the account."
msgstr "Helm 会将该默认值合并到省略该节的任何 values 文件中，因此省略它仍会创建账户。"

#: src/plugins/available/helm-v2-alpha.md:557
msgid "When `serviceAccount.enabled: false`, `serviceAccount.name` is required and the chart fails to render without it. Set `name: default` explicitly to use the namespace default ServiceAccount."
msgstr "当 `serviceAccount.enabled: false` 时，`serviceAccount.name` 为必填，未设置时 Chart 渲染会失败。显式设置 `name: default` 以使用命名空间默认 ServiceAccount。"

