#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:184
msgid "Such object that implements the machinery interface will later pass to the execution of scaffold:"
msgstr "实现该机械接口的对象随后将传递给脚手架的执行："

#: src/plugins/extending/extending_cli_features_and_plugins.md:188
msgid ""
"// Scaffold implements cmdutil.Scaffolder\n"
