#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:128
msgid "**Example:** For a plugin `foo.acme.io` version `v2` on Linux, the path would be `$HOME/.config/kubebuilder/plugins/foo.acme.io/v2/foo.acme.io`."
msgstr "**示例：** 对于在 Linux 上的插件 `foo.acme.io` 版本 `v2`，路径将是 `$HOME/.config/kubebuilder/plugins/foo.acme.io/v2/foo.acme.io`。"

#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:130
msgid "Available subcommands"
msgstr "可用子命令"

#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:132
msgid "External plugins can support the following Kubebuilder subcommands:"
msgstr "外部插件可以支持以下 Kubebuilder 子命令："

#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:133
msgid "`init`: Project initialization"
msgstr "`init`: 项目初始化"

#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:134
msgid "`create api`: Scaffold Kubernetes API definitions"
msgstr "`create api`: 创建 Kubernetes API 定义的脚手架"

#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:135
msgid "`create webhook`: Scaffold Kubernetes webhooks"
msgstr "`创建 webhook`: 创建 Kubernetes webhooks 的骨架"

#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:136
msgid "`edit`: Update project configuration"
msgstr "`编辑`: 更新项目配置"

#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:138
msgid "**Optional subcommands for enhanced user experience:**"
msgstr "**可选子命令以增强用户体验：**"

#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:139
msgid "`metadata`: Provide plugin descriptions and examples with the `--help` flag."
msgstr "`metadata`: 提供使用 `--help` 标志的插件描述和示例。"

#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:140
msgid "`flags`: Inform Kubebuilder of supported flags, enabling early error detection."
msgstr "`flags`：通知Kubebuilder支持的标志，以便提前检测错误。"

#: src/plugins/extending/external-plugins.md:145
msgid "The `flags` subcommand in an external plugin allows for early error detection by informing Kubebuilder about the flags the plugin supports. If an unsupported flag is identified, Kubebuilder can issue an error before the plugin is called to execute. If a plugin does not implement the `flags` subcommand, Kubebuilder will pass all flags to the plugin, making it the external plugin's responsibility to handle any invalid flags."
msgstr "外部插件中的 `flags` 子命令允许通过告知 Kubebuilder 插件支持的标志来提前进行错误检测。如果识别到不支持的标志，Kubebuilder 可以在调用插件执行之前发出错误。如果插件没有实现 `flags` 子命令，Kubebuilder 将把所有标志传递给插件，因此处理任何无效标志的责任将由外部插件承担。"

