msgstr "我希望自定义我的项目，使用 [klog](https://github.com/kubernetes/klog) 替代 controller-runtime 提供的 [zap](https://github.com/uber-go/zap)。我该如何使用 `klog` 或其他日志记录器作为项目的日志记录器？"

#: src/faq.md:29
msgid "In the `main.go` you can replace:"
msgstr "在 `main.go` 中，你可以替换："

#: src/faq.md:39
msgid "with:"
msgstr "与："

#: src/faq.md:45
msgid "After `make run`, I see errors like \"unable to find leader election namespace: not running in-cluster...\""
msgstr "在执行 `make run` 后，我看到类似\"无法找到领导者选举命名空间：未在集群内运行...\"的错误。"

#: src/faq.md:47
msgid "You can enable the leader election. However, if you are testing the project locally using the `make run` target which runs the manager outside of the cluster then, you might also need to set the namespace where the manager creates the leader election resource, as follows:"
msgstr "可以启用领导者选举。但若用 `make run` 在集群外本地测试，可能还需要设置 manager 创建领导者选举资源所用的命名空间，如下："

#: src/faq.md:57 src/faq.md:78
