#: src/faq.md:104
msgid "The error `Too long: must have at most 262144 bytes` is faced when I run `make install` to apply the CRD manifests. How to solve it? Why this error is faced?"
msgstr "当我运行 `make install` 来应用 CRD 清单时，出现错误 `过长：必须最多为 262144 字节`。如何解决这个问题？为什么会出现这个错误？"

#: src/faq.md:106
msgid "When attempting to run `make install` to apply the CRD manifests, the error `Too long: must have at most 262144 bytes may be encountered.` This error arises due to a size limit enforced by the Kubernetes API. Note that the `make install` target will apply the CRD manifest under `config/crd` using `kubectl apply -f -`. Therefore, when the apply command is used, the API annotates the object with the `last-applied-configuration` which contains the entire previous configuration. If this configuration is too large, it will exceed the allowed byte size. ([More info](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/manage-kubernetes-objects/declarative-config/#how-to-create-objects))"
msgstr "在尝试运行 `make install` 来应用 CRD 清单时，可能会遇到错误 `Too long: must have at most 262144 bytes`。这个错误是由于 Kubernetes API 强制执行的大小限制所导致。请注意，`make install` 目标将使用 `kubectl apply -f -` 来应用位于 `config/crd` 下的 CRD 清单。因此，当使用 apply 命令时，API 会用 `last-applied-configuration` 注解该对象，该注解包含整个之前的配置。如果这个配置太大，就会超过允许的字节大小。（[更多信息](https://kubernetes.io/docs/tasks/manage-kubernetes-objects/declarative-config/#how-to-create-objects)）"

#: src/faq.md:108
msgid "You have a few options to work around this scenario such as:"
msgstr "可通过以下几种方式规避该场景，例如："

#: src/faq.md:110
msgid "**By removing the descriptions from CRDs:**"
msgstr "**通过从 CRD 中移除描述:**"

#: src/faq.md:112
msgid "[Controller-gen](./reference/controller-gen.html) generates your CRDs. By using the option `maxDescLen=0` to remove the description, you may reduce the size, potentially resolving the issue. To do it you can update the Makefile as the following example and then, call the target `make manifest` to regenerate your CRDs without description, see:"
msgstr "[Controller-gen](./reference/controller-gen.html) 用于生成 CRD。使用 `maxDescLen=0` 去掉描述可减小体积，从而可能解决问题。可按如下示例更新 Makefile，再执行 `make manifest` 重新生成无描述的 CRD，参见："

#: src/faq.md:114
msgid ""
"```shell\n"
"\n"
" .PHONY: manifests\n"
" manifests: controller-gen ## Generate WebhookConfiguration, ClusterRole and CustomResourceDefinition objects.\n"
"     # Note that the option maxDescLen=0 was added in the default scaffold in order to sort out the issue\n"
"     # Too long: must have at most 262144 bytes. By using kubectl apply to create / update resources an annotation\n"
"     # that the K8s API creates to store the latest version of the resource ( kubectl.kubernetes.io/last-applied-configuration).\n"
"     # However, it has a size limit and if the CRD is too big with so many long descriptions as this one it will cause the failure.\n"
" \t$(CONTROLLER_GEN) rbac:roleName=manager-role crd:maxDescLen=0 webhook paths=\"./...\" output:crd:artifacts:config=config/crd/bases\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```shell\n"
"\n"
" .PHONY: manifests\n"
" manifests: controller-gen ## Generate WebhookConfiguration, ClusterRole and CustomResourceDefinition objects.\n"
"     # Note that the option maxDescLen=0 was added in the default scaffold in order to sort out the issue\n"
"     # Too long: must have at most 262144 bytes. By using kubectl apply to create / update resources an annotation\n"
"     # that the K8s API creates to store the latest version of the resource ( kubectl.kubernetes.io/last-applied-configuration).\n"
"     # However, it has a size limit and if the CRD is too big with so many long descriptions as this one it will cause the failure.\n"
" \t$(CONTROLLER_GEN) rbac:roleName=manager-role crd:maxDescLen=0 webhook paths=\"./...\" output:crd:artifacts:config=config/crd/bases\n"
"```"

#: src/faq.md:124
msgid "**By re-design your APIs:**"
msgstr "**通过重新设计您的 API:**"

#: src/faq.md:126
msgid "You can review the design of your APIs and see if it has not more specs than should be by hurting single responsibility principle for example. So that you might to re-design them."
msgstr "您可以审查您的 API 设计，看看它是否有超过应有的规格，从而违反单一职责原则。例如，这样您可能需要重新设计它们。"

#: src/faq.md:128
msgid "**By using Server-Side Apply for CRD installation:**"
msgstr "**使用 Server-Side Apply 安装 CRD：**"

#: src/faq.md:130
msgid "Since this issue happens when CRDs are installed with client-side apply, another option is to install or update the CRDs with Server-Side Apply instead, for example by using `kubectl apply --server-side -f ...`. This avoids storing the full manifest in the `kubectl.kubernetes.io/last-applied-configuration` annotation and can prevent the size-limit failure."
msgstr "该问题出现在用客户端 apply 安装 CRD 时，也可改用 Server-Side Apply 安装或更新 CRD，例如 `kubectl apply --server-side -f ...`。这样不会把完整清单存入 `kubectl.kubernetes.io/last-applied-configuration` 注解，从而可避免大小限制失败。"

#: src/faq.md:132
msgid "If you are updating existing CRDs, `kubectl replace -f ...` may also help, depending on your workflow."
msgstr "若更新已有 CRD，根据工作流，`kubectl replace -f ...` 也可能有帮助。"

#: src/faq.md:137
msgid "Don't confuse the `kubectl apply --server-side` command mentioned above with the `--ssa` flag in Kubebuilder. They are different concepts:"
msgstr "请勿将上文的 `kubectl apply --server-side` 与 Kubebuilder 的 `--ssa` 标志混淆，二者概念不同："

#: src/faq.md:139
msgid "**`kubectl apply --server-side`** (discussed above): A kubectl flag that changes how CRDs are installed to avoid the annotation size limit. This is about CRD installation only."
msgstr "**`kubectl apply --server-side`**（上文所述）：kubectl 标志，改变 CRD 安装方式以避免注解大小限制，仅与 CRD 安装有关。"

#: src/faq.md:141
msgid "**`--ssa` flag**: A Kubebuilder flag (e.g., `kubebuilder create api --ssa`) that scaffolds controllers with runtime behavior for managing resource fields using Server-Side Apply patterns. This is about controller runtime behavior, specifically for scenarios where your controller shares field ownership with users or other controllers. It does NOT change how `make install` applies CRDs."
msgstr "**`--ssa` 标志**：Kubebuilder 标志（如 `kubebuilder create api --ssa`），脚手架出具有运行时行为的控制器，用 Server-Side Apply 模式管理资源字段。这关乎控制器运行时行为，尤其适用于与用户或其他控制器共享字段所有权的场景。它**不会**改变 `make install` 如何应用 CRD。"

#: src/faq.md:143
msgid "See the [Kubernetes Server-Side Apply documentation](https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/using-api/server-side-apply/) to learn more about the Server-Side Apply concept in general."
msgstr "了解 Server-Side Apply 总体概念，参见 [Kubernetes Server-Side Apply 文档](https://kubernetes.io/docs/reference/using-api/server-side-apply/)。"

#: src/faq.md:145
msgid "If you have APIs that do not use Server-Side Apply, ensure they have the `+kubebuilder:ac:generate=false` marker. If you added APIs manually to your project, review them to ensure every kind that should not use Server-Side Apply has this marker. See the [Server-Side Apply](./reference/server-side-apply.md) reference for details."
msgstr "若有不使用 Server-Side Apply 的 API，请确保带有 `+kubebuilder:ac:generate=false` 标记。若手动向项目添加了 API，请检查每个不应使用 Server-Side Apply 的 kind 是否都有该标记。详见 [Server-Side Apply](./reference/server-side-apply.md) 参考。"

