#: src/faq.md:179
msgid "When I build the image with Podman or Buildah, the build fails with `cmd/main.go: no such file or directory`. How to solve it?"
msgstr "用 Podman 或 Buildah 构建镜像时失败，提示 `cmd/main.go: no such file or directory`。如何解决？"

#: src/faq.md:181 src/faq.md:197
msgid "While we do our best to keep the scaffold working with other container tools, Kubebuilder is officially tested and supported with **Docker**."
msgstr "尽管我们尽量让脚手架兼容其他容器工具，但 Kubebuilder 官方测试与支持的是 **Docker**。"

#: src/faq.md:183
msgid "The scaffolded `.dockerignore` re-includes all Go source files with `!**/*.go`. Docker honors this pattern. Podman and Buildah do not: they skip ignored directories, so no Go source reaches the build context. This is tracked upstream in [buildah#6417](https://github.com/containers/buildah/issues/6417) and was reported in [kubebuilder#5181](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/issues/5181)."
msgstr "脚手架生成的 `.dockerignore` 用 `!**/*.go` 重新包含所有 Go 源文件。Docker 会遵守该模式；Podman 与 Buildah 不会：它们会跳过被忽略的目录，导致 Go 源码进不了构建上下文。上游跟踪见 [buildah#6417](https://github.com/containers/buildah/issues/6417)，报告见 [kubebuilder#5181](https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kubebuilder/issues/5181)。"

#: src/faq.md:185
msgid "If you use Podman, re-include your source directories by name in `.dockerignore`:"
msgstr "若使用 Podman，请在 `.dockerignore` 中按目录名重新包含源码目录："

#: src/faq.md:193
msgid "Add any other directory in your project that holds Go source files."
msgstr "再把项目中其他存放 Go 源文件的目录一并加上。"

#: src/faq.md:195
msgid "When I build the image with Podman or Buildah I get `short-name \"golang:1.26\" did not resolve to an alias and no unqualified-search registries are defined`. How to solve it?"
msgstr "用 Podman 或 Buildah 构建镜像时出现 `short-name \"golang:1.26\" did not resolve to an alias and no unqualified-search registries are defined`。如何解决？"

#: src/faq.md:199
msgid "Docker resolves short image names to Docker Hub. Podman and Buildah resolve them from the host, using either the [short-name aliases](https://github.com/containers/shortnames) in [`registries.conf.d`](https://github.com/containers/image/blob/main/docs/containers-registries.conf.d.5.md) or `unqualified-search-registries` in [`registries.conf`](https://github.com/containers/image/blob/main/docs/containers-registries.conf.5.md). You hit this error when the host has neither. Debian 12, for example, ships neither."
msgstr "Docker 会把短镜像名解析到 Docker Hub。Podman 与 Buildah 则在主机上解析：使用 [`registries.conf.d`](https://github.com/containers/image/blob/main/docs/containers-registries.conf.d.5.md) 中的[短名别名](https://github.com/containers/shortnames)，或 [`registries.conf`](https://github.com/containers/image/blob/main/docs/containers-registries.conf.5.md) 中的 `unqualified-search-registries`。主机两者皆无时就会报错。例如 Debian 12 默认都不提供。"

#: src/faq.md:201
msgid "Use one of the options below."
msgstr "使用下列任一方案。"

#: src/faq.md:203
msgid "**Override the base image.** The scaffolded `Dockerfile` exposes it as a [build argument](https://docs.docker.com/reference/dockerfile/#understand-how-arg-and-from-interact):"
msgstr "**覆盖基础镜像。** 脚手架 `Dockerfile` 将其作为[构建参数](https://docs.docker.com/reference/dockerfile/#understand-how-arg-and-from-interact)暴露："

#: src/faq.md:211
msgid ""
"# From Docker Hub\n"
msgstr ""
"# 来自 Docker Hub\n"

#: src/faq.md:213
msgid ""
"# From your own registry or mirror\n"
msgstr ""
"# 来自自有仓库或镜像站\n"

#: src/faq.md:218
msgid "`make docker-buildx` accepts `BASE_IMAGE` too."
msgstr "`make docker-buildx` 同样接受 `BASE_IMAGE`。"

#: src/faq.md:220
msgid "**Or add an alias on the host** for the `golang` short name:"
msgstr "**或在主机上为 `golang` 短名添加别名：**"

#: src/faq.md:222
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"# /etc/containers/registries.conf.d/golang.conf\n"
"[aliases]\n"
"\"golang\" = \"docker.io/library/golang\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```toml\n"
"# /etc/containers/registries.conf.d/golang.conf\n"
"[aliases]\n"
"\"golang\" = \"docker.io/library/golang\"\n"
"```"

#: src/faq.md:228
msgid "A matching alias is used without consulting `unqualified-search-registries`, so it works even when that list is empty. It also ignores the tag, so one entry covers all `golang` tags. Prefer it over adding `docker.io` to the search list, which changes how every unqualified image name resolves on the host. For rootless Podman, use `$HOME/.config/containers/registries.conf.d/golang.conf`."
msgstr "匹配的别名无需查阅 `unqualified-search-registries`，因此该列表为空时也可用。别名还忽略 tag，一条即可覆盖所有 `golang` 标签。相比把 `docker.io` 加进搜索列表（会改变主机上所有非限定镜像名的解析方式），更推荐用别名。无根 Podman 请使用 `$HOME/.config/containers/registries.conf.d/golang.conf`。"

